<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">NG'OLWA TSA VATUMI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ng'olwa tsa Vatumi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ng'olwa tsa Vatumi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ng'ol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">NG'OLWA TSA VATUMI</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chino cha Ng'olwa tsa Vatumi chinsimulila hila chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito fyo chantsitse na hila fyo chatagalye kwantsila ku Yelusalemu na kono ku Wuyawudi na ku Samaliya mbaka ku inyi tsinji, sava sava na malajitso ga Yesu Chilisito kwa vadahitswa vake hoavaga ang'acha kuchipulwa na kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu. Mu sula ya 1:8. Chitabu chino chandikwe na Lukasi yo yuyo yo avaga mwandisi va chitabu cha Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na Lukasi. Uyo Lukasi avaga muganga va ku sibitali na kaha avaga muhimi ndalahela, ahimaga na kwandika ndongwa kota fyo tsin'ganika. Fitabu fino cha Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na Lukasi na chino cha Ng'olwa tsa Vatumi, Lukasi amwandichilye Mujilichi yumwe litawa lyake Tiyofilo. Lechelelo nambe ihyo yikuva fitabu fino avandichilye Vajilichi na Vayawudi veka wo vamutumbye Chilisito. Mu sula ya 1:1.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yinlonjeka kuta chitabu chino chandikwe hagati ha myaka ja sitini mbaka sitini na tsitayi hoavaga kuleleka Yesu Chilisito. Kwasawuli chitabu chinsilila hala Pawulo hoavaga ang'ali kuwopolwa kuhuma mu nyumba ya vawopwa. Lukasi avaga an'jendasa na mutumi Pawulo, ihyo yikuva chitabu chino achandichilye ku muji gwa Andiyochiya. Chitabu chino go mwendeletso gwa Ndongwa Nofu kota fyo tsandikwe na Lukasi, chinkwantsa kwa chinhadisila kuchipulwa kwa Yesu kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu. Choaganaga kwandika Lukasi mu chitabu chino si chili tebe na chila cho aganaga kwandika hoavaga ankwandika chitabu chake cha Ndongwa Nofu. Aganaga Tiyofilo na vanu wo vamutumbilaga Chilisito wo vavaga vankongetseka vawutsele wukweli wa chila chovadahitswaga. Ihyo andiche ndongwa tsa wukweli tsa wumi wa Yesu na kutagalila kwa litumbilo lya Chilisito. Chitabu chino cha Ng'olwa, chingutupela hetwe muhwano gwa hila vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito fyo vichite. Katsi tsino tsovadisile vatumi tsingutulajila hetwe hila fyo tufuluche tuwuhuvile wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu kwa kuwuvikula wujumbe wa Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu kwa vanu vanji.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili muno</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 1:1-8:1, tunsoma kutsa kwa Muhe va Mulungu, kwantsa na kukalagala hamwe na kutagalila kwa chikundi cha Chilisito lya Chilisito.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 8:2-12:33, tunsoma hila Chikundi cha vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito fyo chakolelaga ng'odeko na kwantsa kutagalila mbaka kutali na Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 12:24-14:28, tungumuwona hila Pawulo fyo am'bita kulujendo lwake lulongola lwa kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 15:1-35, tunsoma hila vanu va libalatsa fyo vitang'ine ku Yelusalemu kulamula finu fyo van'ganika vafidite vala vanya litumbilo vapya.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 15:36-18:22, tunguluwona lujendo lwa kavili lwa Pawulo lwa kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 18:23-20:38, tunsoma lujendo lwa kadatu lwa Pawulo.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 21-26, tunsoma hila Pawulo fyo ibatiche mu Nyumba ya Mulungu ku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ya 27-28, hawudugo tunsoma hila Pawulo fyo asindikwe ku Lumi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Muvina Tiyofilo! Mu chitabu changu chilongola ntsakwandichilye, ndongwa tseka tso antsitse Yesu kudita na kudahitsa kuhuma iho hamutalo ha katsi yake, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka siku yila ho avaga kuchipulwa kubita kilanga kwa Mulungu. Hoavaga ang'acha kuchipulwa kubita kilanga, Yesu avapelye malajitso kukolela kwa Muhe va Mulungu vala vatumi wo avahagwe. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Siku alubayini luhuma ha ng'odeko na chifo chake, avahumye vadahitswa vake mala ntsongofu na kuvalonjela ndongwa tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu, na kwa kudita ihyo avalaje nachene kuta mwene atsilipuche. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Luvala lumwe hoavaga kitang'ana nawo akavalajitsaje kuta, “Mwalahogola kuwuka ku Yelusalemu, lechelelo mutsindile wulaho wo avalonje Dada kuta akuvapela chila cho mwahuliche kuhuma kwa heni. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohana avabatitse kwa malenga, lechelelo kwa siku tsino tsa habehi mukubatitswa kwa Muhe va Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anchipulwa kubita Kilanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:19">Matayo 16:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lukasi 24:50-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Ihyo vatumi hovavaga vakong'ine hamwe vakamuputsaje Yesu kuta, “Mutwa mbe, uluno lo luvala lwa kuvapilulila Vaisilaheli wuntsajila?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu akavalonjelaje, “Dada ng'ani yo an'tsela luvala na fipindi fyo afivisile mwene, siyo katsi yenyu kutsela. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Lechelelo hoakuva atsitse Muhe va Mulungu mwilanga mwenyu mukwanuchila wuvetso, na henye mukuva vanu wo mwahuliche na kulonga ndongwa tsangu kwantsila ku Yelusalemu, na ku Wuyawudi, na ku Samaliya, na ku inyi tseka.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Yesu hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso, akachipulwaje kilanga kuno vangumulola, akagubikwaje na lifuluka nawo siva kamuwene kaha. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Hovavaga vang'acha vapomwichwe kulava Kilanga kwa Mulungu, Yesu ho avaga am'bita Kilanga, simusika vakahumilaje valume vavili wovafwite myenda myelu vakimaje habehi nawo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Vakalongaje, “Henye vanu va ku Galilaya, mbona mwimile munlola kuchanya kumafuluka? Uyuno Yesu yo ategulwe kuhuma kwenyu kubita Kilanga kwa Mulungu, akutsa hihyo kota fyo mumuwene am'bita Kilanga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matyasi anhagulwa kutegula hono ha Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Matayo 27:3-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ihyo vatumi vakawuyaje ku Yelusalemu kuhuma ku chila Chidunda cha Mitseyituni cho chavaga habehi na Yelusalemu, kota lujendo lwa chilomita yimwe kuhuma ku muji gwa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Vala vatumi hovavaga kufika ku mujini vakinjilaje mu chumba cha mwilanga chovikalaga, vatumi ivo vavaga Petulo, na Yohana, na Yakobo, na Andeleya, na Fwilipi, na Tomasi, na Batulomayo, na Matayo, na Yakobo mwana va Alufwayo, Simoni yo atovanilaga inyi yake, na Yuda mwana va Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Vanu iwo veka vavaga vankong'ana hamwe kumusuka Mulungu, vavaga hamwe na Maliyamu yuve va Yesu na vadala vatunga na vadodove va Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Siku tsila vanu wo vavaga vamutumbye Chilisito vavaga kota miya na isilini, Petulo akimaje hagati hawo akalongaje kuta, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Henye vang'olotsangu, yiganikije Mandiko ga Mulungu gakwile gala go alontsile Muhe va Mulungu kukolela kwa Dawudi, kwa ndongwa tsa Yuda yo avalongwitse vala vanu vamubate Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda avaga muyetu, kwasawuli na mwene avaga ahagulwe ave muyetu mu katsi yino ya wutumi.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Yuda avaga agutsile mugunda kwa magobole gala go avaga ahombitwe kwa kumupituka Yesu, hoavaga kumugunda akagwaje hasi akatulikaje lileme na lutumbu lwake lweka lukahumaje kivala. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Lulongwa ulo lukatagalilaje kwa vanu veka wo vikalaga ku Yelusalemu, ihyo hono hala vakahatambulilaje litawa “Achedama” chinya kutijila, “Mugunda gwa Danda.”<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Petulo akawilaje kulonga, “Hihilaga yandikwe mu chitabu cha Tsabuli kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">Hawukalo wake havaje mahame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">na kaha halekaje kuva na munu va kikala hono iho na kaha yandikwe kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">munu yunji ahategule hono hake ha wutantsi.”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ihyo tun'ganika tumuhagule munu yunji kuhuma hagati ha valume vala wo vavaga hamwe na hetwe luvala lweka, hala Mutwa Yesu hoavaga an'jendasa hamwe na hetwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />ili alonje ndongwa tso atsiwene na kutsihulika kuhuma siku yila Yohana ho amubatitse Yesu, mbaka siku yila Yesu ho atsilipulwe kuhuma kwetu kubita Kilanga. <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ihyo vakahagulaje matawa ga vanu vavili, mulongola Josefu yo achemwaga Balisaba litawa linji Yusiti, na va kavili achemwaga Matyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Kaha vakamusukaje Mulungu vakalongaje hino, “Heve Mutwa, yo utsitsele numbula tsa vanu veka, utulajile hagati ha vanu vano vavili nani yo umuhagwe, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />ili ategule katsi ya wutumi yo ayilesile Yuda na kubita hono ho ahahagwe mwene.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Ihyo vakavatovelaje simbi ili vamuhagule, na wuhagulo wukamugwilaje Matyasi, uyo akavalilwaje ave hamwe na vala vatumi kumi na yumwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kutsa kwa Muhe va Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Hoyavaga kufika siku ya liwungo lya <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pendekosite yo siku ya hamsini kuhuma liwungo lya Pasaka</char></note>Pendekosite vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito vavaga vakong'ine hono hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Luvala lulo kukahumilaje chibumo kuhuma Kilanga cho chavaga kota ng'ala ngomi, chikayimemyaje nyumba yeka mo vavaga vichite. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Kaha fikahumilaje finu fyo fyawonekaga kota filapi fya moto, fikagavikaje na kuva mwilanga mwa chila munu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Vanu veka vakapelwaje wuvetso na Muhe va Mulungu, na kwantsa kulonga kwa kabila tsinji, kota Muhe va Mulungu fyo avatantsile. <verse eid="ACT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Kuko ku Yelusalemu kwavaga na Vayawudi wo vavaga van'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, wo vavaga vahumye ku chila inyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Hovavaga kuhulika chibumo icho, lilugu lya vanu likakong'asikaje hono hamwe, nawo vakatinukaje kwasawuli chila munu akavahulikaje vanu vala wo vamutumbye Chilisito vanlonga kwa kabila yake mwene. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Veka vakapomokaje na vakilonjelaje, “Mbe, vanu vano veka wo vanlonga si vanya kaye va ku Galilaya nda? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Yiveye ndawuli lelo chila yumwe vetu anguvahulika vanlonga kwa ndonga yetu? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Tuvamwinga tuli vanu va kuhuma ku inyi ya Pati, na ku Medi, na va ku inyi ya Elamu, na vamwinga vanyakaye va ku Misopotamiya, na ku Yudeya, na ku Kapadochiya, na ku Pondo na ku Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Na vamwe va kuhuma ku Filijiya, na ku Pamufiliya, na ku Misili, na lubali lwa ku Libiya habehi na Kwilene na vamwe vajentsi va kuhuma ku Lumi, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />na vanji hetwe tuli Vayawudi vanya kaye, na vamwinga wosi Vayawudi wo vangumuhulikitsa Mulungu kota Vayawudi na vanji vahumye ku Chilete hono hohapilimwe na malenga na vanji va ku Alabiya. Hetwe tweka tunguvahulika vanu vano vanlonga ndongwa ngomi tsa mutinuso tso adisile Mulungu kwa kabila tsetu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Vanu veka vakapomokaje na kususutala kuno vangiputsa kuta, “Ndongwa tsino tsina mana yachi?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Lechelelo vamwinga vakavaditilaje mbedatsi kwa kulonga kuta, “Vanu vano vagatsile difwayi ntsipya!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbikulo ya Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Ihyo Petulo akimaje halutalo ha vala vatumi vayage kumi na yumwe na akantsaje kuvavikulila kwa kuvalonjela kuta, “Nye Vayawudi na henye nyeka yo vanyakaye va Yelusalemu, munyulikitse finofu ndongwa tsino tso ntsinguvavikulila.” <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Petulo akavalonjelaje kuta vanu vano sivagatsile kota fyo munhotsa henye, kwasawuli sambi hano satatu hamilawu hela! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Lechelelo lulongwa luno lo lula lo alontsile Yoweli muloli va Mulungu kuta,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />“Mulungu anlonga kuta, na siku tsa wudugo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">vanu veka nguvapela Muhe vangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Vana venyu vahintsa vakulagula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na vakwamitsi venyu vakulola nduntsuchilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na vavina venyu vakuvila mbilo.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Nachene! Nawo vatantsi vangu valume na vadala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nawo mu siku tsila nguvapela Muhe vangu nawo vakulagula ndongwa tsangu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Heni ngulajila mitinuso kuchanya na kulajila ndajilo hasi mu inyi, danda na moto na lisosi lisito fikuhumila Kilanga,<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />litsuva likugubikwa na jitsa na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">mwetsi gukuva mudung'u kota danda, hoyikuva ying'acha kutsa siku yila ngomi na yinya wuvina wa Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Lechelelo chila munu yo akusuka kwa litawa lya Mutwa akukuluswa.”<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Petulo akendelelaje kuvalonjela kuta henye vanu va Isilaheli munyulikitse cho ntsinlonga! Yesu va Natsaleti avaga munu yo agubulwe kwenyu na Mulungu kwa katsi tsa miwujitsa, na mitinuso na ndajilo tso adisile hagati henyu kwa wuvetso wake, kota henye fyo mun'tsela. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Mulungu mwene fyo aganaga kudita luhuma katali kumutawula Yesu kwa henye, na henye mukamukopolaje kwa kuvakoka vawumiyani ili vamuvambe mu musalaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Lechelelo Mulungu amutsilipwe na kumukulusa mu wusungu wa chifo, kwasawuli siyikakuva lulongwa lupefu mwene Yesu asumwe na wusungu wa chifo. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Kwasawuli muntsajila Dawudi alontsile ndongwa tsa Yesu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">“Ntsamuwene Mutwa avaga halutalo hangu siku tseka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">Kwasawuli ali habehi na heni, singogopa ndaya.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Kwasawuli iyo numbula yangu yina wusangalolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">kaha ntsintova lugulugulu kwa wusangalo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Na heni ngikala kwa lihuvilo nachene,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Kwasawuli iyo heve Mulungu si ufuluche undeche ku inyi ya vanu wo vafweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">na kaha si ukumuleka muhagulwa vako muwuya awolele mukabuli.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Undaje ng'asi yo yim'bita ku wumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">Ukumemetsa wusangalo kwasawuli heve ukuva hamwe na heni.”<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Vang'olotsangu Vaisilaheli, ntsin'gana ntsivalonjele bila kuvafiha kuta kwasawuli ya ndongwa tso tsamupasile kuku vetu Dawudi, mwene afweye na akatsikwaje, na kabuli yake yili bahanago hetu mbaka sambi. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Kwasawuli Dawudi avaga muloli va Mulungu, atselaga hila Mulungu fyo ali amulonje kuta, yumwe va chilelo chake akumuvika mu wuntsajila kota Dawudi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Dawudi alongwe kutsiwona ndongwa tsino, akalongaje ndongwa tso tsikumuhumila Chilisito kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">“Akumutsilipulaje kuhuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">kwa vanu wo vafweye, nambe muvili gwake sigwawotsile.”<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Ihyo Mulungu amutsilipwe uyo Yesu na hetwe tweka wo tunlonga ndongwa tso twahuliche na kutsiwona kuhuma kwake. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yesu hoavaga kutsumitswa na Mulungu, akanuchilaje Muhe va Mulungu kuhuma kwa Dada vake yo avaga atulonje, ili atavale hamwe nayo, nayo yo atupelye uyo Muhe. Icho cho munguchiwona na kuchihulika sambi. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Dawudi mwene si avaga achipulwe kubita Kilanga, lechelelo alontsile kaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">Mutwa Mulungu amulonje Mutwa vangu kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">utavale hamwe na heni,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mbaka hala ho nguvadita uvalongotse vatelani vako.<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Ihyo vanu veka va Isilaheli vatsele nachene kuta uyo yo Yesu yo mwamuvambite mu musalaba, yo yuyo Mulungu amudisile ave Mutwa na Mukulusi.<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Vanu iwo hovavaga kuhulika ihyo, vakahigwaje mu numbula tsawo na kumuputsa Petulo na vala vatumi vayage kuta, “Vang'olotsetu lelo tudite ndawuli?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petulo akavajibulaje, “Mwihale na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi na chila munu abatitswe kwa litawa lya Yesu Chilisito ili muhulumilwe ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi, na kwanuchila Muhe va Mulungu yo yuyo Mulungu alontsile kuta akuvapela. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwasawuli chila cho avaga alontsile kuta akuvapela, alontsile kwasawuli ya henye, na vana venyu, na kwa veka wovali kutali, na kwa chila munu yo akuchemwa na Mutwa Mulungu vetu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petulo akavalonjelaje na kuvafunda vanu kwa ndongwa ntsolofu kwa kuvagongola kuta, “Mwidichile kukuluswa kuhuma mu chilelo chino chinya ndongwa ntsibi.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Siku yila vanu wolofu vakatsidichilaje ndongwa tso alongaga, vakabatitswaje na siku yiyila vakongetsekaje vanu kota elufu tsidatu. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Vanu veka iwo vakendelelaje mu madahitso ga vatumi, na muwuhantso, na kulya hamwe na kitanga mukate gwa Mutwa, na mu suko.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hila vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito fyo vavaga wovamwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Vatumi vaditaga miwujitsa na ndajilo ntsolofu, kwasawuli iyo chila munu akamwogopaje Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Vanu veka vanya litumbilo vakendelelaje kuva chinu chimwe na kigavila finu fyawo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Vagutsaga mali tsawo na finu fyawo fyo vavaga nafyo, na kugavana magobole chila munu kota fyo an'ganika kugavilwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Siku tseka kwa numbula yimwe vitang'anaga ha Nyumba ya Mulungu na kulya mukate kuhuma nyumba yimwe mbaka yinji, nawo valyaga chilyo chawo kwa wusangalo. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Nawo vamutsumitsaga Mulungu, na kuvagan'ya vanu veka. Siku tseka Mutwa akavalutitsaje vanu wo vamutumbaga Chilisito, kwa vala wo vavaga vankuluswa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Petulo angumuponetsa chiteve kwa Litawa lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Siku yimwe satisa ya mumihe, Petulo na Yohana vavaga vam'bita kusala ha Nyumba ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Ihyo kwavaga na munu yumwe yo avaga chiteve luhuma kuleleka kwake. Munu uyo ategulwaga na vanu chila siku, na vamuvikaga ha lwitsi lwa Nyumba ya Mulungu lo lwachemwaga, “Lwitsi Lunofu,” ili asuche magobole kwa vanu wo vinjilaga ha Nyumba ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Munu uyo ho avaga kuvawona Petulo na Yohana vankwinjila ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, akavasukaje vamupele magobole. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petulo na Yohana vakamukangatsilaje miho, nayo Petulo akamulonjelaje “Utulave hetwe!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Mwene yula chiteve akavapituchilaje kuno ana luhuvi lwa kupata chinu chochive kuhuma kwawo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Kahi Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Heni ntsilihela magobole, lechelelo chila cho ntsinacho ngukupela. Kwa Litawa lya Yesu Chilisito va ku Natsaleti, wime na ujende!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Petulo akamubataje liwoko lililo na kumwinula, luvala lulo fikasa fyake na mafugamilo gake gakapataje ludali. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Akadibukaje na kwima kwa magulu gake na kwantsa kujenda. Kahi akinjilaje hamwe na Petulo na Yohana ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, kuno an'jenda na kudibukadibuka na kumutsumitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Vanu veka wo vavaga hono hala vakamuwonaje fyo an'jenda na kumutsumitsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Nawo vakatselaje kuta yo yula yo avaga angikala hivala ha Nyumba ya Mulungu ha lwitsi lo lwachemwaga, “Lwitsi Lunofu,” kuno ansuka finu, nawo vakapomokaje na kiwutsa kuta luveye ndawuli lulongwa luno.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo an'dahitsa ha Nyumba ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Munu yula yo aponitswe avaga hamwe na Petulo na Yohana, vanu veka vakapomokaje ndalahela, vakatsaje luvilo hala ha lidama lya Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petulo hoavaga kuvawona vanu iwo vakong'ine akavalonjelaje, “Henye vanu va Isilaheli, kwasawuli ya chichi mungulupomochela lulongwa luno? Mbona mungutukangatsila miho kota hila hetwe yo tumudisile munu yuno ajende kwa wuvetso wetu awu kwasawuli ya wuwuya wetu kwa Mulungu? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Mulungu yo afugamilwaga vadada vetu Ibulahimu, na Yisaka, na Yakobo, amutsumitse Yesu Mutantsi vake. Henye mwamutawe Yesu kwa vanya mamulaka ili ahigwe kukopolwa na mukamukanaje halutalo ha Pilato, na yivaje mwene Pilato avaga alamwe kumuleketsa ibitile. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Yesu avaga Muhagulwa va Mulungu na Muwuya, lechelelo henye mwamulemile na mukasukaje mupelwe yula munu muwumiyani. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Ihyo mukamukopolaje yula yo mwantso gwa wumi, lechelelo Mulungu akamutsilipulaje. Hetwe yo twatsiwene na kutsilonga ndongwa tsino. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ino lelo mutselaje kuta munu yuno yo mungumuwona na kumutsela apasile ludali kwa litumbilo mu Litawa lya Yesu. Uyo Yesu amuponitse nachene munu yuno kwa kumutumbila Yesu kota henye fyo mungumuwona sambi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Inolelo vang'olotsangu, ntsin'tsela kuta henye mwadisile ihyo bila kutsela kota hila fyo vadisile vavina venyu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Lechelelo hohihyo Mulungu akwitsitse ndongwa tsila tseka tso avaga alontsile katali kukolela kwa valoli vake veka, kuta yaganikaga Chilisito vake akodeche. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Ino lelo mwihale na kutsileka ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu, nayo akuvahulumila ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Mudite ihyo ili Mutwa avapele wusichimafu mu numbula tsenyu, nayo Mutwa Mulungu akumutuma Yesu Chilisito yo amuhagwe kwasawuli yenyu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Yesu yo aganikaga ikale Kilanga kwa Mulungu mbaka ho lukutsa luvala lupya lwa kufidita finofu finu fyeka, kota Mulungu fyo alontsile luhuma katali kukolela kwa valoli vake vahagulwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Hihilaga nayo Musa avaga alontsile kuta, “Mutwa Mulungu venyu akuvahagulila muloli kota fyo ntsili heni kuhuma hagati ha vang'olotsenyu. Na henye mun'ganika mumuhulikitse mwene kwa chila lulongwa lo akuvalonjela. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Nayo munu yoyuve yo akulema kumuhulikitsa muloli uyo, akubagulwa na vanu va Mulungu na kukopolwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Enaa! Valoli veka va Mulungu kwantsila kwa Samweli na vala veka wo vatsitse hambele hake, vatsivikwe ndongwa tsino tseka tso tsinhumila siku tsino. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Henye yo vala Mulungu alontsile kukolela kwa valoli vake mu lilagano lila lyo adisile na vakukwenyu, hala ho amulonje Ibulahimu kuta kukolela mu chilelo chako vanu veka va mu inyi vakutambichilwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ihyo Mulungu hoavaga kumutsilipula Yesu Mutantsi vake, alongwe kumutuma kwa henye tandi, ili avatambichile na kumupitula chila yumwe venyu atsileche ndongwa tsake ntsibi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petulo na Yohana vansindikwa halutalo ha libalatsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petulo na Yohana hovavaga vang'acha vanguvavikulila vanu, vavina vamwe va vatawula nambiko, na muvina va vimilitsi va Nyumba ya Mulungu na Masadukayo vakatsaje. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Vavaga vavifile ndalahela kwasawuli iwo vatumi vavili vavaga vanguvadahitsa vanu kuta Yesu akatsilipuche, na kwasawuli iyo vanu wo vafweye nawo vakutsilipuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ihyo vakavabataje Petulo na Yohana, na kwasawuli litsuva mwanga lyavaga lisotite vakavavikaje mu nyumba ya vawopwa mbaka hamilawu yiyage. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Lechelelo vanu wolofu hagati ha vala wo vavaga mwanga vahuliche ndongwa tso vavikulaga Petulo na Yohana vakamutumbaje Chilisito, nawo vavaga valume kota elufu tsihanu hino. <verse eid="ACT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Hamilawu iyage filongotsi va Vayawudi, na vavina na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa vakakong'anaje hamwe uko ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Vakitang'anaje hamwe na Anasi muvina va vatawula nambiko, na Kayafwa, na Yohana, na Alechitsanda, na vanji wovavaga lukolo na muvina va vatawula nambiko. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Hovavaga kuvavika halutalo Petulo na Yohana, vakavaputsaje kuta, “Henye mudisile lulongwa luno kwa wuvetso wachi na kwa mamulaka ga nani?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Baho Petulo kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu akavalonjelaje kuta henye filongotsi na vavina va Vayawudi, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />manyi munyiguno mutuputse kwasawuli ya lulongwa lunofu lo aditilwe munu yula chiteve na hila fyo aponitswe, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />henye na vanu veka va Isilaheli mun'ganika kutsela kuta, munu yuno yo imile halutalo henyu kuno mumi nachene, aponitswe kwa wuvetso na mamulaka ga Yesu Chilisito va ku Natsaleti, yo uyo henye mwamuvambite mu musalaba, lechelelo Mulungu akamutsilipulaje. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Uyu Yesu yo yula Mandiko ga Mulungu ganlonga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">Liganga lya kutsenjela lyo mulilemile henye vatsentsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">lelo liveye liganga likomi lyo lin'ganika kutsenjela mu musinji.<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Yesu ng'ani yo afuluche avakuluse vanu, kwasawuli ku inyi tseka kuduhu litawa linji lyo tupelitwe lyo tufuluche tukuluswe kwa lilyo.<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Vala vavina va libalatsa vakapomokaje ndalahela hovavaga kuwona wudadambafu wa Petulo na Yohana. Kwasawuli vavatselaga kuta vavaga vanu vagaya chisomo chochive, na ihyo vakatselaje kuta vanu iwo vavaga hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Nawo hovavaga kumuwona chiteve yula yo aponitswe imile hala hamwe nawo, vakalemwaje kulonga lulongwa loluve lwa kuvabisila. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ihyo vakavalonjelaje Petulo na Yohana vahume mu libalatsa, na vakasigalaje vene ili valongane valiyena. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Vakiputsaje, “Tuvadite chinu chachi vanu vano? Chila munu yo angikala Yelusalemu agutselite mutinuso guno mukomi go gudisilwe na vanu vano, na hetwe situfuluche tukane. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Lechelelo ili tuvetse kululemetsa lulongwa luno luleche kutagalila ndalahela hagati ha vanu, tuvang'anulile valeche kulonga na munu yoyuve kwa litawa lya Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ihyo vala vavina va libalatsa vakavachemaje kaha Petulo na Yohana vinjile mugati, vakavang'anulilaje valeche kulonga kaha na kuvadahitsa vanu ndongwa tsa litawa ilyo lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Lechelelo Petulo na Yohana vakavapitulaje, “Mulamule henye, manyi mun'wona sava tudite kota fyo mun'gana henye awu tudite kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Lechelelo hetwe situfuluche tuleche kulonga ndongwa tsila tso tutsiwene na tso tutsihuliche.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Ihyo iwo vavina va libalatsa vakavang'anulilaje ndalahela, na hambele vakavalekaje vabite. Ila valemulwe kuvatova kwasawuli wogopaga, kwakuva vanu veka vamutsumitsaga Mulungu kwa chila chochavaga chihumye. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Munu uyo chiteve yo avaga aponitswe avaga na myaka jojilutye alubayini.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wovamutumbye Chilisito vangumusuka Mulungu avakangatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Luvala lula Petulo na Yohana hovavaga kulechelwa, vakawuyaje kwa vayawo na kuvalonjela ndongwa tseka tso valontsile vatawula nambiko vavina na vavina va Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nawo vala vayawo hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakakong'anaje hono hamwe na kumusuka Mulungu kuta heve Mutwa yo wawumbite kilanga na inyi, bahali na finu fyeka fyofili! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Heve yo walontsile kwa Muhe va Mulungu kwa kukolela kwa dada vetu Dawudi mutantsi vako kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">“mbe, kwasawuli ya chichi vanu va mu inyi vanvipa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Natso kabila tsa vanu wosi Vayawudi kwasawuli yachi vanhotsa fibi?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Vantsajila va inyi vivisile chang'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na vatavala vangitang'ana hono hamwe kwasawuli ya kusumwana na Mutwa Mulungu na Chilisito vako.”<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Tun'tsela wukweli kuta Helode na Pondiyo Pilato na vanu va Isilaheli na vanu wosi Vayawudi vavaga vakong'ine mu muji guno kwasawuli ya kusumwana na Mutantsi vako Muhagulwa Yesu yo wamuhagwe. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Vene vadisile ndongwa tsila tseka tso waganaga heve tsihumile luhuma katali kwa wuvetso wako. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Lechelelo bee Mutwa! Utsilave ng'abuso tsawo na ututanje hetwe vapogotsi vako kuvikula ndongwa tsako bila kuva na muloto. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Udite kwa wuvetso wako na uvaponetse vanu. Udite ndajilo na mitinuso kwa litawa lya Yesu Mutantsi vako Muhagulwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Hovavaga kusinda kumusuka Mulungu, hono hala hovavaga vakong'ine hakatigaswaje. Vanu veka vakapelwaje wuvetso na Muhe va Mulungu, na vakavikulaje ndongwa tsa Mulungu bila muloto.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wovamutumbye Chilisito vangitanga finu fyawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Vala veka wovamutumbye Chilisito vavaga na wo vamwe na mahotso gogamwe. Sikwavaga na munu yoyuve yo alongaga kuta chinu chochive cho anacho chake mwene ng'ani, lechelelo vitangaga chila chinu cho vavaga nacho. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Vatumi vandelye kulonga ndongwa tsa wutsilipuko wa Mutwa Yesu kwa wuvetso wa Mulungu, na lusungu lwa Mulungu lwavaga hamwe nawo veka. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Nambe sikwavaga na munu yoyuve hagati hawo yo avaga mugayu, kwasawuli vanu veka wo vavaga na ntsuga awu nyumba vafigutsaga, na kuleta magobole ga finu fyo vagutsitse, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />na kusindika kwa vatumi, nawo vatumi vakamugavilaje chila munu kota hila fyo an'gaya. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Ihyo kwavaga na munu yumwe va kabila ya Lavi yo alelechilye ku muji gwa Chipulo litawa lyake Yusufu, vatumi vamuchemaga litawa linji Balinaba chinya kutijila kuta, Munu va kuhongetsa, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />mwene nayo agutsitse mugunda gwake, akaletaje igo magobole go apasile na kuvapela vatumi.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Hananiya na Safwila vanlonga wudesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Kwavaga na munu yumwe litawa lyake Hananiya na mudala vake yo achemwaga Safwila, vene nawo vakagutsaje mugunda gwawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Hananiya akagavasaje magobole go avaga apasile, na kuno mudala vake alutselaga lulongwa ulo, na gogasije akasindikaje kwa vatumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petulo akamuputsaje Hananiya, mbe ndawuli Lihoka likubite numbula yako mbaka likudisile umudeteletse Muhe va Mulungu, kwa kufiha magobole gamwe go ugutsitse mugunda? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Hala houka ung'acha sulagutsa mugunda siguka mali yako, na houvije kugutsa igo magobole si gaka mu mamulaka gako? Lelo luveye ndawuli mbaka uhotse lulongwa luno mu numbula yako kwa kufiha magobole? Ihyo si umudetelitse munu ndaya, ila umudetelitse Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Hananiya hoavaga kuhulika ihyo, akagwaje hasi na kufwa. Vanu veka wo vavaga vahuliche lulongwa ulo lo luhumye vakavaje na muloto ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Vakwamitsi vakatsaje, vakaguwopaje muvili gwake mu sanda na kuguhumya kivala na kugutsika. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Holwavaga kulutila luvala lwa kota masala gadatu hino, mudala vake nayo akinjilaje mugati, kuno nambe atsele chochihumye. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petulo akamuputsaje, “Undonjele! Mbe, chiyasi chino cha magobole cho chichinago cho mupasile kwa kugutsa mugunda gwenyu?” Safwila akamujibulaje Petulo kuta ena, gogago hela. <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Kaha Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Yiveye ndawuli mbaka heve na mulume vako mulagine kumujela Muhe va Mutwa? Hulikitse! Vakwamitsi wo vaka vahele kumutsika mulume vako vali ha lwitsi, na heve nave vakukutegula mbaka kivala.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Luvala lululaga Safwila akagwaje ha magulu ga Petulo, akafwaje. Vala vakwamitsi hovavaga kwinjila, vakamufikaje mwanga afweye, nawo vakamutegulaje na kumutsika halubali ho vamutsisile mulume vake. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Muhwehwe mukomi gukavabataje vanu veka wovamutumbye Chilisito, na veka wo vahuliche chila chochihumye.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatumi van'dita miwujitsa myolofu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Vatumi vadisile miwujitsa myolofu hagati ha vanu. Vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito vitang'anilaga ha lidama lya Selemani. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Vanu vavatsumilaga, nambe ihyo kuduhu munu yoyuve yo avaga yo siamutumbye Chilisito yo ajelaga kihantsa nawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Lechelelo vanu wo vavaga vangumutumba Mutwa, vakongetsekaje ndalahela valume kwa vadala. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Nawo vanu vavategulaga vatamwa mu saga na micheka na kuvasindika mung'asi na kuvalambalika, vaganaga Petulo hoakuva anlutila nambe mujiji gwake hela guvafichile ili vapone. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Kaha vanu vanji vakakong'anaje kuhuma ku miji ja mulubali lwa Yelusalemu, na kuvaleta vatamwa vawo na vala wo vakodwaga na misoka na iwo veka vakaponetswaje.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vatumi vankodwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ihyo muvina va vatawula nambiko na vayage wo vavaga va chikundi cha Masadukayo va hono iho, vakavawonelaje mbafya vatumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ihyo lelo vakavabataje vatumi na kuvawopa mu nyumba ya vawopwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Lechelelo hachilo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akadindulaje ntsitsi tsa nyumba ya vawopwa, akavahumyaje kivala. Akavalonjelaje, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Mubite mukime ha Nyumba ya Mulungu mukavalonjele vanu ndongwa tseka tsa wumi wa kihantsa na Chilisito.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Vatumi vakamudikitsaje, na hamilawu yiyage kung'acha hamitondo, vakinjilaje ha Nyumba ya Mulungu na kwantsa kuvadahitsa vanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Muvina va vatawula nambiko na vala vanu wo vavaga hamwe, vakakong'asaje libalatsa lyeka lya vavina va Isilaheli vakavatumaje vanu kula ku nyumba ya vawopwa ili vakavalete vala vatumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Lechelelo iwo vatantsi va Nyumba ya Mulungu hovavaga kufika kuko ku nyumba ya vawopwa sivakavafisile ndaya. Ihyo vakawuyaje na kulonga hala habalatsa chila chochihumye, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />vakalongaje, “Hotuvije kufika ha nyumba ya vawopwa, tuyiwene ying'acha yidinditwe, na vimilitsi vankwimilila muntsitsi, lechelelo hotuvije kudindula ntsitsi si tumuwene munu yoyuve mugati.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Muvina va vimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa na vatawula nambiko vavina vavaga kuhulika ihyo vakavaje na muloto kwasawuli ya vanu iwo, luveje ndawuli lulongwa luno. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Akafikaje munu yumwe akavalonjelaje, “Muhulikitse, vala vanu wo mukavawopite mu nyumba ya vawopwa, sambi hano vali mu Nyumba ya Mulungu vanguvadahitsa vanu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Iho muvina va wimilitsi va Nyumba ya Mulungu hamwe na vanu vake veka vakabitaje ha Nyumba ya Mulungu, vakavaletaje vatumi vala, lechelelo vakavategulaje bila chitika kwasawuli wogopaga kutowa maganga na vanu.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Hovavaga kuvaleta vatumi, vakavavikaje halutalo ha libalatsa. Muvina va vatawula nambiko akavalonjelaje, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Twavaga tuvang'anulye kuta mulekaje kudahitsa kwa litawa lya munu yuno, lechelelo henye muyimemitse Yelusalemu yeka madahitso genyu, na kaha mun'gana na hetwe tuwoneche twambwitse kukopolwa kwa munu yuno.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Iho Petulo na vala vatumi vayage vakamujibulaje, “Tun'ganika kumuhulikitsa Mulungu ng'ani na siyo vanu ndaya. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Henye mwamukopwe Yesu kwa kumuvamba mu musalaba, lechelelo Mulungu va vakuku vetu amutsilipwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Uyuno yo yula Mulungu akamwinulaje mbaka lubali lwa hesima na kumuvika habehi na mwene, ihyo akavaje Muvina na Mukulusi ili avadite vanu va Isilaheli vihale na vapate wuleketso wa ndongwa tsawo ntsibi. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Hetwe tunlonga ndongwa tso twatsiwene na kutsihulika, nayo Muhe va Mulungu yo vapelwaga vala vanu wo vangumuhulikitsa Mulungu, alajilaga ndongwa tsitso.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Vajumbe veka va wovavaga mubalatsa yila, hovavaga kuhulika ihyo vakavipaje ndalahela, mbaka vakaganaje kuvakopola vala vatumi. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Lechelelo Mufwalisayo yumwe litawa lyake Gamaliyeli yo avaga mudahitsi va malajitso ga Musa na yo avaga munu va kuhesimilwa ndalahela kwa vanu veka, akimaje halutalo ha libalatsa akalajitsaje kuta vatumi veka vahume kivala kwa luvala tandi. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ihyo akavalonjelaje, “Nye valume va Isilaheli mwiyangalile tandi, chila cho mun'gana kulamula kuvadita vanu vano. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Mwiwukaje kuta myaka jo jilutye kwavaga na munu litawa lyake Tewuda, idutsaga kuta mwene yo munu mutambulwa, akapataje vanu kota mya tsitayi, vakamufwataje na kumutumba. Lechelelo ho avaga kukopolwa, vala vanu veka wo vamufwataga vakatagalilaje na ndongwa tsake tsikasilaje. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Kaha hoavaga kulutila munu uyo, akahumilaje Yuda munu va ku Galilaya siku tsila tsa vanu kuvalilwa, akavakokaje na kuvalongotsa vanu wolofu kudita chitika, mwene nayo akakopolwaje na vala wo vamufwataga vakatagalilaje. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Ino lelo heni ntsinguvafunda kuta mwiyangalile na vanu vano. Muvaleche vabite! Kwasawuli manyi lulongwa luno na katsi yino yovan'dita yihumye kwa vanu, vankodeka hela. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Lechelelo manyi yive yihumye kwa Mulungu, simukuvetsa kusumana nawo, kwasawuli mukuva mungisumana na Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Ihyo vanu vala vakidichilaje ndongwa tsila tso alontsile Gamaliyeli. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Vakavachemaje vala vatumi vinjile mu nyumba, vakalamulaje kuta vavakobe mikotya, kaha vakavalajitsaje valeche kudahitsa kanji kwa litawa lya Yesu, hambele vakavalekaje vabite. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Duve vala vatumi vakahumaje mu libalatsa lila kuno vasangale ndalahela, kwasawuli Mulungu avadisile vahesimilwe kwa kuvaleka vahonjelwe nyoni kwasawuli ya litawa lya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Chila siku ha Nyumba ya Mulungu na mu nyumba tsa vanu, vatumi sivalesile kudahitsa na kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu kuta Yesu yo Chilisito.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Vanu saba vanhagulwa kuvatanga vatumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Luvala ulo vafwasi va Yesu hovavaga vankongeketseka, kukavaje na ng'ung'uto hagati ha Vayawudi wo vanlonga Chijilichi na Vayawudi vanyakaye. Vajilichi wo vanlonga Chiyawudi vakalalaga kuta vafwile vawo vavaga vasemilwe kugavilwa filyo fya chila siku. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ihyo vala vatumi kumi na vavili vakavachemaje hohamwe vafwasi va Yesu na kuvalonjela kuta “Siyo finofu hetwe tuleche katsi ya kudahitsa Ndongwa tsa Mulungu na kukola katsi ya kuvagavila vanu filyo fya chila siku. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ihyo lelo vang'olotsetu muhagule vanu saba hagati henyu, wo vanya wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu na vawuya, na vanya ntselo, ili tuvaviche mu katsi yino. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Hetwe tukusigala kumusuka Mulungu na kudahitsa ndongwa tsa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Vanu veka vakaludichilaje lulongwa ulo, ihyo vakamuhagulaje Sitefwani, munu yo avaga na litumbilo kwa Mulungu na yo alongotswaga na Muhe va Mulungu. Kaha vakamuhagulaje Fwilipo na Pulokolo, na Nikanoli, na Timoni, na Palimena, na Nikolawo munu va kuhuma ku Andiyochiya yo inje mu dini ya Chiyawudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Vakavavikaje vanu iwo halutalo ha vatumi, nawo vatumi vakavasuchilaje na kuvatambichila kwa kuvavichila mawoko.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ndongwa tsa Mulungu tsikalutilaje kutagalila, na vafwasi va Yesu vakongetsekaje ndalahela kuko Yelusalemu, nambe vatawula nambiko wolofu nawo validichilaga litumbilo lila.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefwani angibatika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Mulungu avaga amupelye Sitefwani wuwuya na wuvetso wukomi, ihyo Sitefwani aditaga mitinuso na ndajilo ngomi hagati ha vanu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Lechelelo vakahumilaje vanu vatunga wo vahumye mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi yo yachemwaga nyumba ya kitang'anila ya vanu vapogotsi wo valesilwe, wo vavaga vahumye ku Chilene, na vanji vakuhuma ku Alechitsandiliya. Na vamwe va kuhuma ku Chilichiya na ku Asiya, vanu iwo vakantsaje kusumana na Sitefwani. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Lechelelo vakalemwaje kusumana na Sitefwani kwasawuli Muhe va Mulungu amupelaga ntselo hala ho alongaga. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ihyo vanu vala vakavakokaje vanu kwa kuvapela magobole kwa lufiho ili valonje, “Tumuhuliche Sitefwani anlonga ndongwa tsa kuvaliga Musa hamwe na Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kaha vakavasongetsaje vanu, na vavina va Isilaheli hamwe na vadahitsi va malajitso ga Musa. Nawo vakamubataje Sitefwani na kumusindika halutalo ha libalatsa. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Vakavavikaje masahidi va wudesi wo valontsile, “Munu yuno si anleka kulonga ndongwa tsa kuyiliga Nyumba yino nyagulwa ya Mulungu, na ntsovelo tso tupelilwe na Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Tumuhuliche munu yuno anlonga kuta uyo Yesu va ku Natsaleti akuhananga nachene hono hano hahagulwa na kutsibadila ntsovelo tseka tso tupelilwe na Musa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Vala vanu veka wo vavaga vichite mu libalatsa lila, vakamukangatsilaje miho Sitefwani, nawo vakamuwonaje kumiho kwake kummelema kota kumiho kwa mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Sitefwani Angiyamila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Muvina va vatawula nambiko akamuputsaje Sitefwani, “Mbe, chinu chino cho vangukuhiga fyo chili?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Nayo Sitefwani akamupitulaje, “Vang'olotsangu na va dada vangu munyulikitse! Mulungu munya wumelemo amuhumye kukwetu Ibulahimu ho avaga ang'acha kula ku Misopotamiya hala ho avaga ang'acha kikala ku muji gwa Halani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Nayo Mulungu avaga amulonje kuta uwuche mu inyi yako na ha vang'olotso na ubite mbaka ku inyi yo ngukulajila. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ihyo Ibulahimu akawukaje mu inyi ya va Kalidayo, akabitaje kikala ku Halani. Hoavaga kufwa dade, Mulungu akamuhamyaje ku Halani mbaka ku inyi yino yo mungikala sambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Mulungu si amupelye hono hohave ha inyi yino have hake, si amupelye nambe hono hadodo ha kufyajila hela. Lechelelo avaga amulahye kuta akumupela mwene inyi yino na lulelo lwake lweka, nayivaje luvala ulo Ibulahimu avaga agaya mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Ihyo Mulungu akamulonjelaje Ibulahimu kuta lulelo lwako lukikala ku inyi ya wujentsi, nawo vakuditwa kuva vapogotsi na vakuditilwa finu fibi kwa myaka miya ine. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Mulungu akawilaje kulonga kuta lechelelo heni nguvahiga vanu vala wo vavaditye finu fibi, na hambele vakuhuma mu inyi iyo ili vatse vafugamile heni ha inyi yino. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Hambele Mulungu akamupelaje Ibulahimu ntsovelo ya kwinjila likumbi yive yo ndajilo ya lilagano lyake. Nayo Ibulahimu akamulelaje Yisaka na akamwingitsaje likumbi siku ya nane kuhuma aleleche. Hambele Yisaka akamulelaje Yakobo nayo akamwingitsaje likumbi, Yakobo nayo akavalelaje vala vakuku vetu kumi na vavili, nawo akavingitsaje likumbi. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Vala vakukwetu vamuwon'ye mbafya Yusufu mung'olotsawo, vakamugutsaje ili ave mupogotsi ku inyi ya Misili. Lechelelo Mulungu avaga hamwe na Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Mulungu akamukulusaje Yusufu kuhuma mu ng'odeko tseka tso avaga natso, kahi akamupelaje ntselo na kidichilwa hala ho avaga kwima halutalo ha muntsajila va inyi ya Misili, nayo muntsajila va inyi ya Misili akamuvikaje Yusufu ave muvina va inyi ya Misili na nyumba yake ya chintsajila. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Hambele kukahumilaje ntsala ngomi mu inyi yeka ya Misili na ya Kanani, na kwasawuli ya kugaya filyo fyofive vakukwetu vakodiche ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Lechelelo Yakobo ho avaga kuhulika kuta uko Misili kuna filyo, akavatumaje vanage iwo wo vakukwetu vakabitaje kuko. Ulo lo lwavaga lujendo lwawo lulongola lwa kubita ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Hovavaga kubita lujendo lwa kavili, Yusufu akitambutsaje kwa vang'olotse, nayo muntsajila va inyi ya Misili ho akavatselaje vang'olotse va Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Iho ho Yusufu akavatumaje vanu vakamulete Yakobo dada vake hamwe na vanu veka wo avaga nawo vatse ku inyi ya Misili, iwo vanu veka vavaga vanu sabini na vahanu. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ihyo Yakobo akabitaje ku inyi ya Misili na kuko ko afwilye mwene hamwe na vakukwetu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Hambele mivili jawo jategulwe na kujipilula ku muji gwa Sekemu, vakajitsikaje ha makabuli gala go avaga agutsile Ibulahimu kwa magobole matunga kuhuma kwa vana va Hamoli. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Ihyo luvala lula lwa Mulungu kukwitsa chila cho avaga amulonje Ibulahimu kuta akumupela, vanu vetu vavaga vankongetseka ndalahela uko ku inyi ya Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Hawudugo akatsaje muntsajila yunji kutavala inyi ya Misili yo avaga siamutsele Yusufu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Muntsajila uyo avaditye fibi vakukwetu kwa kuvalatsimitsa vavadibule mululenga vana vawo wo vavaga vang'acha fyali ili vafwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Luvala ulo Musa nayo akalelekaje, Mulungu akamuwonaje mwana uyo kuta munofu ndalahela. Atuntsitswe mu nyumba ya dade kwa myetsi jidatu hela. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Hovavaga kumuvika kutali na kukaye kwawo, mwana hintsa va muntsajila va Misili akamutegulaje mwana uyo na kumutuntsa kota mwanage. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa akadahitswaje ndongwa tseka tsa ntselo tsa va Misili, nayo akavaje munu mutambulwa kwa ndonga na ng'olwa tsake. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Musa hoavaga kufisa myaka alubayini, akalamulaje kubita kuvalola vang'olotse va Isilaheli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kuko akamuwonaje munu yumwe va Vaisilaheli an'ditilwa fibi na Mumisili, Musa akamulamulilaje yula yo an'wonelwa kwa kumutova mu Misili yula, akamutovaje mbaka akamukopolaje. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa atyaga kuta vang'olotse vaka kutsela kuta Mulungu ankolela kwa mwene ili avakuluse, lechelelo vene sivakalutselye lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Siku ya kavili Musa akavawonaje Vaisilaheli vavili vangitova, akajelaje kuvalamulila kwa kuvalonjela kuta nye vanu henye mulilukolo, kwasawuli ya chichi mungitova? <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Lechelelo yula yo avaga angumutova muyage akamukunugitsaje Musa kulubali, na kumulonjelaje kuta, nani yo akuvisile heve uve muvina na mulamutsi vetu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Mbe, un'gana kung'opola kota fyo ukamukopwe yula Mumisili higolo? <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa ho avaga kuhulika ihyo, akachimbilaje na kubita kikala ku inyi ya Midiyani uko ichite kota mujentsi, na kuko akapataje vana vavili vakwamitsi. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Duve hojavaga kulutila myaka alubayini, mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamuhumilaje Musa ku mbuga habehi na chidunda cha Sinayi, mu chisati cho chavaga chinkwaka moto. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Hoavaga kuchiwona icho cho chihumye, akapomokaje kwasawuli ya nduntsuchilo tsila. Akahejelelaje habehi ili alave kwa habehi, bahobaho akahulikaje Mutwa anlonga, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />heni yo ntsili Mulungu yo vafugamilaga vakuku vako na yo Mulungu va Ibulahimu na va Yisaka na va Yakobo. Musa akakakamaje kwa muloto akifihaje kumiho kwake. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Mutwa akamulonjelaje Musa kuta, wopole ndatu tsako, kwasawuli hono iho ho wimile ho hono hangu hahagulwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Nachene ntsitsiwene ndongwa ntsibi tso van'ditilwa vanu vangu uko ku Misili. Nyuliche chivembo chawo na ntsitsitse ili ntsivakuluse. Lelo utse na heni ngukutuma ubite ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Musa yuno yo yula yo vamulemile vanu va Isilaheli vakalongaje kuta mbe, nani yo akuvisile heve uve muvina na mulamutsi hagati hetu? Avaga atumilwe na Mulungu mwene ili ave muvina na mukulusi vawo, kwakukolela yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu yo avaga amuhumye mu chisati chila ili chilongotsi na mukulusi va vanu Vaisilaheli. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Uyo Musa yo avalongwitse vala vanu vahume mu inyi ya Misili kwa kudita ndajilo na mitinuso myolofu kuko Misili, na ku bahali ya Samu na ku mbuga kwa myaka alubayini. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Yuno yo Musa yo avalonje vanu va Isilaheli kuta, Mulungu akuvahagulila muloli kota heni kuhuma hagati ha vang'olotsenyu. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Uyuno yo yula Musa yo avaga mu likong'ano kuko ku mbuga, kaha yuyo Musa yo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu alontsile na mwene hamwe na vakukwetu ku Chidunda cha Sinayi, na yo yuyo yo anuchilye malajitso ganya wumi ili atupele hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Lechelelo vakukwetu valemile kumuhulikitsa Musa, vakamukunugitsilaje kutali, na numbula tsawo tsikapilukaje kanji kumbele ku inyi ya Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Ihyo vakamulonjelaje Haluni kuta utuditile mihoka jojikutulongotsa mung'asi, kwasawuli situchitsele chila cho chimupasile yuyo Musa yo atutweye kuhuma ku Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ulo lo luvala lula lo vadisile sanamu ya ngwada na vakayitawulilaje sadaka na kuyiditila liwungo, kwasawuli ya sanamu yo vayidisile kwa mawoko gawo.” <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Ihyo Mulungu akavalekaje vafugamile litsuva na nyenyetsi na mwetsi, kota fyo yandikwe mu chitabu cha valoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">mbe mwandetye tsabihu na sadaka kwa myaka alubayini kula ku balali, henye nyumba ya Isilaheli? <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Henye mwategwe matsabahu ya lilungu lyo linchemwa Molechi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Na nyenyetsi tsa lilungu lyenyu lyo linchemwa Lefwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Sanamu tso mwadisile ili mutsifugamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Na heni nguvasindika kutali kulutila inyi ya Babeli.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Kula kumbuga vakukwetu vavaga na lihema lyo lyalajilaga kuta Mulungu avaga hamwe nawo. Lihema lyo lyavaga litsentsilwe kota hila Mulungu fyo avaga amulajitse Musa. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Kaha vakukwetu vanuche lihema ilyo na viyanuchilaga vene kwa vene kwa kulongotswa na Yosuwa mbaka vakinjilaje ku wutavala wa vanu va inyi tsila, na lihema ilyo lyavaga baho mbaka ha siku tsa Dawudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Dawudi yo idichilwe na Mulungu, nayo akamusukaje ili amudichile kumutsenjela Mulungu Nyumba yo akumufugamila mwene Dawudi hamwe na vanu veka va Isilaheli. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Lechelelo Nyumba ya Mulungu yatsentsilwe na Selemani.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Nayivaje ihyo Mulungu yo ali kilanga ndalahela, siikalaga mu nyumba tso tsitsentsilwe na vanu, kota fyo alontsile muloli mutunga,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Mutwa anlonga kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Kilanga cho chigoda changu cha wutavala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na inyi ho hono ha kukanyajila magulu gangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Mukuntsenjela nyumba yinya ndawuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Awu hono hachi ho ngikala?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Mbe, si heni yo tsadisile finu fyeka fino?<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Sitefwani akendelelaje kulonga, “Henye muli vanu vanya chidada na mapulichilo madibifu.” Mbaka hanili simulekaga kuva tebe na Muhe va Mulungu, kota fyo vaditaga vakukwenyu! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Mbe, koyoli muloli vachi yoyuve yo siakoditwe na vakukwenyu? Iwo vakukwenyu wo vavakopwe vanu vala wovalongaga ndongwa tsa kutsa kwake yula muwuya. Lelo henye muveye vala wo vamupitwiche na muvakopolaji. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Henye yo mwanuchilye gala malajitso go galetitwe kwenyu na vatantsi va kilanga va Mulungu, lechelelo henye simukagahulikitse!<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefwani ankopolwa na maganga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Vala vavina va libalatsa hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso vakavipaje ndalahela, na kumugwegwetsulila mino gawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Lechelelo Sitefwani kuno anlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu, akalolaje Kilanga, akawonaje wuvina wa Mulungu, na Yesu imile mu mamulaka ga Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Akalongaje, “Mulole! Ntsin'wona Kilanga kwa Mulungu kudinduche, na Mwana va Munu imile lubali lwa kuhesimilwa lwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Lechelelo vene vakayovaje fikami na kudina mapulichilo gawo na kumudibuchila hohamwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Vakamubulunaje mbaka kutali na muji. Vala vanu wo vavaga vamuhitsile Sitefwani kwa wudesi, vakavikaje migolole jawo kwa mukwamitsi yumwe yo achemwaga Sawuli, na kwantsa kumutova na maganga. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Hovavaga vankwendelela kumutova Sitefwani na maganga, lechelelo mwene akamusukaje Mulungu, “Mutwa Yesu, wanuchile numbula yangu.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Sitefwani akafugamaje na kukola, “Mutwa uleche kuvahiga vanu vano kwa lulongwa luno lubi lo van'dita.” Hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akatajikaje.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Hihilaga Sawuli nayo avaga baho, awonaga sava hela lulongwa ulo lwa kukopolwa kwa Sitefwani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sawuli ankwantsa kuvakoda vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Siku yila kukahumilaje ng'odeko ngomi kwa vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vavaga kuko ku Yelusalemu, veka vakatagalilaje na kubilimila ku Wuyawudi na ku Samaliya, lechelelo vakasigalaje vatumi ng'ani. Chimunyi chila kukahumilaje ng'odeko ngomi kwa chikundi cha vanu wo vangumutumbila Chilisito kuko Yelusalemu, vakatagalilaje na kuchimbilila ku Yudeya na ku Samaliya. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Vanu wo vamutumbye Mulungu vakamutsikaje Sitefwani na kumulomboketsela ndalahela.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Luvala ulo Sawuli ajelaga kuvakoda vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito, injilaga mu chila nyumba na kuvabata valume na vadala, na kuvasindika mu nyumba tsa vawopwa.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fwilipo anvikula Ndongwa Nofu ku Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Ihyo vala vanu wo vavaga vatagalye vakavikulaje Ndongwa Nofu chila hono hovavaga vachimbilye. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Fwilipo nayo akabitaje ku muji gwa Samaliya na kumuvikula Chilisito kwa vanyakaye va hono iho. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Malugu ga vanu ho vavaga kumuhulikitsa Fwilipo na kujiwona jila mitinuso jo aditaga, vakamuhulikitsaje finofu ndongwa tsila tso alongaga. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Misoka javahumaga vanu wolofu na kuyova, na vanu wo vavaga vapotsile mivili na fiteve vakaponetswaje. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ihyo vanu va muji gula vakasangalalaje ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Duve kwavaga na munu yumwe litawa lyake Simoni, yo aditaga ndongwa tsa wuhavi kwa siku ntsolofu ha muji ugo, vanu va inyi ya Samaliya vapomotswaga kwa ndongwa tsake, nayo idutsaga kuta mwene yo munu muvina. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Vanu veka vavina kwa vadodo vamuhulikitsaga finofu na kulonga, “Munu yuno yo wuvetso wa Mulungu wo wun'tselanika kota, wo Wuvetso Wukomi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Vamuhulikitsaga ndalahela yula muhavi kwasawuli vapomotswaga kwa siku ntsolofu kwa katsi tsake tsa wuhavi tso akolaga. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Lechelelo vanu hovavaga kutsihulika Ndongwa Nofu tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu tso avikulaga Fwilipo kwa litawa lyake Yesu Chilisito, vakatsitumbaje na kubatitswa valume na vadala. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Nambe Simoni nayo akatsitumbaje Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu na kubatitswa. Akamufwataje Fwilipo chila hono na kupomotswa na mitinuso mikomi hamwe na ndajilo tso atsiwonaga. <verse eid="ACT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Vala vatumi wo vavaga kula ku Yelusalemu hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso kuta vanyakaye va ku Samaliya nawo vatsidichye ndongwa tsa Mulungu, ihyo vakavatumaje Petulo na Yohana vabite kuko. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Hovavaga kufika vakavasuchilaje iwo wovamutumbye Chilisito ili vamwanuchile Muhe va Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />kwasawuli uyo Muhe va Mulungu avaga ang'acha ang'ali kumufichila nambe munu yumwe, ila vavaga vabatitswe kwa litawa lya Mutwa Yesu hela. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ihyo Petulo na Yohana vakavikaje mawoko gawo kwa vala vanu, nawo vakamwanuchilaje Muhe va Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni avaga kuwona kuta vanu vangumwanuchila Muhe va Mulungu kwa kuvichilwa hela mawoko ga vatumi, akaganaje kuvapela magobole vatumi. <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />Ihyo Simoni akalongaje, “Mumele na heni wuvetso wuno, ili chila munu yo ngumuvichila mawoko gangu amwanuchile Muhe va Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Ihyo Petulo akamujibulaje, “Uyajile kutali na magobole gako, kwasawuli unhotsa kuta ufuluche ugule chifunje cha Mulungu kwa magobole! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Hetwe situfuluche twitanje na heve mu katsi yino, kwasawuli numbula yako siyo ngolofu kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ihyo wihale wubi wako wo ulinawo na kuwuleka, na umusuche Mutwa ili akuhulumile mahotso mabi go unhotsa. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Tun'tsela kuta heve umemile wusungu ndalahela na uwofilwe mu ndongwa ntsibi!”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni akavajibulaje, “Ntsimuyenyu nyongitse, musuchile kwa Mutwa ili anyetsele finu ifyo fyeka fyo mulontsile fileche kunyumila.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Petulo na Yohana hovavaga kudahitsa ndongwa tsa Mutwa, vakawuyaje ku Yelusalemu. Nawo hovavaga mung'asi vavavikulilaga vanu Ndongwa Nofu mu fijiji fyolofu fya ku Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fwilipo na muvina va ku Esiyopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamulonjelaje Fwilipo, “Ubite lubali lwa kusika kwa kukolela ng'asi ya ku mbuga yo yinhuma ku Yelusalemu kubita ku Gatsa.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Ihyo Fwilipo akawukaje na kwantsa lujendo. Hoavaga mung'asi akamuwonaje munu muvina va inyi ya Esiyopiya yo avaga muchiliti, munu uyo avaga avisilwe na Malichiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malichiya yo chilongotsi muvina va inyi yo avaga mudala</char></note> va ku Esiyopiya ili imilile ndongwa tsake tsa magobole. Nayo muvina uyo avaga ahele ku Yelusalemu kumufugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Muchiliti yula hoavaga mulujendo an'wuya kukaye, avaga ichite mu mutuka gwa kukwengwa na fwalasi kuno ansoma chitabu cha Yisaya muloli va Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Muhe va Mulungu akamulonjelaje Fwilipo, “Hejelele habehi na mutuka gula.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Fwilipo akabilimaje mbaka habehi na mutuka gula akamuhulikaje muvina yula ansoma chitabu cha muloli Yisaya. Fwilipo akamuputsaje yula munu, “Mbe, ungutsitsela ndongwa itso tso unsoma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Muvina uyo akamujibulaje, “Ngutsela chinya ndawuli bila munu va kundahitsa?” Ihyo akamusukaje Fwilipo akwine mu mutuka ili vikalase hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Muvina uyo asomaga chifungu cha Mandiko ga Mulungu go gatyaga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Alongwitswe kota ng'olo yo yim'bita kusintswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">na avaga akatwiche kota ntsanang'olo fyo yikatukaga halutalo ha yula yo anguyimoga wubahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">nayo sialontsile chinu chochive.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Vamuhonje nyoni na ku muwonela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Kuduhu munu yo afuluche achilonjele chilelo chake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Kwasawuli wumi wake wahetsitswe kuhuma mu inyi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Yula muvina va ku Esiyopiya akamuputsaje Fwilipo, “Ntsinsuka undonjele, uyu muloli anlonga chinu chachi? Anlonga ndongwa tsake awu tsa munu yunji?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Ihyo Fwilipo akantsaje kumujibula kukolela Mandiko gagala go asomaga, akamulonjelaje Ndongwa Nofu tsa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Hovavaga vang'acha vankwendelela na lujendo vakafikaje hono hohavaga na malenga, na yula muvina akamulonjelaje Fwilipo, “Lave hono hano hana malenga! Chinu chachi cho chikundemetsa heni ndeche kubatitswa?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Fwilipo akamulonjelaje, “Manyi witumbe kwa numbula yako yeka, ufuluche ubatitswe.” Yula muchiliti akamujibulaje, “Ntsintumba kuta Yesu Chilisito yo Mwana va Mulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibiliya tsinji tsilihela musitali guno. </char></note>.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Muvina uyo akalajitsaje mutuka gula gwime. Ihyo Muchiliti na Fwilipo vakikaje hala ha malenga, nayo Fwilipo akamubatitsaje yula muchiliti. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Hovavaga kuhuma mumalenga, Muhe va Mutwa akamuchipulaje Fwilipo, yula muchiliti si akamuwene kaha, mwene yula muvina akendelelaje na lujendo lwake kuno asangale. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Nayo Fwilipo akawonekaje ku muji gwa Atsoto, na hoavaga mung'asi avikulaga Ndongwa Nofu mu miji jeka mbaka ho afisile ku muji gwa Kayisaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sawuli angumutumba Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Luvala lulula Sawuli avaga ankwendelela kulutitsa ng'abuso tsa kuvakopola vadahitswa va Mutwa, akabitaje kwa muvina va vatawula nambiko, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />nayo akamusukaje muvina va vatawula nambiko amupele baluva tsa kumutambutsa ku nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi tso tsili ku muji gwa Damesichi, ili manyi amufiche munu yoyuve ave mulume awu mudala yo amutumbye Chilisito, amubate na kumuleta ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Lechelelo Sawuli hoavaga ang'acha mulujendo akavaje habehi na kufika ku Damesichi, simusika lukahumilaje lwenje kuhuma kilanga lukamwangatsilaje mbali tseka. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Akagwaje hasi na kuhulika litsi, “Sawuli, Sawuli, mbona ung'oda?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sawuli akamupitulaje, “Heve uli nani, Mutwa?” Nayo akamujibulaje, “Heni yo Yesu yo ung'oda.” <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Ihyo lelo wime, winjile ku mujini, na heve ukulonjelwa cho un'ganika kudita. <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Vanu wo vavaga hamwe na Sawuli mulujendo, vakimaje myee, vangulihulika litsi, na kuno nambe vamuwone munu yo alongaga. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sawuli akinukaje, na hoavaga kujela kulola, akalemwaje. Ihyo vayage vakamubatilitsaje liwoko na vakamulongotsaje mbaka ku Damesichi. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sawuli akavaje chibofu na kaha sialyeye nambe kung'wa chinu chochive kwa siku tsidatu.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Kuko ku Damesichi kwavaga na mufwasi va Yesu litawa lyake Hananiya. Mutwa akamulonjelaje kukolela mu nduntsuchilo, “Hananiya!” Nayo akamupitulaje,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">“Yoo, Mutwa!”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mutwa akamulonjelaje kuta, “Ubite ku ng'asi yo yinchemwa ngolofu, ukaputse mu nyumba ya Yuda munu va kuhuma ku Taliso yo anchemwa Sawuli, kwasawuli sambi hano ansuka, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />na mu nduntsuchilo amuwene munu yo anchemwa Hananiya, ankwinjila mugati na kumuvichila mawoko mwilanga mwake ili avetse kulola kaha.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Lechelelo Hananiya akamupitulaje, “Mutwa, nyuliche ndongwa tsa munu uyo kuhuma kwa vanu wolofu, hila fyo avaditye finu fibi vanu wo vakutumbye wo vali ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Nayo atsitse hano Damesichi kuno ana mamulaka kuhuma kwa vatawula nambiko vavina, ili avabate veka wo vakutumbye heve.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Lechelelo Mutwa akamulonjelaje Hananiya, “Ubite hela! Kwasawuli ntsimuhagwe ave mutantsi vangu ili avikule ndongwa tsangu kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi, na kwa vantsajila na kwa vanu va Isilaheli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Heni ngumulajila ndongwa ntsolofu hila fyo akuganika akodeche kwasawuli ya heni.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ihyo Hananiya akabitaje na kwinjila mu nyumba yila na akamusuchilaje kwa kumuvichila mawoko Sawuli na kumulonjela, “Mung'olotsangu Sawuli, Mutwa Yesu yo akuhumye ku ng'asi anumile kwa heve ili uvetse kulola kaha na kulongotswa na wuvetso na Muhe va Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Luvala lulo finu fyo finakota fibadu fikagwaje kuhuma mu miho ga Sawuli, akavetsaje kulola kaha. Ihyo akimaje na kubatitswa. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Sawuli hoavaga kulya, akapataje ludali kaha.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawuli anvikula Ndongwa Nofu ku Damesichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Luvala lulo Sawuli akantsaje kuvikula mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi kuta, “Yesu yo Mwana va Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Vanu veka wo vamuhuliche Sawuli vakalemwaje kutsela na vakalongaje, “Mbe, munu yuno si yoyuyulaga yo avakopwe vanu vala wo vangumutumba Chilisito kula ku Yelusalemu? Nambe kutsa kwake hano aganaga kuvabata vanu iwo na kuvasindika kwa vatawula nambiko!”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Sawuli akalutilaje kuva na wuvetso wa kuvikula, na hila fyo avalajilaga vanu kuta Yesu yo Chilisito. Nawo Vayawudi wo vikalaga ku Damesichi vakatifikaje.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku ntsolofu, Vayawudi vakakong'anaje na kulagana vamukopole, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Sawuli akalutselaje lulongwa ulo. Nawo Vayawudi hamunyi na hachilo vavaga vankwimilila mu ntsitsi tseka tsa muji ili vamukopole. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Lechelelo hachilo vadahitswa vake Sawuli vakamutegulaje na kumuvika mu litangula likomi na kumwisa mu lukantsi lwa muji gula.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawuli ampiluka ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sawuli hoavaga kufika ku Yelusalemu akajelaje kihantsa na vala vadahitswa va Yesu. Lechelelo vadahitswa veka vakamwogopaje, kwasawuli sivamutumbye kuta kweli mwene nayo aveye mudahitswa. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Hambele Balinaba akatsaje na kumutegula Sawuli, nayo akamusindikaje kwa vatumi na kuvalonjela hila Sawuli fyo amuwene Mutwa hoavaga mung'asi, na hila Mutwa fyo alontsile nayo na Sawuli fyo avikwe kwa mamulaka ndongwa tsa Yesu kula ku Damesichi. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Ihyo Sawuli akikalaje hamwe nawo na kujenda chila hono uko ku Yelusalemu, avikulaga ndongwa tsa Mulungu bila kuva na muloto. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kahi alonganaga na kusumana na Vayawudi wo valongaga Chijilichi, lechelelo vene vajelaga kumukopola. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Hala vala wo vamutumbye Chilisito hovavaga kulutsela lulongwa ulo, vakamusindikitsaje Sawuli mbaka ku Kayisaliya, nayo Sawuli akabitaje ku muji gwa Taliso.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ihyo vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito va ku Yudeya yeka, na va ku Galilaya na va ku Samaliya vakikalaje kwa wusichimafu. Vakapataje wukangatso na wuhongetso wa Muhe va Mulungu, vala wo vamutumbaga Mulungu vakongetsekaje na kwendelela kudita kota fyo an'gana.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo ku miji ja Lida na Yafwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petulo hoavaga an'jendajenda kubita chila hono, akabitaje kuvajendela vanu wo vaditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu wo vikalaga ku muji gwa Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Kuko akamuwonaje munu yumwe yo achemwaga Ayineya, yo atamikaga namwa ya kupola kwa myaka nane, avaga avasise mulusaga. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Ihyo Petulo akamulonjelaje, “Ayineya, Yesu Chilisito akuponitse. Winuche upetase lusaga lwako.” Luvala lulo Ayineya akinukaje. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Vanu veka wo vikalaga ku muji gwa Lida na livindi lya Saloni hovavaga kumuwona Ayineya an'jenda vakamutumbaje Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Kuko ku muji gwa Yafwa kwavaga na mudahitswa yumwe litawa lyake Tabita, na kwa Chijilichi achemwaga Dolikasi lyo lina mana ya ntsolimba. Mudala uyo avaga mulibulitsi na muwuya ndalahela, avatangaga vanu kwa sadaka tso atawulaga. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Luvala ulo akatamikaje na kufwa, hovavaga kuguhofuga muvili gwake, vakaguvikaje mu chumba cha ku golofwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Ugo muji gwa Yafwa sigwavaga kutali na muji gwa Lida, nawo vadahitswa vavaga kuhulika kuta Petulo ali kuko vakavatumaje vanu vavili vabite vakamucheme, nawo hovavaga kufika vakamugongolaje na kumulonjela kuta, “Ulekaje kuhava kutsa kwetu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Petulo akawukaje na kubitasa nawo, nayo ho avaga kufika vakamusindikaje mbaka ku chumba cho chili ku golofwa ko vavaga vagulambaliche muvili gwa Dolikasi. Vafwile wolofu vavembaga na kumulajila myenda na makoti gala go ahonaga Dolikasi hoavaga ang'acha mumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petulo akavahumyaje kivala vanu veka, na kumusuka Mulungu kuno imile habehi na muvili akalongaje, “Tabita, lamuche.” Tabita akagubulaje miho gake na hoavaga kumuwona Petulo, akinukaje na kikalisa. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petulo akamutangaje kwima, hambele akavachemaje vala vanu vahagulwa na vala vafwile akamukabitsaje kwawo kuno ali mumi. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Ndongwa itso tsikatagalilaje chila hono mu muji gwa Yafwa, na vanu wolofu vakamutumbaje Mutwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petulo akikalaje Yafwa kwa siku ntsolofu, na ikalaga hamwe na Simoni muwuyapi va finu fya nyingo.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petulo na Kolineliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kwavaga na munu yumwe yo anchemwa litawa lyake Kolineliyo, yo ikalaga ku muji gwa Kayisaliya yo avaga muvina va chikundi cha vimilitsi cho chatselanikaga kota chikundi cha Chiitaliyano. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Mwene avaga munu muwuya na amufugamilaga Mulungu hamwe na vanu va mu nyumba yake. Avapelaga vanu finu fyolofu na kumusuka Mulungu chila siku. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Siku yimwe hamunyi yavaga kota sa tisa hino, kuno alimiho akamuwonaje mu nduntsuchilo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akatsaje na kumuchema, “Kolineliyo!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kolineliyo kwa muhwehwe akamukangatsilaje miho yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu na kumuputsa, “Kuna chinu chachi, Muvina?” Mutantsi yula va kilanga va Mulungu akamulonjelaje, Suko tsako na sadaka tsako tso uvatantsile vanu tsifisile kilanga na tsiveye wiwuso halutalo ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Ino lelo uvatume vanu vatunga vabite ku muji gwa Yafwa, vakamucheme munu yumwe litawa lyake Simoni yo anchemwa litawa linji Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Mwene yo mujentsi va munu yo anchemwa Simoni muwuyapi va finu fya nyingo, nyumba yake yili mulubali lwa bahali. <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu yo alongaga nayo hoavaga kuwuka, Kolineliyo akavachemaje vatantsi vake vavili, hamwe na mwimilitsi vake yumwe yo amufugamilaga Mulungu hagati ha vala wo vamutangaga katsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kolineliyo akavalonjelaje ndongwa tseka tso tsihumye, na kuvatuma vabite ku muji gwa Yafwa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Siku ya kavili hovavaga kufika habehi na muji gwa Yafwa yavaga kota sasita ya hamunyi, Petulo akakwinaje mukano ya nyumba ili amusuche Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Hoavaga ansuka akawonaje tsala yintama na akaganaje kulya, lechelelo hovavaga van'teleka chilyo, akawonaje nduntsuchilo. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Petulo akawonaje kilanga kwa Mulungu kudinduche na chinu chinakota mugolole mukomi gunkwiswa mu inyi kwa mbali tsake tsitayi. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mugati mwa mugolole ugo mwavaga na chila ayina tsa minyama, kwavaga na minyama jinya magulu gatayi, na minyama jo jinkwava mu inyi na ayina tseka tsa fideje. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Akahulikaje litsi, “Petulo, winuche usintse ulye!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petulo akajibulaje, “Ndaya Mutwa, heni ntsing'ali kulya chinu cho chalemitswe mu malajitso ga Musa awu cho chingumudita munu aleche kudichilwa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Akahulikaje kanji litsi lila, “Uleche kufichema finu fyo afidiche Mulungu kuta filemitswe mu malajitso ga Musa!” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Lulongwa ulo lukakolekaje mala kadatu, na luvala lulo mugolole gula gukapilulwaje Kilanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petulo hoavaga ang'acha angiputsa kwa chila cho achiwene mu nduntsuchilo, vanu vala wo vavaga vatumilwe na Kolineliyo vakayiwonaje nyumba ya Simoni muwuyapi va finu fya nyingo na kwima halutalo ha lwitsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Vakahodetsaje na kuwutsa, “Mbe, hano hana mujentsi yoyuve yoanchemwa Simoni litawa linji Petulo?” <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petulo hoavavga ang'acha anhotsa mana ya nduntsuchilo tsila, Muhe va Mulungu akamulonjelaje, “Simoni! Kuna vanu vadatu vangukusaka. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Wiche mubitase na uleche kogopa kwasawuli heni yo ntsivatumile.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Ihyo Petulo akikaje hasi na kuvalonjela vanu vala, “Heni yo yula yo munsaka. Mutsitse mun'gana chichi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Vene vakamujibulaje, “Kolineliyo muvina va vimilitsi na munu muwuya, na yo angumufugamila Mulungu na munu mutambulwa kwa Vayawudi veka alajitswe na mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu kuta ubite mu nyumba yake, ili ahulikitse chila cho ukumulonjela.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petulo akavalibulitsaje mu nyumba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Hamilawu iyage, Petulo akantsaje lujendo hamwe nawo na vayage vamwe wo vamutumbye Chilisito va kuko ku muji gwa Yafwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Siku ya kavili vakafikaje ku Kayisaliya, uyo Kolineliyo avaga anguvatsinda hamwe na vanu vake va habehi na vang'olotse wo avaga avalibulitse. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petulo hoavaga ankwinjila hono hala, Kolineliyo akahumaje kivala ili amulibulitse, akamufugamilaje na kumuhonamila ha magulu gake kwa kumuhesimila. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Lechelelo Petulo akamwinulaje na kumulonjela kuta, “Wime, kwasawuli na heni ntsili munu hela kota heve.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petulo hoavaga ankwendelela kulongana na Kolineliyo kuno vankwinjila mu nyumba yila, akavafikaje vanu wolofu vakong'ine. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Petulo akavalonjelaje vanu vala, “Henye veka mun'tsela kuta malajitso ga Musa gangumulemetsa Muyawudi yoyuve kihantsa awu kijendela na munu yoyuve yosi Muyawudi. Lechelelo Mulungu andemitse ndekaje kuhotsa kuta munu yoyuve yosi Muyawudi sinambe aganiche halutalo ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ihyo homuvije munyema sindemile kutsa. Lelo mundonjele, munyemile kwasawuli yachi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kolineliyo akamulonjelaje, siku tsidatu tso tsilutye luvala kota lulunago, sa tisa ya hamunyi ntsavaga ntsinsuka mu nyumba. Luvala lulo akahumilaje munu yo afwite myenda myelu tswee! Akimaje halutalo hangu, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />akalongaje, “Kolineliyo! Mulungu ahuliche suko yako na sadaka tsako atsidichye. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Ino lelo uvatume vanu vabite ku muji gwa Yafwa, vakamucheme Simoni yo anchemwa Petulo, mujentsi yo angikala mu nyumba ya Simoni muwuyapi va finu fya nyingo, nyumba yake yili habehi na bahali. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ihyo ngasupanitsaje kuvatuma vanu, na heve udisile finofu kutsa. Lelo hetwe tweka tulihano halutalo ha Mulungu kuhulikitsa fila fyeka fyo akulajitse Mutwa utulonjele.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo anguvavikulila vanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Iho Petulo akantsaje kulonga, “Lelo ntseliwe wukweli kuta Mulungu alihela wubagulo, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />lechelelo mu chila inyi, na kwa chila munu yo angumufugamila na kudita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu idichilwaga na mwene. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Luno lo lulongwa lula Mulungu lo alusindiche kwa vanu va Isilaheli na kuvavikulila Ndongwa Nofu tso tsinleta wusichimafu wa Mulungu kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito kuta mwene yo Mutwa va veka. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Henye mun'tsela chila cho chihumye ku Wuyawudi weka kwantsila ku Galilaya, hala Yohana mubatitsi hoavaga kusinda kuvikula lulongwa lwake lwa wubatitso. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Kaha mun'tsela hila Mulungu fyo amuhagwe Yesu va ku Natsaleti na fyo amupelye Muhe vake na wuvetso. Mulungu avaga hamwe nayo ho abitaga chila hono na kudita ndongwa nofu na kuvaponetsa vanu veka wo vavaga van'wonelwa na lilungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Hetwe yo twawene na kuhulika chila chinu cho adisile Yesu ku inyi ya Yudeya na Yelusalemu. Vamukopwe kwa kumuvamba mu musalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Lechelelo Mulungu akamutsilipulaje siku ya kadatu na kumudita awoneche na vanu, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />siyo kwa vanu veka ila kwa vanu vala ng'ani wo avahagwe Mulungu ili valonje chila cho vatsiwene na kuchihulika, na vanu iwo yo hetwe yo twalyeye na kung'wa hamwe nayo Yesu hala hoavaga kutsilipuka. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Uyo Yesu akatulajitsaje tuvavikulile vanu Ndongwa Nofu na kuvalonjela ndongwa tso twatsiwene kuta mwene yo ahagulwe na Mulungu ili atse avahije vanu wumi na wo vafweye. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Valoli veka va Mulungu valongwe kulonga ndongwa tsake kuta, chila munu yo akumutumba uyo Yesu akuhulumilwa ndongwa ntsibi kukolela kwa litawa lyake.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu wosi Vayawudi vangumwanuchila Muhe va Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petulo hoavaga ang'acha anlonga ndongwa itso, vanu vala veka wovavaga vanhulikitsa ndongwa tso alongaga vakanuchilaje wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Vala Vayawudi wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vavaga vatsitse hamwe na Petulo kuhuma ku muji gwa Yafwa vakapomokaje kwa kuvawona vanu wosi Vayawudi nawo vanuche Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Vakalutselaje lulongwa ulo kwasawuli vavahulikaga vanlongaga kwa kabila ntsinji na kumutsumitsa Mulungu. Ihyo Petulo akalongaje, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Manyi vanu vano vanuche Muhe va Mulungu kota hetwe fyo tukanuche! Mbe, kuna munu yoyuve yo afuluche avalemetse vanu vano valeche kubatitswa kwa malenga?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Akalajitsaje vanu vala vabatitswe mu malenga kwa litawa lya Yesu Chilisito. Nawo vakamusukaje Petulo ikale nawo kwa siku nunga.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Petulo anguvasimulila vanu ku Yelusalemu ndongwa tso tsihumye kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Vatumi hamwe na vanu vanji wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vavaga kuko ku Yudeya vakahulikaje kuta vanu wosi Vayawudi nawo hihilaga vatsidiche Ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ihyo Petulo hoavaga kuwuya ku Yelusalemu, vala vanu wo vaditaga malajitso ga likumbi wo vavaga vamutumbye Chilisito vakamulongaje fibi kuta, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />“Heve uhele mu nyumba tsa vanu wo sivinje likumbi na wichite na kulya hamwe nawo!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Iho lelo Petulo akantsaje kuvalonjela ndongwa tseka tso tsikakoliche kuko luhuma chilongola mbaka cha wudugo akalongaje kuta, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />siku yimwe hontsavaga ku muji gwa Yafwa ntsingumusuka Mulungu, simusika ngawonaje nduntsuchilo, ngawonaje mu nduntsuchilo chinu cho chinakota mugolole chinkwiswa hasi kuhuma Kilanga kwa membo tsake tsitayi mbaka hontsavaga heni. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Ngavaje kuhunjilila mugati na kuhima finofu ngajiwonaje minyama ja mwijejele jo jinya magulu gatayi, na minyama jo jinkwava, hamwe na fideje. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Simusika ngahulikaje litsi, Petulo winuche, usintse ulye. <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Lechelelo heni ngalongaje, Ndaya Mutwa! Heni ntsing'ali kulya chinu cho chalemitswe mu malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Lila litsi kuhuma Kilanga likawilaje lwa kavili kuta Mulungu alemitse kuta ulekaje kuhotsa munu yoyuve yosi Muyawudi sinambe aganiche halutalo ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Lulongwa ulo lukiwilaje mala kadatu na hawudugo wake finu fyeka fikapilulwaje Kilanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Simusika vakatsaje vanu vadatu wo vavaga vatumilwe kuhuma ku Kayisaliya vatse kwa heni, vakimaje halutalo ha nyumba yo ntsikalaga. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muhe va Mulungu akandonjelaje ndeche kihotsa ila mbitase nawo. Vanu iva sita wo vamutumbye Chilisto kuhuma ku Yafwa tukabitasaje hamwe mbaka ku Kayisaliya, tukinjilaje mu nyumba ya Kolineliyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Kolineliyo akatulonjelaje hila fyo amuwene mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu yo avaga imile ha nyumba yake na kumulonjela, “Uvatume vanu vabite ku muji gwa Yafwa kwa munu yo anchemwa Simoni litawa linji Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Uyo mwene akukulonjela ndongwa tso tsikukukulusa heve na vanu veka wovali mu kaye yako. <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Heni hontsavaga kwantsa kulonga hela, luvala lulo nawo vakanuchilaje Muhe va Mulungu kota hila fyo twamwanuchye hetwe iho hamutalo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Iho ho ngiwukaje tsila Ndongwa tsa Mutwa tso avaga atulonje kuta Yohana abatitse kwa malenga, lechelelo henye mukubatitswa kwa Muhe va Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ihyo manyi yive Mulungu avapelye Muhe vake vanu vano kota fyo atupelye na hetwe yo tumutumbye Mutwa Yesu Chilisito, heni yo tsi nani mbaka njele kuva tebe na Mulungu?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakalekaje kusumwana nayo, ila vakamutsumitsaje Mulungu na kulonga, “Nachene Mulungu avapelye na vanu wosi Vayawudi vihale na kutsileka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na kuvapela wumi wo wugaya wudugo”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito cha ku Andiyochiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Ihyo vala vanu wo vavaga vamutumbye Chilisito wo vavaga vatagalye kwasawuli ya ng'odeko tso tsihumye kwasawuli ya chifo cha Sitefwani, vakabitaje kutali mbaka ku Foyiniche, na ku Chipulo, na ku Andiyochiya. Nawo si vakavikwe Ndongwa tsa Mulungu kwa munu yoyuve ila kwa Vayawudi ng'ani. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Lechelelo kwavaga na vanu vatunga wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vahumye ku Chipulo na ku Chilene wo vahele ku Andiyochiya kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mutwa Yesu kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Wuvetso wa Mutwa wavaga hamwe nawo na vanu wolofu vakatumbaje na kumupituchila Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Ndongwa itso hotsavaga kuhulikwa na vanu wo vavaga vamutumbye Chilisito ku Yelusalemu, nawo vakamutumaje Balinaba abite ku Andiyochiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Nayo hoavaga kufika na kuwona hila Mulungu fyo avaditye wuwuya wake, akasangalalaje ndalahela na kuvalonjela vanu veka vihantse na Mutwa luhuma mugati mu numbula tsawo. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Balinaba avaga munu muwuya na avaga amutumbye Chilisito na kulongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu, nawo vanu wolofu vakongetsekaje kumutumba Mutwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Kaha Balinaba akabitaje ku muji gwa Taliso kumusaka Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Avaga kumuwona akamutolaje vakabitasaje ku Andiyochiya na kwa luvala lwa mwaka gweka Balinaba na Sawuli vitang'anaga na chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito na kuvadahitsa vanu wolofu. Iho ho vadahitswa ho vantsitse kuchemwa Vachilisito uko Andiyochiya.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Luvala ulo valoli va Mulungu vakikaje kuhuma ku Yelusalemu mbaka Andiyochiya.<verse eid="ACT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Muloli yumwe va Mulungu litawa lyake achemwaga Hagabo, akimaje akantsaje kulonga kwa wuvetso wa Muhe va Mulungu kuta ntsala ngomi yikuhumila ku inyi tseka, nayo yikahumilaje ha siku tsa wuntsajila wa Kayisali Chilawudiyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Vala vadahitswa vakalamulaje kuta chila munu kota wuwetso wake fyowuli, atawule finu ili kuvatanga mu katsi iyo vayawo wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vangikala ku Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Vakaditaje hihyo na finu fyawo fyo vatawe fikasindikwaje kwa vavina vawo kukolela kwa Balinaba na Sawuli.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito vankodwa ndalahela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Luvala lulo Muntsajila Helode Ajilipa akantsaje kuvabata na kuvakoda vanu vatunga wo vavaga mu chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Akalajitsaje vamukopole na Yakobo mung'olotse va Yohana kwa waladi. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Hoavaga kuwona Vayawudi valuganite lulongwa ulo, akamubataje na Petulo. Lulongwa ulo adisile ha chipindi cha liwungo lya mikate jo jigaya hamila. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Hoavaga kumubata Petulo akamudindilaje mu nyumba ya vawopwa ha wimilitsi wa fikundi fitayi fya vimilitsi vatayi vatayi ili vamwimilile. Helode ahotsaga kuta akumuhumya halutalo ha vanu na kumuhiga holikuva lilutye liwungo lya Pasaka. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Ihyo Petulo hoavaga ang'acha ali munyumba ya vawopwa, nacho chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito chikamusuchilaje ndalahela kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo anhumwa mu nyumba ya vawopwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Chilo chicho Helode Ajilipa hoavaga ang'acha ang'ali kumuhumya na kumuhiga, Petulo avaga avasise hagati ha vimilitsi vavili. Kuno awopitwe nyololo tsivili na vimilitsi vanji vavaga vankwimilila lwitsi lwa nyumba ya vawopwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Luvala lulo akahumilaje mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu na kwima habehi na Petulo na mwangatsa gukang'alikaje mu chumba cha nyumba ya vawopwa. Mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamudometsaje Petulo mulubafu na kumulamusa na akalongaje, “Wangufitse uwuche!” Luvala lulo nyololo tsikawopokaje na kugwa hasi. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamulonjelaje, “Ufwale myenda jako na ndatu tsako.” Petulo akafwalaje, na kaha akamulonjelaje, “Ufwale mugolole gwako na ufwate heni.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petulo akahumaje mula mu nyumba ya vawopwa kuno valihamwe na yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu. Nayo siatselaga chila cho chihumye kuta chavaga kweli, mwene ahotsaga kuta an'wona nduntsuchilo. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Vakalutilaje ha lwimililo lulongola na lwa kavili na vakafikaje mbaka ha lwitsi lwa chuma lwa kwinjilila ku mujini. Lwitsi ulo lukadindukaje lwene, nawo vakalutilaje iho vakahumaje kivala. Hovavaga mung'asi yula mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akamulekaje Petulo. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Iho ho Petulo akatselaje wukweli wa chila chochihumye na kilonjela, “Lelo ntselye nachene kuta Mutwa amulajitse mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu na kung'ulusa mu lulongwa lula loavaga angulutsinda Helode Ajilipa na Vayawudi veka.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Petulo hoavaga kutsela ihyo akabitaje mbaka ku kaye ya Maliyamu yuve va Yohana yo achemwaga litawa linji Maliko. Uko kwavaga na vanu wolofu vakong'ine kumusuka Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petulo hoavaga kuhodetsa ha lwitsi lukomi lwa kivala, muhintsa mupogotsi litawa lyake Loda, akabitaje ili amudindulile. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nayo uyo muhintsa hoavaga kulitsela litsi ilyo kuta lya Petulo, akahechelelaje ndalahela na kuleka kumudindulila lwitsi akabilimilaje mu nyumba na kuvalonjela vanu kuta Petulo ali ha lwitsi lwa kwinjilila anhodetsa. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Vene vakamulonjelaje muhintsa yula, “Una lukwale heve!” Lechelelo mwene akagwadilaje kuvalonjela kuta nye wukweli. Ino vene vakawilaje kumulonjelaje kuta, “Uyo akuva mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Lechelelo luvala ulo Petulo endelelaga kuhodetsa, hambele nawo vakadindulaje lwitsi na vakamuwonaje kuta yo mwene, ila vene vakapomokaje ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Lechelelo Petulo akavagololelaje liwoko lyake kulajila kuta vakatuche, nayo kavalonjelaje hila Mutwa fyo amuhumitse mu nyumba ya vawopwa. Akawilaje kuvalonjela kuta, “Mukamulonjele Yakobo hamwe na vala vanu vanji wo vamutumbye Chilisito ndongwa tsino.” Simusika Petulo akawukaje na kubita kono kunji.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Hokwavaga kucha vala vimilitsi vakavaje na muloto ndalahela, kwasawuli ya Petulo ayatsile na kuta lulongwa ulo lukuva ndawuli. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helode akalajitsaje kuta vamusache Petulo chila hono, nawo hovavaga kulemwa kumuwona. Ihyo akavaputsanitsaje vala vimilitsi na hambele akalajitsaje vakopolwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Lwavaga kulutila lulongwa ulo, Helode Ajilipa akawukaje ku Yudeya na kubita ku muji gwa Kayisaliya akikalaje kuko kwa siku nunga.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helode Ajilipa antajika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Vanu va miji ja Tilo na Sidoni vavaga vamuvifitse ndalahela Helode Ajilipa, ihyo vanu va miji ijo jivili vakakong'anaje hamwe na vakabitaje vakalongane nayo. Nawo vakamugongolaje Bulasito yo avaga mutantsi va kihuvilwa va Helode Ajilipa ili vasuche wusichimafu, kwasawuli inyi yawo yapataga chilyo mu inyi iyo.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Siku yimwe nyagulwa, Helode Ajilipa akafwalaje myenda jake ja chintsajila na kikala mu chigoda cha kuhijila na kwantsa kulongana na vanu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Vanu wovavaga vakong'ine hono hala vakayovaje, “Ili litsi lya Mulungu vetu, siyo litsi lya munu ndaya!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Luvala lulo mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akumutovaje na kumugwisa hasi Helode Ajilipa, kwasawuli ya kuleka kumupela Mulungu ntsumitso itso. Njili yikamuwopaje mbaka hambele akatajikaje.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ndongwa tsa Mulungu tsikalutilaje kutagalila chila hono.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Balinaba na Sawuli hovavaga kusinda yila katsi yawo wo vavaga vahele kuyidita, ihyo vakawuyaje ku Yelusalemu hamwe na Yohana yo achemwaga litawa linji Maliko.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sawuli vanhagulwa na kutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Iho ha Chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito cha ku Andiyochiya kwavaga na valoli va Mulungu na vadahitsi. Nawo wo Balinaba na Simoni yo achemwaga Mutitu, na Luchiyo va ku Chilene, na Manayeni yo avaga vakalagise hamwe na Helode Andipasi na Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Hovavaga vangumusuka Mutwa na kuleka kulya kwasawuli ya Mulungu, Muhe va Mulungu akalongaje, “Mumbagulile Balinaba na Sawuli kwa katsi yila yo ntsivachemye.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Hovavaga kusinda kumusuka Mutwa na kuleka kulya kwasawuli ya Mulungu, vakavavichilaje mawoko Balinaba na Sawuli kwa kuvasuchila na vakavalekaje vabite.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sawuli vam'bita ku Chipulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Balinaba na Sawuli kwa kutumwa na Muhe va Mulungu, vakawukaje na kubita ku inyi ya Selewuchiya, na kuhuma uko vakakolelaje mu bahali mbaka hono hakafu hohapilimwe na malenga ho hachemwaga Chipulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Hovavaga kufika ha muji gwa Salami, vakavikulaje Ndongwa tsa Mulungu mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi. Kaha vavaga hamwe na Yohana yoachemwaga litawa linji Maliko yo avaga anguvatanga katsi tsawo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Hovavaga kulutila mu inyi itso tseka vakafikaje mbaka ku muji gwa Pafwo hono hakafu hohavaga hapilimwe na malenga, hono iho vakitang'anaje na munu yumwe muhavi na muloli va wudesi yo achemwaga litawa lyake Bali Yesu va kuhuma ku inyi ya Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Munu uyo avaga hamwe na Selijiyo Pawulo, yo avaga munu muvina va hono hala hakafu hohapilimwe na malenga na avaga na nyala ndalahela. Ihyo Selijiyo Pawulo akavalibulitsaje Sawuli na Balinaba ili ahulikitse Ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Lechelelo yula muhavi yo achemwaga litawa lyake Elima kwa Chijilichi, akajelaje kusumana na Balinaba na Sawuli ili amuyatse yula muvina ili aleche kumutumba Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Iho Sawuli yo avaga anchemwa litawa linji Pawulo kuno anlongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu, akamufwalanulilaje miho uyo muhavi, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />na kumulonjela, “Heve yo umemile wudesi na wubunganyisi! Heve ulimwana va lilungu! Kaha uli mutelani va chila munu yo an'dita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. Mbe, ukuleka hanili kutsibibinda ng'asi tsa Mutwa tso tsigolwiche? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Lelo wuvetso wa Mutwa wukukutova heve! Nave ukuva chibofu na siukuguwona mwangatsa gwa litsuva kwa luvala lutunga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Luvala lulo Elima uyo muhavi akabofolaje na akantsaje kubita kuno na kuno angumusaka munu va kumubata liwoko na kumulajila koyili ng'asi. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Yula muvina va hono hala hoavaga kuwona chila chochihumye akamutumbaje Mutwa Yesu, nayo apomwitswe na madahitso gala ga Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo na Balinaba ku Andiyochiya ya ku Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Duve Pawulo na vayage vakawukaje kuhuma ku Pafwo na kufika ku Pelije, mu muji gula gwa Pamufiliya. Yohana yo achemwaga Maliko akavalekaje vayage kuko na kuwuya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Lechelelo Pawulo na Balinaba vakendelelaje na lujendo kuhuma ku muji gwa Pelije vakabitaje mbaka ku muji gwa Andiyochiya gogwavaga ku mukova gwa Pisidiya. Siku ya Kwesela vakinjilaje mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi na kikalisa. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Hogavaga kusila kusomwa mandiko ga malajitso ga Musa na ga valoli va Mulungu, vavina va nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi vakavatumilaje wujumbe Pawulo na Balinaba kuvalonjela, “Nye vayetu manyi munalo lulongwa lo lufuluche luvakangatse vanu vano muvalonjele.”<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pawulo akimaje akavapunjilaje liwoko na kwantsa kuvalonjela kuta,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">Henye va Isilaheli vayangu na henye nyeka wosi Vayawudi wo mungumufugamila Mulungu munyulikitse! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mulungu va vanu va Isilaheli avahagwe vakukwetu, na kuvadita vave kabila ngomi hovavaga ku inyi ya Misili. Mulungu kwa wuvetso wukomi avalongwitse na kuvahumya mu inyi yila, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />na kwa myaka alubayini avafumilye ng'olwa tsawo tsa wutimbing'afu tso vaditaga ku mbuga. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Mulungu avakopwe vanu va kabila tsila saba wo vikalaga mu inyi ya Kanani, akavapelaje Vaisilaheli inyi iyo ili yive yawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ndongwa itsi tseka tsahumye kwa myaka kota miya ine na hamusini hino.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso tseka, Mulungu akavapelaje valamutsi vavalongotse vanu mbaka ha chipindi cha Samweli muloli va Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Hambele vanu vakasukaje vapelwe muntsajila, ihyo Mulungu akavapelaje Sawuli mwana va Chisi va likabila lya Benjamini ili ave muntsajila vawo. Nayo akavaje muntsajila kwa myaka alubayini. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Mulungu hoavaga kumuhetsa Sawuli mu wuntsajila, akamuhagulaje Dawudi ave muntsajila vawo. Mulungu akalongaje kuta ntsimuwene Dawudi mwana va Yese, munu yo akudita kota fyo tsin'gana heni, nayo yo akudita finu fyeka fyo ntsin'gana heni. <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kukolela ku chilelo cha uyo Dawudi, Mulungu kota fyo avaga alontsile luhuma katali, akavasindichilaje vanu va Isilaheli, Yesu Mukulusi. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yesu hoavaga ang'acha ang'ali kwantsa katsi yake, Yohana Mubatitsi amulongwe na kuvavikulila vanu veka va Isilaheli kuta vamupituchile Mulungu na kubatitswa. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yohana hoavaga ansinda katsi ya kuvikula wujumbe wake akavalonjelaje vanu kuta, henye munkuta heni ntsili nani? Heni siyo Chilisito yo mungumutsindila. Lechelelo mwene yo ankutsa mumbele mwangu, uyo heni sifuluche njele kuwopola nambe ndejesi tsa ndatu tsake.<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Vang'olotsangu Vaisilaeli, henye yo muli vana va lukolo lwa Ibulahimu, na henye vanu wosi Vayawudi yo mungumufumila Mulungu, ndongwa tsino tsa wukuluso tsitsitse kwasawuli ya hetwe tweka! <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Vanu veka wo vangikala ku Yelusalemu hamwe na vavina vawo sivakamutselye kuta Yesu yo Mukulusi, kaha sivakatseliwe ndongwa tsa valoli va Mulungu tso ntsasomwaga chila Siku ya Kwesela, ila vakatsikwitsaje ndongwa itso tsa valoli va Mulungu kwa kumuhiga Yesu akopolwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Nayivaje sivayipasile nongwa yoyive yo yikumwambutsa ahigwe kukopolwa. Vamususile Pilato amuhije chifo. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Hovavaga kumuditila chila chinu cho chandikwe kwasawuli ya mwene, hovavaga kumukopola kwa kumuvamba mumusalaba, vakamwisaje na kumuvika mu kabuli yo yihongulwe mumalika. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Lechelelo Mulungu akamutsilipulaje, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />na kwa siku ntsolofu akavahumilaje vala wo avavaga an'jendasa hamwe nawo kwantsila ku muji Galilaya mbaka ku muji gwa Yelusalemu. Nawo lelo wo vanlonga kwa vanu veka chila chovachiwene na cho vakahuliche. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Hetwe natwe tuli hano tuvaletye Ndongwa Nofu tso Mulungu avaga alontsile na vakukwetu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Ino lelo Mulungu atsikwitsitse kwa hetwe yo tuli vatsukulu vawo kwa kumutsilipula Yesu. Kota hila fyo yandikwe mu chitabu cha Tsabuli ya kavili kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">Heve yo uli Mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">heni munyiguno mbeye Dado.<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Mulungu amutsilipwe Yesu ili muvili gwake guleche kuwola kota hila Mulungu fyo avaga amulonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">Nachene ngukupela heve fichililo nyagulwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">kota tso ntsamulonje Dawudi.<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Kota fyo yandikwe hono hanji muchitabu cha Tsabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">Siukumuleka Muhagulwa vako awole.<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Dawudi hoavaga kudita chila cho aganaga Mulungu ha chilelo chake, akafwaje na akatsikwaje habehi na hovavaga vatsisilwe vakukwe, na muvili gwake gukawolelaje mukabuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Lechelelo yula yo atsilipulwe na Mulungu, uyo yo muvili gwake sigwawotsile.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Ihyo lelo vang'olotsangu Vaisilaheli ntsin'gana mutsele kuta kwa kukolela uyo Yesu kuhulumilwa kwa ndongwa ntsibi kunvikulwa kwenyu. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Munu yoave yo angumutumba Yesu akuhulumilwa ndongwa tsake ntsibi na kidichilwa halutalo ha Mulungu, lulongwa lo silufuluche luve kwa kugahulikitsa malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Ihyo lelo mwiyangalile ili ndongwa tsila tso tsalontsilwe na valoli va Mulungu tsileche kuvapata na henye,<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />Muhulikitse henye mu vanya mbedatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">mutinuche na kuyaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">kwasawuli chinu cho ngudita sambi, ha siku tsenyu cho simufuluche muchidichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">nambe munu avalonjele.<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Pawulo na Balinaba hovavaga vanhuma mu nyumba yila ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, vala vanu vakavasukaje vabite vakavalonjele kanji ndongwa itso ha Siku yinji ya Kwesela. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Vanu hovavaga kuwuka kuhuma hono hala hovavaga vakong'ine, Vayawudi na vanji wosi Vayawudi wo vayitumbye dini ya Chiyawudi, vakavafwataje Pawulo na Balinaba, nawo Pawulo na Balinaba vakalonganaje nawo na kuvakangatsa numbula tsawo kuta vikale kwa kihuvila wuwuya wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Hoyavaga kufika Siku yinji ya Kwesela, vanu wolofu va mu muji gula vakatsaje kuhulikitsa Ndongwa Nofu tsa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Vayawudi hovavaga kuliwona lilugu ilyo lya vanu, vakawonaje mbafya na kudana ndongwa tso avaga an'vikula Pawulo na kumuliga. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Lechelelo Pawulo na Balinaba vakalonganaje nawo hilo bila muloto goguve kuta, yiganikije tandi kuvalonjela henye Ndongwa tsa Mulungu. Lechelelo mutsilemile, na ihyo mwihitsile muvene kuta henye sinambe muganiche ku wumi wa siku tseka, lelo hetwe tunguvaleka na kubita kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi.<verse eid="ACT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Igano go malajitso go atulajitse Mutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">Ntsivahagwe henye muve mwangatsa kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">ili muve chambutso cha wukuluso wa vanu mbaka ku inyi tseka.<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Vala vanu wosi Vayawudi hovavaga kuhulika lulongwa ulo, vakahechelelaje ndalahela na vakatsitsumitsaje Ndongwa tsa Mutwa. Nawo vanu veka wo vahagulwe na Mulungu mu wumi wa siku tseka vakamutumbaje Mutwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Ndongwa tsa Mutwa tsikatagalilaje chila hono mu inyi yila yeka. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Lechelelo vavina va Vayawudi vakavakokaje vadala vanya fyewo, na vavina va muji hamwe na valume vatambulwa va muji ugo. Ihyo vakantsaje kuvakoda Pawulo na Balinaba na kuvavinga vahume mu inyi yawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Ihyo Pawulo na Balinaba vakakung'unaje mingundi jo javaga mumagulu gawo kuvalajila kuta vene valimuduhu kwa wubi wo wukuvapata vanu iwo na kuwuka kubita ku muji gwa Ikoniyo. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Vadahitswa va ku muji gwa Antiyochiya vakavaje na wusangalo na vakalongotswaje na Muhe va Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo na Balinaba uko ku Ikoniyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Uko ku muji gwa Ikoniyo ndongwa tsikavaje kota fyo tsavaga kula ku Andiyochiya, Pawulo na Balinaba vakinjilaje hamwe mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi kota fyo vaditaga. Vakavikulaje kwa wuvetso wukomi, mbaka Vayawudi wolofu na vanu wosi Vayawudi vakamutumbilaje Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Lechelelo Vayawudi vanji wo valemile kumutumba Chilisito, vakavakokaje vanu wosi Vayawudi na kuvadita vasumane na vanu vala wo vamutumbye Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Hamwe na kuvipilwa uko, Pawulo na Balinaba vakikalaje kuko kwa luvala lutali. Valongaga Ndongwa tsa Mutwa bila kuwona muloto, nayo Mutwa akawugubulaje wukweli kwa ndongwa tsake kwa kuvapela wuvetso iwo vatumi, nawo vakaditaje miwujitsa na mitinuso. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Lechelelo vanu va muji gula vakabagukaje, vamwe vakavaje lubali lwa Vayawudi na vamwe lubali lwa vatumi. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Vanu vatunga Vayawudi na wosi Vayawudi vakihantsaje na filongotsi vatunga, nawo vakalaganaje kuvaditila vatumi chitika na kuvatova kwa maganga. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Vatumi hovavaga kulutsela lulongwa ulo, vakabilimilaje ku miji ja Lisitila na Delibe, na ku muji gwa Likawoniya na ku miji ja habehi na hono iho, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />na kuko vavaga vanguvavikulila vanu Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo na Balinaba ku miji ja Lisitila na Delibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Mu muji gwa Lisitila kwavaga na munu yumwe mulume chiteve siavaga ajentsile nambe siku yimwe luhuma kuleleka. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Munu uyo amuhulikitsaga Pawulo hoavaga anvikula Ndongwa tsa Mutwa Yesu. Pawulo hoavaga kumukangatsila miho, akatselaje kuta ana litumbilo lya kuponetswa, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />akamulonjelaje fikami, “Wime kwa magulu gako!” Luvala lulo munu yula chiteve akinukaje na kwantsa kujenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Lilugu lya vanu hovavaga kuchiwona chila cho adisile Pawulo, vakantsaje kuyova kwa kabila ya Chilikawoniya, “Mihoka jiveye kota vanu na kutwichila hetwe!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Vanu iwo vakamuchemaje Balinaba litawa lya Tsewu litawa lya lilungu lyawo likomi na Pawulo vakamuchemaje Helime litawa lya lilungu linji, kwasawuli uyo Pawulo yo avaga mulongontsi va ndonga. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Mutawula nambiko va lilungu lya Tsewu hono hawo ha kusalila ho havaga habehi na muji, akaletaje misenga milume na fitsanga fya wuluva ha lwitsi lwa muji, ili mwene na lila lilugu lya vanu vatawule sadaka kwa vatumi. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Lechelelo Balinaba na Pawulo hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakalalatulaje myenda jawo ili kulajila kuta valulema lulongwa ulo, vakabilimaje hagatinagati ha lilugu lya vanu na kulonga fikami kuta, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Nye vanyalukolo kwasawuli yachi mun'dita ndongwa tsino? Hetwe natwe tuli vanu hela kota henye! Tuli hono hano kuvalonjela Ndongwa Nofu ili mupituche kuhuma mu ndongwa tsino tsa wudesi na muleche kujifugamila misanamu na mumufwate Mulungu yo mumi, yo awumbite Kilanga na Inyi na bahali na finu fyeka fyofyofili. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Iho hakatali Mulungu avalesile vanu veka wosi Vayawudi vadite kota fyo van'gana vene. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Lechelelo Mulungu ilajilaga kwa vanu kwa ndongwa nofu tso avaditilaga. Avaditye wuwuya wake kwa kuvapela ndonya kuhuma kilanga na kuvapela fibetwa kwa luvala lo lwaganikaga, na kuvagutitsa filyo na kuvapela wusangalafu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Kwa kulonga ndongwa itso Pawulo na Balinaba vavetsitse kuvalemetsa kwa kunanahitsa ndalahela vanu vala valeche kuvatawulila sadaka ihyo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Hambele Vayawudi vanji wo vahumye ku muji gwa Andiyochiya na ku muji gwa Ikoniyo vakavakokaje vanu vala, vakamutovaje Pawulo kwa maganga na kumubuluna mbaka kivala kwa muji, vatyaga kuta mwanga afweye. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Lechelelo vadahitswa hovavaga vamupilime chila lubali, akinukaje na kuwuya ku mujini. Hamilawu iyage mwene Pawulo na Balinaba vakawukaje na kubita mbaka ku Delibe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo na Balinaba van'wuya kaha ku Andiyochiya ku mukova gwa Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Pawulo na Balinaba vakavikulaje Ndongwa Nofu ha muji ugo gwa Delibe na kupata vadahitswa wolofu. Ihyo vakapilukaje na kukolela kaha ku muji gwa Lisitila na Ikoniyo mbaka ku muji gwa Andiyochiya ya Pisidiya, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />vakavakangatsaje vadahitswa na kuvalonjela kuta vendelelaje kikala mu litumbilo na kuta, “Vanu vakutukoda ho tukuva tun'gacha kwinjila ku wuntsajila wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Pawulo na Balinaba hovavaga kuvahagula filongotsi ha chila ho chavaga chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito, na kusuka hamwe na kuleka kulya kwasawuli ya Mulungu, ili vimililwe na Mutwa yo vamutumbye.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Hovavaga kuvikula uko, vakakolelaje ku mukova gwa Pisidiya na kufika ku mukova gwa Pamufiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Hovavaga kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu ku Pelije, vakabitaje mbaka ku Hataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kuhuma uko vakajendaje kwa meli na kuwuya ku Andiyochiya, uko ko hamutalo vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito vavaga vavasuchye kwa kuvavichila mawoko na ili vapelwe wuwuya wa Mulungu kwasawuli ya katsi iyo yo vavaga vachemilwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Hovavaga kufika uko ku Andiochiya vakavikaje chikalo na chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito cha hono iho, na kuvalonjela ndongwa tseka tso adisile Mulungu kukolela kwa vene na hila Mulungu fyo avadichye vanu wosi Vayawudi kumutumbila Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Pawulo na Balinaba vakikalaje ku Andiyochiya hamwe na vadahitswa kwa siku ntsolofu.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Vatumi na vavina vawo vangitang'ana ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Ihyo vanu vatunga vakikaje kuhuma ku Yudeya vakabitaje ku Andiyochiya, nawo vakantsaje kuvadahitsa vanu wosi Vayawudi wo vamutumbye Chilisito kuta, manyi muleche kwinjila likumbi kota fyotsili ntsovelo tsa Musa simufuluche mwanuchile wukuluso. <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Lulongwa ulo lukaditaje Pawulo na Balinaba vasumane na vayawo. Ihyo vakavahagulaje Pawulo na Balinaba hamwe na vanu vanji va kuhuma ku Andiyochiya wo vamutumbye Yesu, vabite ku Yelusalemu kwa vatumi na vavina kwasawuli ya kuvawutsa lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Ihyo lujendo ulo vakatangwaje na chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito cha ku Andiyochiya nawo vakavalagaje, na hovavaga vanlutila ku Foyiniche na ku Samaliya vakavalonjelaje vanu hila vanu wosi Vayawudi fyo vamupituchilye Mulungu. Ndongwa tsino tsikaletaje wusangalo wukomi kwa chikundi cha Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Hovavaga kufika ku Yelusalemu vakalibulitswaje na chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito na vatumi na vavina. Iho Pawulo na Balinaba vakavalonjelaje chila chinu cho avaga adisile Mulungu kukolela kwa vene. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Lechelelo Vafwalisayo vamwe wo vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito, vakimaje na kulonga, “Iwo vanu wosi Vayawudi van'ganika kwingitswa likumbi na kudahitswa ili vagadite malajitso ga Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Duve Vatumi na vavina vawo vakakong'anaje kulongana lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Hovavaga kulongana kwa luvala lutali, Simoni yo achemwaga Petulo akimaje na kulonga, “Nye vang'olotsangu, henye mun'tsela kuta iho hamutalo Mulungu anyagwe ili mbikule Ndongwa Nofu kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi vavetse kuhulika na vamutumbe Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Mulungu yo atsitselaga numbula tsa vanu, alaje kuta anguvadichila kwa kuvapela Muhe vake kota fyo atupelye hetwe. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Mulungu siadisile wubagulo wowuve hagati hetu na vene, ila avahulumye ndongwa tsawo ntsibi kwasawuli vamutumbye Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Ino lelo kwasawuli yachi mun'gana kusumana na Mulungu kwa kuvavichila ndongwa nalamu tso vakukwetu na hetwe tulemilwe kutsidita? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Muleche kudita ihyo, mun'ganika kutsela kuta tunkuluswa kwa wuwuya wa Mutwa Yesu kota hila vene nawo fyo vakulusiswe.” <verse eid="ACT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Vanu veka vakakatukaje myee, vakavahulikitsaje Balinaba na Pawulo hovalongaga kuta kukolela kwawo Mulungu avaditye miwujitsa na mitinuso vanu wosi Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Pawulo na Balinaba hovavaga kusinda kulonga ihyo, Yakobo akalongaje, “Vang'olotsangu munyulikitse! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni avaga alontsile hila iho hamutalo Mulungu fyo ilaje kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi na kuvahagula vanu vatunga ili vave vanu vake. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Lulongwa luno lo vanlonga lunakota tsila ndongwa tsa valoli va Mulungu na kota hila Mandiko ga Mulungu fyo ganlonga,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />Hotsikuva tsilutye ndongwa itso nguwuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na heni ngutsenga kanji nyumba ya Dawudi yoyigweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">ngutsenga kaha malungulu gake.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Iho vanu vanji veka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">vanu wosi Vayawudi na veka wo ntsivahagwe vave vanu vangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">vamusache Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ihyo fyo ntsinlonga heni Mutwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:18">yo adisile lulongwa ulu lutselaniche kuhuma katali.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />“Yakobo akendelelaje kulonga kuta lelo heni ntsinlamula kuta, tuleche kuvagatsa vanu wosi Vayawudi wo vamupituchilye Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Ihyo tuvandichile baluva ya kuvalonjele kuta, valeche kulya finu fyo fitawulwe nambiko kwa mihoka, na valeche waafu na kulya nyama na kung'wa danda ya nyama tso tsifweye tsene bila kusintswa. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kwasawuli luhuma katali malajitso ga Musa gaveye ganvikulwa ha chila muji, na kusomwa mu nyumba tseka tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi ha chila Siku ya Kwesela.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baluva kwa vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito wosi Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Vatumi na filongotsi hamwe na chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito vakalamulaje kuvahagula vanu vatunga hagati hawo na kuvatuma hamwe na Pawulo na Balinaba vabite ku Andiyochiya. Vakamuhagulaje Yuda yoachemwaga Balisaba hamwe na Sila wo vavaga vavina hagati hawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Vakavapelaje baluva yo yandikwe kuta,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“Hetwe vatumi hamwe na filongotsi, tunguvasamusa henye vang'olotsetu wo mumutumbye Chilisito yo muli ku Andiyochiya, na ku Siliya na ku Chilichiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tuhuliche kuta kuna vanu vatunga wovahumye kwetu wo vavaga vatsitse kuko na kuvatindilivasa mahotso genyu bila hetwe kuvalagitsa. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ihyo tulamwe tweka kuvahagula vanu vatunga na kuvatuma kwenyu ili vatse hamwe na vayetu Balinaba na Pawulo, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />wo vidiche nambe kufwa kwasawuli ya Litawa lya Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Hoihyo tunguvatuma kwenyu Yuda na Sila ili vavalonjele finofu ndongwa tsino tso tuvandichilye. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ihyo Muhe va Mulungu na hetwe tulagine kuta tuleche kuvalagitsa ndongwa nalamu kulutila tsino tso tsin'ganika. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Kuta muleche kulya filyo fyo fitawulwe sadaka kwa misanamu, na kung'wa danda, awu kulya nyama ya linyama lyo sililasintswa, na kahi mulekaje kudita waafu. Manyi mwiviche kutali na ndongwa tsino, mukuva mudisile finofu. Yo hetwe tuvayenyu yo tunguvasamusa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ihyo vakavalagaje vala wo vavahagwe na kuvapela baluva, nawo vakawukaje kuhuma ku Yelusalemu na kubita ku Andiyochiya. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Vanu vala hovavaga kwanuchila baluva iyo na kuyisoma, vakasangalalaje ndalahela kwa ndongwa tsila tso tsavakangitse numbula. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Sila wo vavaga valoli, vakavalonjelaje vayawo wo vamutumbye Chilisito ndongwa ntsolofu tsa kuvakangatsa na kuvapela wusangalo. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Hovavaga kikala kwa luvala lutunga, wo vamutumbye Chilisito va ku Andiyochiya vakavalagaje kwa kuvaganila wusichimafu ili vapiluche kwa wo vatumile. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Lechelelo Sila akendelelaje kwikala kuko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibiliya tsinji tsilihela musitali guno</char></note>. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Pawulo na Balinaba vakasigalaje kuko ku Andiyochiya kwa luvala lutunga hamwe na vanu vanji wolofu, vakadahitsaje hamwe na kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo na Balinaba vantelana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku nunga, Pawulo akamulonjelaje Balinaba, “Tupiluche tukavalole vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito wovali ha chila muji go twavavikulye ndongwa tsa Mutwa, tutsele hila fyo vankwendelela,” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Ihyo Balinaba aganaga vamutegule na Yohana yo achemwaga litawa linji Maliko vabitase hamwe nayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Lechelelo Pawulo akamulonjelaje kuta si finofu ndaya tumutegule na Maliko, kwasawuli iho hamutalo hovavaga ku Pamufiliya Maliko avalesile na kulema kwendelela kukola katsi nawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Ihyo kukahumilaje wusumwano wukomi hagati hawo, nawo vakalekanaje. Balinaba akamutegulaje Maliko vakantsaje lujendo kukolela mubahali kubita ku Chipulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Lechelelo Pawulo akamuhagulaje Sila na kuwuka, kuno vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito vanguvasuchila wuwuya wa Mutwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Mulujendo ulo Pawulo akakolelaje ku Siliya na ku Chilichiya, akachikangatsaje chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito kuta valeche kumuleka Mutwa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoseyo angihantsa na Pawulo na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pawulo akatsaje lujendo na kufika ku Delibe na kahi vakafikaje ku Lisitila, kuko kwavaga na mudahitswa yumwe litawa lyake Timoseyo, yuve avaga Muyawudi yo amutumbye Chilisito, lechelelo dade avaga Mujilichi. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Timoseyo avaga muwuya ndalahela kwa vala vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito uko ku Lisitila na Ikoniyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pawulo aganaga Timoseyo vajendase hamwe mulujendo, ihyo akamwingitsaje likumbi. Adisile ihyo kwasawuli Vayawudi veka wovikalaga hono hala, vamutselaga Timoseyo kuta dade avaga Mujilichi. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Hovavaga vam'bita vakakolelaje mu miji jila jeka na kuvapela vanu gala malagitso go galontsilwe na vatumi na vavina va kula Yelusalemu, na vakavalonjelaje vagadichile. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Mulungu akachitangaje chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito cho chavaga ku miji jeka fikimaje finofu mulitumbilo, na vanu vakongetsekaga chila siku.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo an'wona nduntsuchilo ku Tulova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pawulo hamwe na vayage hovavaga mulujendo vakakolelaje ku miji ja Fwilijiya na Galatiya, kwasawuli Muhe va Mulungu avaga avalemitse valeche kutsivikula ndongwa tsa Mutwa kuko Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Vavaga kufika hovavaga kufika mu muji gwa Misiya vakajelaje kubita ku Bisiniya, lechelelo Muhe va Yesu akavalemetsaje valeche kubita. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Ho ihyo vakakolelaje ku Misiya, vakafikaje ku Tulova. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Siku iyo hachilo mu nduntsuchilo Pawulo akamuwonaje munu va ku Machedoniya imile angumugongola, “Lowoche utse kuno Machedoniya ututanje.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Luvala lula Pawulo hoavaga kuwona nduntsuchilo itso, tukasupanitsaje kivika chang'ani kubita Machedoniya kuno tutselye kuta Mulungu atuchemile tukalonje Ndongwa Nofu uko nako.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiya ankwantsa kumutumba Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Tukawukaje ku Tulova tukakwinaje mu meli tukabitaje mbaka hono hakafu ho hapilimwe na malenga ho hanchemwa Samotilake, na hamilawu yiyage tukafikaje ku muji gwa Niyapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Tukawukaje uko na kubita mbaka ku Fwilipi, ha muji mukomi gwa Machedoniya go gwavaga mu wuntsajila wa Valoma. Tukikalaje uko siku nunga. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Siku ya Kwesela tukahumaje kivala kwa muji, tukabitaje mulubali lwa bahali na twatyaga kuta ho hono ho vitang'anilaga Vayawudi kumusuka Mulungu. Tukikalisaje na kwantsa kulongana na vadala vatunga wovavaga vakong'ine kuko. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Hagati ha vadala iwo wo vatuhulikitsaga kwavaga na mudala yumwe yo aditaga kota fyo an'gana Mulungu, litawa lyake achemwaga Lidiya munyakaye va kuhuma ku Siyatila. Mudala uyo avaga mugutsi va myenda ja lanji ya tsambalawu ja galama ngomi na Mulungu avaga adisile atsitumbe ndongwa tsila tso alongaga Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Mudala uyo hamwe na vanu va mukaye yake ho vavaga kubatitswa, akatugongolaje, “Manyi mundiche heni kuta ndamwe kumutumba Mutwa, mutse mwikale mu nyumba yangu.” Na hetwe tukabitaje.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo na Sila vanvikwa mu nyumba ya vawopwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Siku yimwe hotwavaga tum'bita hono hahalaga ha kusalila, mupogotsi yumwe muhintsa yo avaga na lisoka lya wulagutsi. Nayo avapelaga vatwa vake magobole molofu kwa kulagula. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ihyo yula muhintsa akamufwataje Pawulo na hetwe kuno an'yova, “Iva vanu wo vatantsi va Mulungu va kilanga wo vangutuvikulila ndongwa tsa wukulusi.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Aditaga hihyo kwa siku ntsolofu, mbaka siku yimwe Pawulo akavipaje, akamupituchilaje na kulilonjela lila lisoka, “Ntsingukung'anulila kwa wuvetso wa Litawa lya Yesu Chilisito umuhume!” Lila lisoka likamuhumaje luvala lulula. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ihyo vatwa va yula muhintsa hovavaga kuwona kuta lihuvilo lyawo lya kupatila magobole liyatsile, vakavabataje Pawulo na Sila vakavabulunaje mbaka hono ha vanu wolofu halutalo ha vavina va muji. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Vakavategulaje mbaka kwa vanya kuhiga vakavahigaje kwa kulonga, “Vanu vano Vayawudi, nawo vankwambutsa chitika ha muji gwetu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Van'dahitsa ntsovelo tso sinambe tsiganiche na hetwe tu vanu va inyi ya Lumi na tunlemetswa kutsidichila na kutsifwata.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Vanu wolofu vakikong'asaje vakavibataje Pawulo na Sila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Iho vala vahigaji vakavalagitsaje vimilitsi vavawopole myenda jawo na vavatove mikotya. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Hovavaga kuvatowa ndalahela vakavavikaje mu nyumba ya vawopwa na vakamulonjelaje muvina va vimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa avimilile. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Kwasawuli ya malagitso igo uyo muvina va vimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa akavavikaje mu chumba cha kugati ndalahela cha nyumba ya vawopwa, na akavawopaje kwa nyololo mu magulu gawo.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Hoyavaga kufika hachilo na gati Pawulo na Sila vakatsaje kusuka na kwimba ntsimbo tsa kumutsumitsa Mulungu, nawo vawopwa vanji vavahulikitsaga. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Luvala lulo kukahumilaje likakamo likomi lya inyi, likatigasaje misinji ja nyumba ya vawopwa. Luvala lulo ntswitsi tseka tsikadindukaje na nyololo tso vavaga vavawopite tsikawopokaje. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Muvina va vimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa avaga kulamuka na kutsiwona ntswitsi tseka tsidinduche, atyaga kuta vawopwa veka vachimbye na ihyo akasomolaje waladi wake mu yala ili ikopole. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Lechelelo Pawulo akalongaje fikami, “Uleche kikopola kwasawuli hetwe tweka tulibahanago!” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi akalagitsaje tsiletwe koloboyi, akinjilaje mula mugati na kufugama halutalo ha Pawulo na Sila kuno ankakama. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Akavahumyaje kivala na kuvaputsa kuta, “Nyee vatwa, ntsin'ganika ndite chinu chachi ili mbetse kukuluka?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Vene vakamujibulaje, “Umutumbe Mutwa Yesu heve hamwe na vanu veka va kukaye yako, iho ho mukukuluka?” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ihyo vakamuvikulilaje ndongwa tsa Mutwa Yesu mwene hamwe na vanu va mukaye yake. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi akavategulaje luvala lululaga na kuvahofuga fikong'o fyawo, kaha mwene na vanu vake veka va mukaye yake vakabatitswaje luvala lulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Akavategulaje Pawulo na Sila na kuvalibulitsa valye chilyo. Ihyo mwene hamwe na vanu va mukaye yake vakahechelelaje ndalahela kwasawuli vavaga vamutumbye Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Hamilawu ho kwavaga kwela vala vahigaji vakavatumaje vavina va vimilitsi kwa muvina va nyumba ya vawopwa na kuvalajitsa kuta, “Uvawopolele vala vanu, uvaleche vabitile.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi va nyumba ya vawopwa akamulonjelaje Pawulo, “Vahigaji vatulagitse tuvawopolele, ihyo muhume mubite kwa wusichimafu.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Lechelelo Pawulo akamujibulaje, “Utije ndawuli? Natuvaje twavaga tulihela nongwa, vakatutofile mikotya halutalo ha vanu bila kutuhiga na hetwe tuli Valumi. Kaha vakatuvikaje mu nyumba ya vawopwa. Lelo sambi van'gana kutuhumya kwa chinyele? Ndaya! Iwo vavina Valumi van'ganika vatse hano vene na kutuhumya.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Vala vavina va vimilitsi vakawuyaje kuvalonjela vahigaji ndongwa itso, nawo vahigaji hovavaga kuhulika kuta Pawulo na Sila kuta nawo Valumi, vala vahigaji vakogopaje ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ihyo vakabitaje kuvagongola, hovavaga kuvahumya mu nyumba ya vawopwa, vakavagongolaje vawuche mu muji gula. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Pawulo na Sila vakahumaje mu nyumba ya vawopwa na kubita kukaye kwa Lidiya. Uko vakiwonaje na vayawo vanji wo vamutumbye Chilisito na kuvakangatsa numbula tsawo na hambele vakawukaje.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Chitika ku muji gwa Tesaloniche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pawulo na Sila vakantsaje lujendo kukolela ku muji gwa Amufipoli na ku Apoloniya vakafikaje ku Tesaloniche, kuko kwavaga na hono ha kitang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pawulo kota fyo yavaga ntsovelo yake akinjilaje hono ha kitang'anila Vayawudi. Mu Siku tsidatu tsa Kwesela avaga anlongana nawo ndongwa tsa mu Mandiko ga Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />na avalonjelaga bila kufiha kuta, Chilisito aganikaga akodwe na kutsilipulwa. Akawilaje kuvalonjela, “Yuno Chilisito yo ntsinguvalonjela ndongwa tsake, Yo Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Vayawudi vatunga vakavakokaje, na kihantsa na Pawulo na Sila. Vavaga Vajilichi wolofu wovavaga vangumufugamila Mulungu na vadala wolofu wo vahesimilwaga ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Lechelelo Vayawudi vatunga wo vavaga vang'ali kulidichila litumbilo vakawonaje mbafya, vakavakokaje vanu vabi kuhuma hono ha kugutsila finu, vakavakong'asaje vanu wolofu na kwantsisa chitika ha mujini. Vakabitaje luvilo ku nyumba ya munu yo achemwaga Yasoni na kuvasaka Pawulo na Sila ili vavahumye kivala kwa vala vanu wolofu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Lechelelo hovavaga sivavawene vakamukwegwenaje Yasoni na vanu vanji vamutumbye Chilisito mbaka halutalo ha filongotsi va muji kuno van'yova kuta, “Vanu vala wo vambutse chitika mu inyi tseka vatsitse mbaka ku muji gwetu, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />nayo Yasoni avalibulitse mu nyumba yake. Veka van'dita tebe na malajitso ga Kayisali, nawo vanlonga kuta koyoli muntsajila yunji, yo anchemwa Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ndongwa itso tsavambutse filongotsi va muji na vanu wolofu wongetse kudita chitika. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Nawo vala filongotsi vakavahombetsaje magobole Yasoni na vayage na kuvaleka vabitile.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo na Sila ku Beloya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Hachilo chicho vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito vakavalonjelaje Pawulo na Sila vabite ku Beloya. Hovavaga kufika uko, vakabitaje hono ha kitang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Vanu va uko ku Beloya vavaga vadeche ndalahela kulutila vala va ku Tesaloniche. Vanuchilye ndongwa tsila kwa wuwiniwo ndalahela na kugahima Mandiko ga Mulungu chila siku. Nawo viputsaga kugana vatsele tsila ndongwa tso valongaga Pawulo na Sila kuta tsa kweli awu ndaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Vayawudi wolofu vamutumbye Mutwa, na kanji na vadala va Chijilichi hamwe na valume wolofu Vajilichi. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Lechelelo Vayawudi va ku Tesaloniche vavaga kuhulika kuta Pawulo ali ku Beloya anvikula Ndongwa tsa Mulungu hihilaga, vakabitaje kuko ili kuvakoka vanu vave tebe na va Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Luvala lulo vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito vakumusindikitsaje Pawulo abite ku mwani gwa bahali, lechelelo Sila na Timoseyo vakasigalaje ku Beloya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Vala vanu wo vamusindikitsaga Pawulo vahelelise hamwe nayo mbaka ku muji gwa Asene, kuno vavaga valajitswe na Pawulo vavalonjele Sila na Timoseyo kuta vasupanitse kubita ku Asene vakihantse nayo. Nawo vakamulekaje Pawulo, vene vakawuyaje ku Beloya.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu ku Asene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pawulo hoavaga anguvatsinda Sila na Timoseyo kuko ku muji gwa Asene na numbula yake yatsangalimaga ndalahela ho avaga kuwona hila muji ugo mukomi fyo gumemile misanamu ja mihoka. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ihyo Pawulo alonganaga na vanu wosi Vayawudi wo vamufugamilaga Mulungu hono ha kitang'anila Vayawudi. Kaha chila siku alonganaga na vanu hono ha vanu wolofu. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Vanu vamwe wo vafwataga madahitso ga Vaepakuleyo na va Vasitoyiko wo vavaga vasomile ndalahela vakitang'anaje na Pawulo. Vamwe vakalongaje, “Mbe, uyuno munu mupuva an'jela kulonga chinu chachi?” Vamwe vakatyaje, “Yin'woneka anlonga ndongwa tsa mihoka mijentsi.” Valontsile ihyo kwasawuli Pawulo avaga anguvalonjela ndongwa tsa Yesu na wutsilipuko. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ihyo vakamutegulaje Pawulo na kumusindika mbaka kulibalatsa lyo lyachemwaga Aliyopago na kulonga, “Tun'gana kutsela lulongwa lulo lupya lo uvije unlonga lun'dahitsa chinu chachi? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Tukuhuhuliche unlonga finu fijentsi. Tun'gana kutsela ndongwa tsino tsina mana yachi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Vanu va ku Asene hamwe na vanu vanji vajentsi wo vikala uko sivaditaga chinu chinji, lechelelo kwa luvala lolofu valonganagana na kuhulikitsa ndongwa njentsi.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ihyo Pawulo akimaje halutalo ha libalatsa ilyo lya Aliyopago na kulonga kuta, henye vanyakaye va Asene ntsin'wona kuta henye muli vanu wo mungujifugamila mihoka jenyu ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Hala hombije ntsin'jenda uko na kula ku mujini ntsihawene hono henyu ha kufugamila, ntsihawene hono hamwe ha kutawulila nambiko ho handikwe hino, Kwa Mihoka jo Sinambe jitselaniche. Ino lelo heni ntsinguvavikulila ndongwa tsa Mulungu yula yo muvije mungumufugamila bila henye kumutsela. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Mulungu yo awumbite inyi na fyeka fyofyofili, uyo yo Mutwa va Kilanga na inyi na siikalaga mu nyumba tso tsitsentsilwe na vanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Mwene Mulungu simugayisida ya kutumichilwa na vanu awu kuta an'gana chinu chochive kuhuma kwawo, kwasawuli mwene yo avapelaga vanu veka wumi na muhe na chila chinu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kukolela kwa munu yumwe, mwene Mulungu awumbite vanu ili vikale mu inyi tseka. Nayo akavavichilaje luvala lwa kikala na hono hachi hovan'ganika vikale. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Mulungu aludisile lulongwa ulo ili vanu vamusache mwene, nayivaje kwa kwambalagata hwanda vamupate, na avaje si alikutali na chila munu, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />kota hila fyo alontsile mwimbi va ntsimbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">Mugati mwake hetwe tungikala.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Tun'jenda na kuva wumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">Hetwe tweka tuli vana vake.<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Hetwe tuli vana va Mulungu, siyo finofu ndaya kuhotsa kuta mwene anakota sanamu tsa tsahabu, awu madini ga fwetsa, awu kota sanamu ya liganga Lyo Lihongulwe kwa nyala tsa vanu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Mulungu adisile kota nambe alave hala vanu hovavaga sinambe vamutsele mwene, lechelelo sambi anguvalajitsa vanu veka va chila hono vihale ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na kumupituchila mwene, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />kaha Mulungu avisile siku yo akuvahiga vanu va inyi tseka kota fyo an'gana mwene kukolela kwa yula yo amuhagwe. Nayo avapelye vanu veka wukweli wa ndongwa tsino kwa kumutsilipula.<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Hovavaga kumuhulika Pawulo anlonga lulongwa lwa kutsilipuka, vamwe vakahekaje kwa mbedatsi na vanji vakalongaje, “Hetwe tun'gana kukuhulika kaha ulonje lulongwa ulo lwa wutsilipuko.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ihyo Pawulo akawukaje na kuvaleka. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Vanu vamwe vakihantsaje na Pawulo na kumutumba Mutwa, hagati hawo avaga hoyoli Diyonisiyo munu va libalatsa ilyo lya Aleyopago na mudala yumwe yo achemwaga litawa lya Damali na vanu vanji wolofu.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo angugujendela muji gwa Kolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso, Pawulo akawukaje ku Asene akabitaje ku muji gwa Kolindo. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Uko ku Kolindo akamufikaje munu yumwe va ku Wuyawudi yo achemwaga Achila yo aleliche ku mukova gwa Pondo, yo avaga afisile siku tsa habehi kuhuma ku Italiya hamwe na mudala vake yo anchemwa Pilisila, kwasawuli muntsajila va inyi ya Loma yo achemwaga Chilawudi ali avalagitse Vayawudi veka vawuche ku muji gwa Italiya. Pawulo akabitaje kuvajendela, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />Pawulo akikalaje nawo na kukola katsi hamwe nawo, kwasawuli vanu iwo katsi yawo yavaga yimwe ya kuhona fidudu fya nyingo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Chila Siku ya Kwesela Pawulo alonganaga na Vayawudi na Vajilichi mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi na kujela kuvakwega ili vamutumbe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timoseyo hovavaga kufika kuhuma uko ku Machedoniya, Pawulo avaga itawe muda gwake gweka kwa kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu kwa kuvalonjela Vayawudi kuta Yesu yo Muhagulwa va Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Vayawudi vasumanaje na Pawulo kwa kumulonjela ndongwa ntsibi, Pawulo akakung'unaje mingundi ja myenda jake halutalo hawo na kulajila kuta, “Chinu chibi chochive cho chikuvapata heni ntsili muduhu! Heni ntsilihela nongwa, ndisile chila chonganikije kudita. Kuhuma sambi ntsim'bita kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Ihyo Pawulo akawukaje iho na kubita kukala kukaye ya munu yumwe yo angumufugamila Mulungu yo achemwaga Tito Yusiti yo nyumba yake yavaga habehi na Nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Muvina va nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi yo achemwaga Chilisipo, mwene nayo akamutumbaje Mutwa hamwe na vanu va mu nyumba yake yeka. Vakolindo wolofu hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso, vakamutumbaje Mutwa na kubatitswa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Siku yimwe hachilo Mutwa akamulonjelaje Pawulo mu nduntsuchilo, “Uleche kogopa, wendelele kuvavikulila vanu hela bila kukatuka, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kwakuva heni ntsili hamwe na heve. Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche akuditile chinu chibi, kwasawuli ntsina vanu wolofu ha muji guno wo van'ganika vanumbe heni.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Pawulo ichite kuko kwa chipindi cha mwaka gumwe na myetsi sita, adahitsaga vanu ndongwa tsa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Galiyo hoavaga kuva muvina va mukova gwa Akaya, Vayawudi vakabitaje hohamwe vakamutovangaje Pawulo na kumusindika mbaka ku libalatsa lya kuhijila. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Vakamuhigaje kwa kulonga, “Munu yuno anguvakoka vanu vamufugamile Mulungu na vave tebe na malajitso ga Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Pawulo hoavaga ang'ali kwantsa kulonga, Galiyo akavalonjelaje Vayawudi, Manyi henye mungumuhiga munu yuno kwasawuli ya wubi wachi awu wanantsi wowuve, ntsika kuvahuliktsa. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Lechelelo manyi yive lulongwa lwene luli kwasawuli ya matawa na malajitso genyu kuhuma kwa Musa, mulamule henye muvene. Heni sifuluche ntsive mulamutsi va ndongwa tsino! <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ihyo akavavingaje vaheje halutalo ha chigoda cha kuhijila. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Veka vakamubataje Sositeni yo avaga muvina va nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi na vakamutovaje bahalaga halutalo ha chigoda cha kuhijila, lechelelo Galiyo siawene kuta lulongwa ulo siyo chinu.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo ampiluka ku Andiyochiya ya ku Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pawulo endelye kikala na vala vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito va uko ku Kolindo kwa siku ntsolofu. Kahi akavalagaje na kuwuka hamwe na Pilisila na Achila. Hovavaga kufika ku Chenichileya Pawulo akamogaje fwili tsake kwasawuli avaga asintsile lulongwa lo avaga amulahye Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Vakafikaje ku Efweso na Pawulo akavalekaje va Pilisila na Achila na kubita mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi na kulongana na Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Vanu iwo vakamungoloje ikale nawo kwa siku ntsolofu, ila mwene akalemaje. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Hoavaga an'wuka akavalonjelaje, “Manyi Mulungu agane nguwuya kanji kwenyu.” Hambele Pawulo akakwinje meli na kuwuka kuhuma ku Efweso.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Pawulo hoavaga kufika ku muji gwa Kayisaliya, akabitaje ku Yelusalemu kuchisamusa chila chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito, hambele akabitaje ku Andiyochiya. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Ichite kuko luvala lutunga hela, na hambele akendelelaje na lujendo kukolela hagati na gati ha miji ja Galatiya na Fwilijiya na kuvakangatsa vadahitswa wo vavaga kuko.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo anvikula ku Efweso na ku Kolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Kwavaga na muyawudi yumwe litawa lyake Apolo yo alelichilye ku muji gwa Alechitsandiliya, akatsaje ku Efweso. Avaga munu munya nyala na kulonga kwa mupanjililo na avaga agatsele finofu Mandiko ga Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Munu yuno avaga adahitswe finofu madahitso ga Mutwa, kwasawuli iwiniwaga kudaha, nayo awutselaga hela wubatitso wa Yohana, vakamudahitsaje ndogwa tsa Yesu tsila tso avaga sinambe atsitsele. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Apolo akantsaje kulonga na Vayawudi bila muloto hono hala ha kitang'anila. Lechelelo Pilisila na Achila hovavaga kumuhulika, vakamutegulaje mbaka kukaye yawo na kumudahitsa kwa wugatsi Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Ihyo Apolo akalamulaje kubita ku Akaya, vala vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito va ku Efweso vakamukangatsaje, ihyo vakavandichilaje baluva vadahitswa wo vavaga uko ku Akaya vamulibulitse. Hoavaga kufika kuko akavatangaje ndalahela vala wo vakuluswe kwa wuwuya wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Apolo avasumile nachene Vayawudi halutalo ha vanu veka, kwa kulajila mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta Yesu yo Chilisito.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo anvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu ku Efweso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Hala Apolo hoavaga ku Kolindo, Pawulo akalutilaje ha miji ja mufidunda na kufika ku muji gwa Efweso. Kuko akavafikaje vadahitswa vatunga, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />akavaputsaje, “Mbe, henye homwavaga kumutumba Yesu, mwamwanuche Muhe va Mulungu?” Vene vakamupitulaje, “Ndaya, tung'ali nambe kuhulika hela kuta kwave na Muhe va Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Nayo Pawulo akavaputsaje, “Mbe, mwabatitswe kwa wubatitso wachi?” Vakamupitulaje, “Twabatitswe kwa wubatitso wa Yohana.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Pawulo akalongaje, “Wubatitso wa Yohana wavaga wa kulajila kuta vanu vamupituchilye Mulungu na kuleka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na kuvalonjela vanu va Isilaheli vamutumbe mwene yo akutsa halutalo hake, nayo yo Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Hovavaga kuhulika ihyo, vakabatitswaje kwa litawa lya Mutwa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Ihyo Pawulo akavavichilaje mawoko, nawo vakalongotswaje na Muhe va Mulungu na kwantsa kulonga kwa kabila tsinji na kuvikula ndongwa tsa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Vanu veka iwo vavaga valume kota kumi na vavili hino.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Chipindi cha myetsi jidatu Pawulo abitaga mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, na kuvadahitsa vanu bila moloto, alonganaga nawo na kuvakwega mu ndongwa tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Lechelelo vamwinga vakalemaje kutumba Mutwa Yesu, vakantsaje kumuliga Mutwa Yesu. Ihyo Pawulo akavabagulaje vala wovavaga vadahitswa, nayo akavaje anlongana nawo chila siku mu wukumbi wa munu yumwe litawa lyake Tilano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Pawulo endelye kudita ihyo kwa luvala lwa myaka jivili, mbaka Vayawudi na wosi Vayawudi wovikalaga ku Asiya vakavaje vahuliche ndongwa tsa Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana vakwamitsi va Sicheva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Mulungu adisile miwujitsa mikomi kukolela kwa Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Vanu vatamwa vatolaga nambe fitambala awu myenda ja mu muvili gwa Pawulo, vakaponaje namwa tsawo na misoka jikavalechelaje. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Vayawudi vamwe wo vajendaga jendaga kwa katsi tsa kuhetsa misoka kwa wuganga, vakajelaje kujihetsa misoka kwa vanu kwa litawa lya Mutwa Yesu, vakalongaje hino, tunguvang'anulila mumuhume kwa litawa lya Yesu yula yo anvikulwa na Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Vanu wo vadisile ihyo vavaga vana saba vakwamitsi va munu yumwe Muyawudi yo achemwaga Sicheva, yo avaga chilongotsi va vatawula nambiko. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Lechelelo lila lisoka likavajibulaje, “Yesu ntsimutsele na Pawulo ntsimutsele, lelo henye muli vanani?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Ihyo yula munu yo avaga na lisoka avaga na ludali, akavadibuchilaje veka akavatovaje na kuvasuma. Nawo vakabilimaje kuhuma mu nyumba yila kuno vali mwatsi na vatetsiche. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Lulongwa ulo lolwahumye uko ku Efweso lukahulikwaje na Vayawudi veka na wosi Vayawudi, vakinjilwaje na muhwehwe nalyo litawa lya Mutwa Yesu likahesimilwaje ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Vanu vala veka wovavaga mwanga vamutumbye Chilisito vakatsaje na kihala halutalo ha vanu ndongwa tsawo tseka ntsibi tso vavaga vadisile. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Kaha na vanu wolofu wovaditaga ndongwa tsa wuhavi iho hamutalo, vakafitegulaje fitabu fyawo fya wuhavi vakafinyanyaje mu moto halutalo ha vanu. Hovavaga kuvalila galama tsa fitabu fyo finyanyilwe yavaga kota fipande hamusini elufu fya madini ga fwetsa. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Lulongwa ulo lukaditaje Ndongwa tsa Mutwa tsilutile kutagalila na kuva na wuvetso ndalahela.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu van'dita chitika chikomi ku Efweso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Hotsavaga kulutila ndongwa itso tseka, Pawulo akalamulaje kubita ku Yelusalemu, akakolelaje ku Machedoniya na Akaya. Avaga kufika kuko akalongaje, “Hihilaga ntsin'ganika mbite kaha na ku Lumi nako.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ihyo Pawulo akavatumaje vanu vavili wo vavaga vatantsi vake, Timoseyo na Elasito vamulongole kubita ku Machedoniya, lechelelo mwene akasigalaje kuko ku Asiya kwa luvala ludodo.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Luvala ulo kwahumye chitika chikomi kuko Efweso kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsa Mutwa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kwavaga na munu yumwe yo achemwaga Demetiliyo, yo avaga mupontsi va finu fya madini ga fetsa, na mugutsi va fisanamu fya tunyumba twa lilungu lyawo lidala lyo lyachemwaga Atemi, nayo munu uyo avaletelaga fwayida ngomi vapontsi vayage. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demetiliyo akavachemelaje hono hamwe iwo vapontsi vayage wo vakolaga katsi kota yake na kuvalonjela, “Nyee vayangu, mun'tsela kuta wufuchifu wetu wuhumye mu katsi yino. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Lelo mufuluche muhuliche na kilolela vene ndongwa ntsila tso an'dita Pawulo si hano ha Efweso ng'ani ila mbaka ku Asiya yeka. Munu uyo anguvakoka na kuvakwega vanu wolofu na kuvapitula nyala tsawo nayo anlonga kuta ifi fyo tun'dita kwa mawoko getu siyo mihoka ndaya. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ihyo katsi yetu yifuluche yibedalwe na yikulongwa fibi, nalo lulongwa ulo lukwambutsa finyumba fya lilungu lidala lya Atemi lyo livina lyo linfugamilwa ku Asiya yeka na ku inyi tseka likubedalwa. Siyo ihyo ng'ani, nawo wuvina wa lilungu lyetu wukuyaga.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Vapontsi iwo hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa itso vakavipaje ndalahela na kwantsa kuyova fikami, “Lihoka lya Atemi va Vaefweso lyo livina!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Muji gweka gukavaje na chitika. Vanu wolofu vakakong'anaje na kuvabata Gayo na Alisitako wo vavaga vanyakaye va ku Machedoniya, wovali vajendise hamwe na Pawulo na vanu vakabitaje nawo luvilo kota munu yumwe hono ho vitang'anaga vanu va muji. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Nayo Pawulo aganaga injile hagati ya halilugu lya vanu, lechelelo vanu wo vamutumbye Yesu vakamulemetsaje aleche kwinjila. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Vavina vamwe va mukova gwa Asiya, wo vavaga vanu va habehi na Pawulo, vakavasukaje vanu vakamugongoletse Pawulo aleche kwinjila hono iho. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Nago mukong'ano gula gukavaje na chitika chikomi kwasawuli vanu wolofu sivakatselaga chambutso cha mukong'ano gula na luvala ulo chila munu akolaga chinya lwake, vamwe vakolaga hino na vanji vakolaga hila. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Vayawudi vakamusindikaje Alechitsanda kwalatsima halutalo ha lilugu lya vanu, nawo vanu vamwe vakamulonjelaje cho an'ganika kulonga. Nayo Alechitsanda akavakatukitsaje kwa kuhunga mawoko ili vanu vamuhulikitse fyo angiyamila. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Lechelelo vanu hovavaga kutsela kuta Alechitsanda nayo avaga Muyawudi, veka vakakolaje kwa litsi limwe kwa luvala kota lwa masala gavili kuta, “Atemi va Vaefweso yo muvina!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Hambele muvina yumwe va muji akavetsaje kuvakatukitsa vanu. Akavalonjelaje, Nyee vanu va Efweso, munu vachi yo sinambe atsele kuta vanu veka va muji gwa Efweso wo vimilitsi va tunyumba twa lilungu lidala lya Atemi na yila sanamu yake yo yagweye kuhuma kilanga? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche akane ndongwa itso. Ihyo lelo mun'ganika mukatuche na muleche kudita chinu chochive kwa kusupanitsa hela. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Ino lelo muvaletite hano vanu vano wo sivamulitsile awu kuhitsa finu fya nyumba ya Atemi mulungu vetu mudala. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Manyi Demetiliyo na vapontsi vayage vana nongwa na munu yoyuve, balatsa tsa kuhijila hotsili na vahigaji hovali, nawo vafuluche vabite vakavahije kuko. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Lechelelo manyi henye munayo nongwa yinji yoyive yo an'gana kuleta, mulete ha libalatsa lyo lin'tselanika. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Manyi tuleche kiyangalila tufuluche tuhigwe kwasawuli ya chitika cho chihumye munyiguno. Chitika chino chilihela chambutso cha kweli na kwa chitika chino tulihela lulongwa lwa kiyamila ha mukong'ano guno. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Muvina yula va muji hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akavalonjelaje vanu wovali mu mukong'ano gula vawuche.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo am'bita kaha ku miji ja Machedoniya na ku Wujilichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Chitika chila cha ku muji gwa Efweso ho chavaga kusila, Pawulo akavachemelaje hono hamwe vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito na kuvakangatsa numbula tsawo, hambele akavalagaje na kwantsa lujendo lwa kubita ku Machedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Pawulo akakwetelaje mu mikova na kuvakangatsa numbula vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito kwa ndongwa ntsolofu. Hambele akafikaje ku Wujilichi, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />uko ichite kwa myetsi jidatu. Hoavaga angivika chang'ani kukwina meli na kwantsa lujendo lwa kuwuya ku Siliya, akatselaje kuta Vayawudi valagine kumuditila lulongwa lubi, ihyo akalamulaje kuwuya kwa kukolela ng'asi ya ku Machedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Pawulo avaga ajendise hamwe na Sopatulo mwana va Pilo va kuhuma ku Beloya. Kaha avaga ajendise na Alisitako na Sekundo munu va kuhuma ku Tesaloniche, na Gayo munu va ku Delibe, na Timoseyo hamwe na Tichiko na Tulofimo va kuhuma ku Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Vanu iwo vakatulongolaje na vakatutsindilaje ku Tulova. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Lechelelo ho lyavaga kulutila Liwungo lya Mikate jo Sijilasopwa Hamila, tukantsaje lujendo lwa siku tsihanu mu meli kuhuma ku Fwilipi. Tukafikaje ku Tulova na kihantsa na vayetu na tukikalaje uko kwa wichi yimwe.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lujendo lwa wudugo lwa Pawulo ku muji gwa Tulova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Siku ndongola ya wichi, tukakong'anaje hohamwe ili tulye chilyo. Pawulo akendelelaje kudahitsa vanu mbaka hachilo nagati, kwasawuli avaga an'gana kuwuka hamilawu iyage. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Mu ligolofwa lila mo twavaga, kwavaga na koloboyi ntsolofu tso ntsinkwaka. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mu lidilisa limwe lya chumba cho twavaga, kwali na mukwamitsi yumwe litawa lyake Awutiko na Pawulo hoavaga ankwendelela kudahitsa kwa luvala lutali, mukwamitsi uyo akasintsilaje na kugwa kuhuma ku ligolofwa lya kadatu mbaka hasi, hovavaga kubita kumwinula avaga mwanga afweye. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Pawulo akikaje hasi ha ligolofwa lila, akahonamaje na kumukumbanitsa mukwamitsi uyo na kulonga, “Muleche kuvemba munu yuno mumi.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ihyo Pawulo akakwinaje kaha kugolofwa yila na kulya. Akadahitsaje kwa luvala lutali mbaka kunkwela na hambele akawukaje. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Vanu vakamupilulaje Awutiko kukaye kuno mumi na kusangalala ndalahela.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo an'wuka ku Tulova kubita ku Mileto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Hetwe tukalongolaje kukwina mu meli, tukajendaje mbaka hono hanchemwa Aso uko kotwataga kuta tukumutegula na Pawulo. Avaga atulonje tudite ihyo kwasawuli mwene abitaga uko kwa ligulu. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Pawulo hoavaga kutufika kuko Aso, akakwinaje mu meli tukajendasaje hamwe mbaka ku Mitulene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kuhuma uko tukajendaje, hamilawu iyage tukafikaje habehi na hono hakafu hohapilimwe na malenga ho hanchemwa Chiyo. Siku yinji tukalowokaje tukafikaje ha inyi ya Samo yo yili mubahali, na siku yinji tukafikaje hono hanchemwa Mileto. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pawulo avaga alamwe kwendelela na lujendo kwa meli bila kukolela ku Efweso ili aleche kuhava ndalahela uko ku Asia, kwasawuli aganaga manyi akuvetsa afiche ku Yelusalemu siku ya liwungo lya Pendekosite.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anguvalaga vavina va ku Efweso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Hotwavaga uko ku Mileto Pawulo akavatumilaje wujumbe vavina va chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito cha ku Efweso ili vitang'ane nayo. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Hovavaga kufika akavalonjelajekuta henye mun'tsela hila fyo ntsichite na henye siku tseka, kuhuma siku yila ndongola hontsafisile hano ha Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Mun'tsela hila fyo ntsamukolye katsi Mutwa kwa wudeche weka na kwa manyotsi, ntsikangatsaga mu ngudo na fikwatso fyo ntsapataga kwasawuli ya ndongwa ntsibi tso vanditye Vayawudi tsa kugana kung'opola. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Mun'tsela kuta ha malugu ga vanu na ha chila nyumba sintsalesile kuvavikulila vanu na kuvadahitsa chila chinu chochive cho ntsawene kuta chikuvafwaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Ntsavalonje vanu veka Vayawudi na wosi Vayawudi kuta van'ganika kumupituchila Mulungu kwa kutsileka ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na vamutumbe Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Ino lelo ntsin'wuka kwa kulongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu kubita ku Yelusalemu, ila mu numbula yangu sinambe ntsele cho chikunyumila uko. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ntsinguchitsela chinu chimwe hela, Muhe va Mulungu andonje kuta kuwopwa hamwe na ng'odeko fintsinda uko kontsim'bita. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Heni sinambe nyotse wumi wangu kuta wuli chinu, ila ntsinhotsa kusinda katsi ya kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu yo ntsanuchilye kwa Mutwa Yesu kwa wuwuya wake. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Heni ng'wetye kula na kuno kuvavikulila ndongwa tsa wuntsajila wa Mulungu, lechelelo luhuma sambi simufuluche mumbone kaha. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ihyo munyiguno ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta manyi yumwe venyu yoyuve ayaje kwa kulileka litumbilo, heni ntsilimuduhu, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />kwasawuli siku tseka ntsavalonje ndongwa tseka tso aganaga Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Ihyo mwiyangalile muvene hamwe na chila chikundi cheka cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito na icho cho Muhe va Mulungu avavisile henye muchimilile. Muchidime chikundi icho cho akachigutsile Mulungu kwa nambiko ya chifo cha Mwanage. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Ntsin'tsela finofu kuta heni honguvambusile, vadahitsi va wudesi wo vanakota ngwami ng'ali vakutsa kwa henye, nawo sivakuva na lusungu na chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Kuhuma hagati henyu vakuhumila vanu wo vakulonga ndongwa tsa wudesi ili vavakwejele kwawo vanu vala wo vamutumbye Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ihyo mwiyangalilaje na mwiwukaje kuta kwa myaka jidatu hamunyi na hachilo ntsendelye kuvadahitsa chila munu kwa manyotsi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Duve, lelo ntsinguvavika henye mu wimilitsi wa Mulungu na kwa lulongwa lwa wuwuya wa Mutwa, lo lufuluche luvakangatse na kuvapela henye chila cho alontsile Mulungu kuta akuvapela vanu vake wo avahagwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Heni sintsiviniwe magobole, wala madini ga tsahabu, wala myenda ja munu yoyuve. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Henye vene mun'tsela kuta ntsadisile katsi kwa mawoko gangu, ili ntsipatile cho ntsin'gana heni na vayangu wontsavaga nawo. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Siku tseka mbije ntsinguvalajila muhwano kuta kwa kukola katsi hino mun'ganika kuvatanga vanu wovalihela ludali. Mwiwukaje madahitso ga Mutwa vetu Yesu hila fyo ganlonga kuta, vatambichilwe wo vantawula kulutila wo vankwanuchila.<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Pawulo hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa itso akafugamaje hamwe nawo na kumusuka Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Vanu veka vakavembaje ndalahela, vakamulagaje Pawulo kuno vangumunonela. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Lulongwa lo lukavavefitse ndalahela lwavaga lula lulongwa lo alontsile Pawulo kuta sivakumuwona kaha, ihyo vakamusindikitsaje mbaka mu meli.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo am'bita ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Twavaga kilagana nawo kwa wususutafu tukawukaje. Tukantsaje lujendo kwa kukwina meli mbaka tukafikaje hono hanchemwa Kosi. Siku ya kavili tukafikaje ha chijiji cha Lode, na kuhuma uko tukabitaje ku muji gwa Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Iho tukayifikaje meli yo yavaga yim'bita ku Foyiniche, ihyo tukakwinaje na kuwuka. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Hotwavaga kuhawona hono hakafu ho hapilimwe na malenga ho hachemwaga Chipulo, tukakolaje lubali lwa kusika lwa ugo muji na kubita ku Siliya. Tukawukaje iho na kubita muji gwa Tilo go gwavaga mulubali lwa bahali, iho ho meli yetu yaganikaga yikise mitsigo. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Kuko tukavafikaje vafwasi va Yesu na tukikalaje hamwe nawo kwa wichi yimwe. Vafwasi vala kwa kulongotswa na Muhe va Mulungu vakamulonjelaje Pawulo kuta aleche kubita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Lechelelo ho lwavaga kusila luvala lwa kikalasa nawo, tukawukaje tukendelelaje na lujendo lwetu. Vala vafwasi veka hamwe na vadala vawo na vana vawo vakatusindikitsaje mbaka mulubali lwa bahali, tweka tukafugamaje na kumusuka Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Hotwavaga kilagana nawo tukakwinaje mu meli, nawo vakawuyaje ku nyumba tsawo. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Hetwe tukantsaje lujendo lwetu mu meli kuhuma ku Tilo tukafikaje ku Tolemayi, tukavasamusaje vanyalukolo vayetu wo vamutumbye Chilisito wovavaga kuko, uko tukikalaje nawo kwa siku yimwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Hamilawu iyage tukawukaje tukabitaje ku muji gwa Kayisaliya. Uko tukabitaje kikala mu nyumba ya Fwilipo yo avaga muvikutsi va Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu, yo avaga muyawo va vala vanu saba wo vavaga vahagulwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Munu uyo avaga na vahintsa vatayi wosi vavatsele valume wovavaga vanlonga wuloli wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Duve, hotwavaga kikala kuko kwa siku nunga, muloli yumwe litawa lyake Hagabo akafikaje kuhuma ku Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Munu uyo akatsaje kotuli akategulaje musipi gwa Pawulo, akiwopaje mu mawoko na mu magulu gake na kulonga, “Muhe va Mulungu anlonga kuta, Vayawudi va ku Yelusalemu ihi fyo vakumuwopa munu munya musipi guno na vakumusindika kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi.” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Hala hotwavaga kuhulika ndongwa tsino, hetwe na vayetu vanji va hono hala, tukamugongolaje Pawulo aleche kubita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Lechelelo mwene Pawulo akapitulaje, Kwasawuli yachi munvemba na kumbenanga numbula ntsi muyenyu? Heni tsili chang'ani kusindikwa mu kaye ya vawopwa nambe kufwa uko ku Yelusalemu kwasawuli ya Mutwa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Hotwavaga kulemwa kumudita aleche kubita ku Yelusalemu tukamulekaje na kulonga, “Mutwa aditaje cho an'gana mwene!”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Tukikalaje hono iho kwa siku nunga, hambele tukivikaje chang'ani na tukawopa mitsigo jetu kwendelela na lujendo lwetu lwa kubita ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Vafwasi vatunga va Yesu va kuhuma Kayisaliya vakatusindikaje kukaye kwa munu va kuhuma ku Chipulo yo achemwaga Munasoni, munu uyo avaga mufwasi va kuhuma katali tukikalaje kwake.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo am'bita kumujendela Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Hotwavaga kufika ku Yelusalemu, vanyalukolo wo vavaga vamutumbye Chilisito vakatwanuchilaje finofu ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Hamilawu iyage Pawulo akabitaje na hetwe tukamujendele na kulongana na Yakobo, nawo vavina veka va chikundi cha Chilisito vavaga baho. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Hotwavaga kuvasamusa, Pawulo akantsaje kuvalonjela lulongwa lumwelumwe lo adisile Mulungu kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi mu katsi yake ya wuvikusti. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Vavina vala hovavaga kuhulika ihyo, vakamutsumitsaje Mulungu. Ihyo vakamulonjelaje Pawulo, Munyalukolo ulave malugu ga Vayawudi fyo vamutumbye Chilisito, iwo veka vangugadita malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Nawo vahuliche kuta heve unguvadahitsa Vayawudi veka wo vangikala hagati ha vanu wosi Vayawudi kuta, vagaleche malajitso ga Musa na kuvalonjela valeche kuvingitsa likumbi vana vawo na kaha valeche kufwata ntsovelo tsa Vayawudi. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Lelo tun'tsela kuta vanu iwo vakuhulika kuta heve mwanga ufisile hano Yelusalemu. Ino lelo tukudita ndawuli? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Ihyo lelo udite kota fyo tungukulonjela. Ihano tuna vanu vatayi wo vilahye kumutawulila Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Wihantse nawo ho vakuva vangivika chang'ani kwa Mulungu na uhombe galama tseka ili vamogwe fwili tsawo. Manyi udite ihyo chila munu akutsela kuta ndongwa tso vatsihuliche tsavaga tsa wudesi na vakutijila kuta na heve ung'acha ungibata malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Lechelelo vala vanu wosi Vayawudi wo vamutumbye Chilisito vene mwanga tuvasindichilye baluva na kuvalonjela kuta tulamwe kuta, “Viyangalile na kulya nyama tsa nambiko kwa sanamu na valeche kulya danda yoyive awu kulya nyama tso sitsilasintswa na kaha viviche kutali na mbwiniwo tsa waafu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ihyo hamilawu iyage Pawulo akavatolaje vala vanu na kwantsa kivika chang'ani kwasawuli ya ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu hamwe nawo. Hambele akinjilaje mu Nyumba ya Mulungu ili avalonjele kuta talehe yachi yo yikuva ya wudugo wa siku tsawo kivika chang'ani kwasawuli ya ntsovelo tsa kumufugamila Mulungu na galama yo yikutawulwa kwasawuli ya chila yumwe.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo angibatika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Tsila siku saba hotsavaga kuva habehi na kufika wudugo, Vayawudi vatunga wo vavaga vahumye ku Asiya vamuwene Pawulo mugati mwa Nyumba ya Mulungu. Vakalikokaje lilugu lyeka lya vanu ili vamubate. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Vakayovaje fikami na kutya, “Henye vanu va Isilaheli mututanje tuvayenu! Uyuno yo yula munu yo an'dahitsa vanu chila hono vave tebe na vanu va Isilaheli na gala malajitso ga Musa na ali tebe na Nyumba ya Mulungu. Kulutila ndongwa itso tseka avaletite vanu vatunga wosi Vayawudi na kutsidita ndongwa tsila tso tsalemitswe hono hano hahagulwa.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Valontsile ihyo kwasawuli vavaga vamuwene Tulofwimo yoavaga munyakaye va ku Efweso avaga hamwe na Pawulo ku mujini, nawo vatijilaga kuta Pawulo akuva amwingitse mu Nyumba ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Muji gweka gukatagalilaje chitika, vanu vakatsaje kuhuma mbali tseka na vakamubataje Pawulo, vakamubulunaje na kumuhumya mu Nyumba ya Mulungu. Luvala lulo ntsitsi tsa Nyumba ya Mulungu tsikadindwaje. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Vanu vala ho vaganaga kumukopola Pawulo, lulongwa ulo lukamufichilaje muvina va vimilitsi va Chilumi kuta Yelusalemu yeka yitagalye chitika. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Luvala lulo yula muvina va vimilitsi akavategulaje vavina va vimilitsi mya mya na vimilitsi vawo, nawo vakabilimilaje hagati ha chitika chila. Vala vanu wo vaditaga chitika vavaga kumuwona muvina yula na vimilitsi vake, vakalekaje kumutova Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi akabitaje hoali Pawulo, akamubataje na akalajitsaje vamuwope kwa nyololo tsivili. Kahi akamuputsaje kuta, “Uyu nani na adisile lulongwa lwachi?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Vanu vamwe ha lilugu lila wo vavaga vanhabuka hela ndonga, chila munu alongaga lulongwa lwake. Yula muvina va vimilitsi hoavaga kuwona hila kuta siafuluche apate wukweli wa ndongwa tsila kwasawuli ya chiyove chila, akalajitsaje kuta vamusindiche Pawulo mugati mwa kambi ya vimilitsi. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Pawulo hoavaga kufika ha ngatsi tsa kwinjilila ha lwitsi lukomi lwa kwinjilila mu kambi ya vimilitsi, vimilitsi vakamutegulaje mwilanga mwilanga kwasawuli ya chitika chikomi cha lilugu lila lya vanu. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Kwasawuli lilugu lya vanu lya mufwataga kwa chiyove kuta, “Mumukopole munu uyo! Mumukopole munu uyo!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo angipamana ha lilugu lya vanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Hovavaga vangumwingitsa mugati mwa kambi ya vimilitsi, Pawulo akamusukaje muvina va vimilitsi kuta, “Mbe, fuluche ngulonjele lulongwa lumwe?” Yula muvina va vimilitsi akamuputsaje, “Mbe, ufitsele kulonga Chijilichi?” <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Mbe, heve siyo yula munu muwumiyani va ku Misili yo wavalongotsaga vanu elufu tsitayi vawumiyani siku tso tsilutye kula ku balali?<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pawulo akamupitulaje kuta, “Heni tsili munu va ku Wuyawudi, yo ntsaleliche ku muji gwa Taliso gwa ku Chilichiya, heni ntsili munu va muji mutambulwa. Ntsinsuka undichile ndonje na vanu vano.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi akamudichilaje alonje. Ihyo Pawulo akimaje hilanga ha ngatsi, akavagololelaje vanu liwoko chinya kutijila vakatuche. Hovavaga kukatuka, Pawulo akalonganaje nawo kwa Chiebulaniya.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Henye vang'olotsangu na va dadangu, heni ntsili halutalo henyu ntsin'gana munyulikitse ntsivalonjele ndongwa itsi hila fyotsili!” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Vanu vala hovavaga kumuhulika anlonga nawo kwa Chiebulaniya vakalutitsaje kusindimala, nayo Pawulo akendelelaje kulonga, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />Heni ntsili Muyawudi, yo ntsaleliche ku muji gwa Taliso hono ho hanchemwa Chilichiya na ntsakalagalye bahanago ha Yelusalemu tsadahitswe kwa wugolofu na Gamaliyeli malajitso ga va dada vetu, na ngavaje munu va kikangatsa kwasawuli ya Mulungu kota henye nyeka fyomuli munyiguno. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Ntsavakodaga na kuvakopola vanu vala wo vayifwataga Ng'asi yino. Ntsavabataga valume na vadala na kuvawopa mu nyumba tsa vawopwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Muvina va vatawula nambiko na vavina veka va libalatsa vafuluche vidikitse chino cho ntsinlonga kuta cha wukweli. Ntsanuchilaga baluva kuhuma kwawo tso vandichilwaga vala Vayawudi va uko ku Damesichi, na heni ntsabitaga na kuvabata vanu iwo na kuvaleta ku Yelusalemu kuno vawopitwe na vavaditile fibi kota fyo van'gana vene wo vavahijite.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anlonga hila Chilisito fyo amuhumye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Ino lelo hontsavaga mung'asi habehi na kufika Damesichi, yavaga kota sasita hamunyi hino, mwangatsa mukomi kuhuma Kilanga gukang'alikaje mbali tseka. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Ngagwaje hasi na ngahulikaje litsi lyandonjelaga kuta, Sawuli, Sawuli! Kwasawuli yachi ung'oda? <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Heni ngaputsaje, Uli nani heve Mutwa? Nayo akamitulaje, Heni yo Yesu va ku Natsaleti yo ung'oda. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Vala wo vavaga hamwe na heni vaguwene gula mwangatsa, lechelelo sivakahuliche litsi lya yula yo alongaga na heni. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Duve heni ngamuputsaje, Nditaje chichi Mutwa? Mwene Mutwa akandonjelaje, Winuche na kubita ku Damesichi, na kuko ukulonjelwa ndongwa tseka tso uvichilwe ili utsidite. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Ngalemwaje kulola kwasawuli ya mwangatsa gula, ihyo vala vayangu vakandongotsaje kwa kimbatilitsa liwoko mbaka tukafikaje ku Damesichi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Kuko ku Damesichi kwavaga na munu yumwe yo achemwaga Hananiya, munu uyo aditaga malajitso ga Musa, nayo avaga munu yo ahesimilwaga na Vayawudi wo vikalaga uko. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Hananiya akatsaje kundola, nayo akimaje habehi na heni na kundonjela, Mung'olotsangu Sawuli! Lole kanji. Luvala lulula ngavetsaje kulola kanji na ngamuwonaje. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Kaha Hananiya akandonjelaje, Mulungu va vadada vetu akuhagwe heve ili uchitsele chila cho un'ganika kudita na umuwone yula Muhagulwa va Mulungu na kuhulika cho anlonga. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwasawuli heve ukuvalonjela vanu veka ndongwa tsila tso utsiwene na kutsihulika. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Ino lelo unhava chichi? Winuche ukabatitswe, ili uhofugwe na kuhulumilwa ndongwa tsako ntsibi kwa kumusuka Mutwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutwa angumutuma Pawulo kuvikula kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Ihyo lelo hontsavaga kuwuya ku Yelusalemu na hongavaga ntsinsuka mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, ngatsiwonaje nduntsuchilo. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Ngamuwonaje Mutwa an'ndonjela, Wangufitse uwuche hano ha Yelusalemu, kwasawuli vanu va hono hano sivakidichila ndongwa tsako tso ukumbikula heni. <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Heni ngamupitulaje, Mutwa vene van'tsela nachene kuta heni yo yula yo ntsavaga ntsinlutilalutila mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi na kuvabata na kuvatova vala veka wo vavaga vangukutumba. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Luvala lula Sitefwani mutantsi vako hoavaga ankopolwa, heni ntsavaga bahalaga ntsidichilaga lulongwa lula na kwimilila myenda jawo vala wo vamukopolaga. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Ihyo Mutwa akandonjelaje, Ubite, heni ngukutuma kutali kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi.<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Lila lilugu lya vanu lyamuhulikitsaga Pawulo, lechelelo ho avaga kulonga lulongwa ulo vakayovaje kuta, “Mumuhetse uyu muinyi, munu kota uyu si an'ganika kuva mumi!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Luvala ulo ho vankwendelela kuyova na kuno van'yuntsa myenda jawo na kutimulanga mingundi kilanga, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />yula muvina va vimilitsi akavalajitsaje vimilitsi yo anguvalongotsa kuta vamutegule Pawulo vamusindiche mugati mwa kambi ya vimilitsi yo yitsentsilwe kwa maganga, akavalonjelaje vamutove mikotya na vamuputse ili avalonjele kwasawuli yachi vanu vangumutovela chiyove icho. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Lechelelo ho vavaga kumuwopa ili vamutove mikotya ja nyingo, Pawulo akamuputsaje yula muvina va chikundi cha vimilitsi yo avaga imile habehi nayo, “Mbe, seliya yiganaga kumutova mikotya munyakaye va inyi ya Lumi manyi ang'acha ang'ali kuhigwa na kuwoneka adadye mu nongwa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Yula muvina va chikundi cha vimilitsi hoavaga kuhulika ihyo, akabitaje kumulonjela lulongwa ulo yula muvina vake, “Un'gana kudita chinu chachi? Kwasawuli munu yuno munyakaye va inyi ya Lumi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Ihyo yula muvina va vimilitsi akabitaje kumuputsa Pawulo, “Undonjele, heve uli munyakaye va inyi ya Lumi?” Pawulo akamupitulaje,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">“Eena, heni ntsili munyakaye va inyi ya Lumi.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Muvina yula va vimilitsi akamulonjelaje, “Heni ntsapasile wunyakaye wa inyi ya Lumi kwa kuhomba galama ngomi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Pawulo akamujibulaje kuta, Heni ntsili munyakaye va inyi ya Lumi kwa kuleleka.<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Kaha vala vanu wo vavaga vivisile chang'ani kwa kumuhima Pawulo vakawukaje bahobaho, nayo yula muvina akavaje na muloto ho avaga kutsela kuta amuwopite Pawulo kwa nyololo, kumbe munyakaye va inyi ya Lumi.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo ansindikwa halutalo ha Libalatsa likomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Hamilawu iyage yula muvina akaganaje kutsela wukweli wa ndongwa tsila kwa Pawulo kuta Vayawudi vangumuhijila chichi, nayo akamuwopolelaje nyololo na kuvalajitsa vatawula nambiko vavina na libalatsa lyeka vitang'ane. Hambele akamuletaje Pawulo ime halutalo hawo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pawulo akavakangatsilaje miho vala vanu va balatsa na kwantsa kulonga, “Nyee vang'olotsangu mbaka munyiguno ntsigumutumichila Mulungu kwa numbula ngolofu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Ihyo Hananiya yo Muvina va vatawula nambiko akavalajitsaje vala wo vavaga vimile habehi na Pawulo vamulapule kofi kumulomo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Kaha Pawulo akamulonjelaje, “Mulungu mwene akukutova kofi heve yo unakota lukantsi lolubasilwe chokaha! Kwasawuli wichite iho ili kunyiga heni kwa kufwata malajitso ga Musa, go heve mwene un'dita tebe nago kwa kulajitsa vanu vanove!” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Vala vanu wo vavaga vimile hala vakamulonjelaje Pawulo, “Kwasawuli yachi heve ungumuliga Muvina va vatawula nambiko va Mulungu!” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pawulo akavajibulaje, Nyee vang'olotsangu, sintselije ndaya kuta mwene yo Muvina va vatawula nambiko. Kwasawuli Mandiko ga Mulungu gatyaga hino, Uleche kumulonga fibi muvina va vanu vako. <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Pawulo hoavaga kutsela kuta libalatsa lila vanu vamwe Masadusayo na vanji vavaga Mafwalisayo, akalongaje fikami mulibalatsa lila kuta, “Nyee vang'olotsangu, heni tsili Mufwalisayo yo ndeliche na Mufwalisayo. Heni ntsinhigwa kwasawuli ntsintumba kuta kuna wutsilipuko.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Hoavaga kulonga ihyo, kukavaje wupungano wukomi hagati ha Mafwalisayo na Masadukayo na libalatsa lila likagavikaje kavili. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Chambutso cha kugavika kwawo chavaga chino, Masadukayo vantumba kuta kuduhu wutsilipulo wa vanu na kanji kuduhu mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu awu muhe, lechelelo Mafwalisayo vantumba kuta ifyo fyeka fidatu kofili. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kukavaje na chiyove chikomi, na vadahitsi vatunga va malajitso ga Musa va chikundi cha Mafwalisayo vakimaje na kusumwana hilo vakatyaje, “Sinambe tuyiwone nongwa yoyive kwa munu yuno, Lechelelo yifuluche yive muhe awu mutantsi va kilanga va Mulungu akuva alontsile nayo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Chitika chikalutilaje mbaka yula muvina va vimilitsi akavaje na muloto kuta vanu vafuluche vamusapanje Pawulo. Ihyo akalajitsaje fikundi fya vimilitsi fiche hala na kumuhetsa Pawulo kuhuma hono hala na vamwingitse mugati mwa kambi ya vimilitsi. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Hachilo chila, Mutwa akimaje habehi na Pawulo na kumulonjela, “Wikangatse numbula uleche kuva na muloto! Kota hila fyo umbikwe hano Yelusalemu, ho hihyo un'ganika ukambikule na kuko ku Lumi nako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vansaka hila fyo vakumukopola Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Hokwavaga kucha Vayawudi vakikalaje vapanje kwa lufiho hila fyo vakuludita lulongwa ulo. Vakilahaje kuta situkulya wala kung'wa chinu chochive mbaka hovakuva vamukopwe Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Vanu wo vavaga valagine kumukopola Pawulo vavaga valutye alubayini. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Vanu iwo vakabitaje kwa vatawula nambiko vavina na vavina va Vayawudi na kuvalonjela kuta, Hetwe tulagine hohamwe kwa kilaha kuta situkulya wala kung'wa mbaka hala hotukuva tumukopwe Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Lelo henye hamwe na vanu va libalatsa mumulonjele muvina va vimilitsi ili avaletele Pawulo, muve kota mun'gana kujela kuluhima ndalahela lulongwa lwake. Hetwe natwe tukuva habehi na hono iho ili tumukopole. <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Lechelelo mupwave va Pawulo akahulikaje chila chovavaga vapantsile vanu iwo, ihyo akabitaje mugati mukambi na kumulonjela Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ihyo Pawulo akamuchemaje mwimilitsi yumwe, akamulonjelaje, “Umutegule mukwamitsi yuno kwa muvina va chikundi cha vimilitsi, ana lulongwa lwa kumulonjela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ihyo muvina uyo va chikundi cha vimilitsi akamutegulaje yula mukwamitsi, vakabitasaje mbaka kwa muvina va vimilitsi na kumulonjela kuta, “Yula muwopwa yoanchemwa Pawulo aka anyemile na asusile ntsimulete mukwamitsi yuno kwa heve, nayo analo lulongwa lwa kukulonjela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Muvina uyo akamubataje liwoko mukwamitsi yula na vakabitaje halubali, nayo akamuputsaje, “Una lulongwa lwachi lo un'gana undonjele?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Mukwamitsi yula akalongaje, “Vayawudi vatunga valagine milawu vakukusuka umusindiche Pawulo halutalo ha libalatsa likomi kwa kideteletsela kota van'gana vahulikitse ndongwa tsake finofu. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Lechelelo heve uleche kidichila kwasawuli kuna vanu wo valutye alubayini vangumunyitila ili vamukopole, nawo vilahite kuta sivakulya wala kung'wa mbaka hala hovakuva vamukopwe Pawulo. Lelo sambi vali chang'ani, van'tsinda hela chila cho vakususile.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Yula muvina va vimilitsi akamulonjelaje mukwamitsi yula kuta, “Walahogola umulonjele munu yoyuve kuta undonje lulongwa luno.” Nayo akamulekaje abite.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anhamisilwa ku Kayisaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Duve yula muvina va vimilitsi akavachemaje vavina vayage va fikundi fivili fya vimilitsi na kuvalonjela, “Muvaviche chang'ani vimilitsi mya mbili na vakwina Fwalasi miyambili vanya waladi, na vimilitsi vanji sabini vanya migoha, lujendo ulo lukuva satatu ya hachilo. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Muviche fwalasi tsimwinga tso vakumutegula Pawulo, mumufisaje kuno mumi kwa Felichi muvina va mukova.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Hambele muvina uyo akandikaje baluva kwa Felichi yoyavaga yandikwe kuta,<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Heni Chilawudi Lisiya tsingukwandichila heve Felichi mutavala va mukova ili kukusamusa.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Vayawudi vakamwibite munu yuno vaganaga vamukopole. Lechelelo hontsavaga kutsela kuta munu yuno munyakaye va inyi ya Lumi, ngabitaje na chikundi cha vimilitsi ngamukulusaje. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Ngamusindikaje na kumuvika halutalo ha libalatsa lyawo likomi ili kugana kutsela chinu chachi cho vangumuhijila. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Ngatselaje kuta vamuhijite kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsa kusumwanila malajitso gawo hela go vapelitwe na Musa, nayo alihela lulongwa loluve lo lukumudita awopwe awu kukopolwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Ihyo hontsavaga kuhulika mupanjo gwa Vayawudi gwa kugana kumukopola, ngalamulaje ntsangufitse ntsimulete kwa heve. Kaha ntsivalonje iwo wo vamuhitsile nawo vatse vakuhadisile chila cho vangumuhijila.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ihyo lelo vala vimilitsi vakamutegulaje Pawulo kota fyo valajitswe na yula muvina, vakamusindikaje hachilo chicho mbaka ku muji gwa Andipatili. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Hamilawu iyage vimilitsi wo vavaga vahele kwa magulu, vakawuyaje ha kambi ya vimilitsi. Vakavalekaje vala vimilitsi wo vakwinile fwalasi vendelele na lujendo hamwe na Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Vimilitsi vala hovavaga kufika ku Kayisaliya vakamupelaje baluva yila yula muvina va mukova na kumuvika Pawulo mu wimilitsi wake. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Felichi ho avaga kuyisoma baluva yila akaputsaje, “Heve uhumye ku mukova gwachi.” Mwene akatyaje nyumye ku mukova gwa Chilichiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />nayo Felichi akalongaje, “Nguluhulikitsa lulongwa lwako hovakuva vafisile hano wo vakuhijite.” Hambele akalajitsaje Pawulo avikwe mu wimilitsi mu nyumba ya chintsajila ya Helode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vangumuhiga Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku tsihanu, muvina va vatawula nambiko yo achemwaga Hananiya akafikaje ku Kayisaliya hamwe na vavina vatunga na munu yumwe munya kugatsela malajitso ga Musa yo achemwaga Tetulo. Nawo vakalongaje halutalo ha Felichi chila cho vamuhijila Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Pawulo akachemwaje injile mugati, nayo Tetulo akantsaje kweletsela kwa kulonga, Muvina Felichi kwa luvala lutali tuveye na wusichimafu wukomi mu wulongotsi wako, na ndongwa ntsolofu nofu uvaditye vanu va inyi yino kwasawuli ya ntselo tsako. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Muvina Felichi, tungutsanuchila ndongwa tsino kwa wusangalo chila luvala na chila hono na kukulumba ndalahela. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Lechelelo bila kukufulugatsa ndalahela, ntsingukusuka kwa lusungu lwako utuhulikitse ndongwa tsetu kwa luvala lutunga hela. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tutselye kuta munu yuno angutuyufya ndalahela, nayo yo alongotsaga chitika hagati ha Vayawudi ku inyi tseka na mwene yo chilongotsi va chikundi cha Vanatsolayo. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Kahi ajelaga kudita ndongwa tso sinambe tsiganiche kuditwa mu Nyumba ya Mulungu, lechelelo hetwe tukamubataje na kugana kumuhiga kwa kufwata malajitso ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Lechelelo Lisiya yo muvina va vimilitsi akatsaje na kumuhetsa kwa ludali mu mawoko getu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Kahi akalajitsaje vanu wo vamuhijite vatse kwa heve, manyi heve mwene umuputse munu yuno, ufuluche uwutsele wukweli weka wa ndongwa tsino fyo tsili. <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Vayawudi veka wo vavaga hala vakatyaje, ndongwa tseka tso alontsile uyo muyetu ho hihyo fyotsili.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo angipamana halutalo ha Felichi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Muvina Felichi akamusonelaje Pawulo ili alonje lulongwa, nayo Pawulo akalongaje, Ntsin'tsela kuta heve uveye muhigaji mu inyi yino kwa myaka myolofu, ihyo ntsin'gana kulonga hila ndongwa fyotsili, kuno ntsina wusangalo wukomi mu numbula yangu. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ufuluche uputsanitse na kutsela kuta tsilutye siku kumi na tsivili hela kuhuma mbite ku Yelusalemu kumufugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Vayawudi vano sivakafisile heni mu Nyumba ya Mulungu ntsinlongana na munu yoyuve, awu kudita chitika ha mukong'ano, awu kusumwana na munu yoyuve mu nyumba ya kitang'anila Vayawudi, awu hono hanji hohave ha muji. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Sivafuluche vakulonjele wukweli kukulajila ndongwa tsila tso vanyije heni. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Lulongwa lo fuluche ntsihale kwa heve lumwe duve. Heni ntsingumufugamila Mulungu va vadada vetu na kufwata kota fyo vandiche valoli va Mulungu, na kaha ntsinguyifwata Ng'asi yila yo vene vanguyichema kuta yawudesi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Heni ntsina lihuvilo lilyo kwa Mulungu kota vanu vano fyo vanalyo, kuta kukuva na wutsilipuko kwa wo van'dita na vala wo sinambe vadite kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ihyo ntsingitsovetsa chila luvala ili ntsive na numbula ngolofu halutalo ha Mulungu na halutalo ha vanu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Hontsavaga kikala kutali kwa myaka myolofu, hambele ngatsaje ku Yelusalemu ili ntsivaletele finu vanu vagayu va inyi yangu na kutawula sadaka kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Luvala lula hontsavaga mwanga ntsivisile chang'ani kwasawuli ya kumufugamila Mulungu, vakafikaje vanu vano, na sikwavaga na lilugu lya vanu lyo lyavaga hamwe na heni, na kaha sintsavakosile vanu vadite chitika chochive. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Lechelelo kwavaga na Vayawudi vanji wo vavaga vahumye ku Asiya wo twavaga hamwe nawo uko, iwo wo vaganikije vave hano valonje manyi vana lulongwa lubi loluve londisile heni, <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />manyi si ihyo uvaleche vanu vano wo valihano valonje lulongwa lubi lo valuwene kwaheni ho ntsavaga ntsimile halutalo ha libalatsa lyawo likomi, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ila ntsalontsile fikami lulongwa lumwe hela hontsavaga halutalo hawo kuta, Heni munyiguno ntsinhigwa kwasawuli ya wutsilipuko.<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ihyo muvina Felichi yo avaga atsitsele finofu ndongwa tsa Ng'asi iyo, akalongaje, “Hala muvina Lisiya hoakuva kutsa nguvalonjela na kuyilamula nongwa yako.” Ihyo Felichi akayilisaje chesi yila. <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kaha akamulajitsaje yula muvina va chikundi cha vimilitsi amuviche Pawulo mu wimilitsi, ila vamuleche adite cho an'gana mwene na muvaleche vanu vake va habehi vamuditile cho an'gana.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Felichi anhulikitsa nongwa ya Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku nunga, Felichi akatsaje hamwe na Dulusila mudala vake yo avaga Muyawudi. Felichi akalajitsaje vamulete Pawulo, hoavaga kutsa akamuhuliktsaje hala ho avaga anlonga ndongwa tsa kumutumba Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Lechelelo hala Pawulo hoavaga anlonga ndongwa tsa wuwuya kwa Mulungu na ndongwa tsa siku ya wuhigo na ndongwa tsa kiyangalila u mwene. Felichisi akavaje na muloto na kulonga hino lelo duve yikwilye ufuluche uwuche, na heni manyi mate luvala ngukuchema. <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Hamwe na ihyo yula muvina Felichisi amuchemaga chila luvala na kulongana kwa kuhotsa kuta Pawulo afuluche amupele magobole ili amulechele.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Hojavaga kulutila myaka jivili, Polichiyo Fesito akabadilaje hono ha wutavala wa Felichisi. Lechelelo kwasawuli Felichisi aganaga kuvagan'ya Vayawudi, ihyo akamulekaje Pawulo mu nyumba ya vawopwa.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo ansuka nongwa yake yisindikwe kwa muvina va inyi ya Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku tsidatu luhuma Fesito afiche ku Kayisaliya kuva mutavala, akawukaje kubita ku Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />kuko vatawula nambiko vavina hamwe na vavina va Vayawudi vakatsaje na kumuhiga Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Vakamugongoletsaje ndalahela Fesito avaditile wuwuya, alajitse Pawulo asindikwe ku Yelusalemu ili vene vamunyitile mung'asi na kumukopola. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Lechelelo Fesito akavajibulaje, “Pawulo awopitwe mu nyumba ya vawopwa kula ku Kayisaliya, heni mwene ngubita kuko siku tsitsinago tsa habehi. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Muvahagule vavina venyu vatunga tubitase hamwe na heni, na uko vakalonje ndogwa tso vangumuhiga na manyi kuna lulongwa loluve lubi lo adisile, heni nguhulikitsa na kulamula.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesito hoavaga kikala hamwe nawo kwa siku kota nane awu kumi hino, akabitaje ku Kayisaliya na hamilawu iyage akikalaje chigoda chakuhijila mu libalatsa ya kuhijila na kulajitsa vamulete Pawulo halutalo hake. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Pawulo hoavaga kutsa ha libalatsa lya kuhijila, vala Vayawudi wovavaga vatsitse kuhuma ku Yelusalemu vakimaje kuno vamupilime Pawulo, nawo vakantsaje kumuhiga kwa kulonga ndongwa ntsolofu ntsibi tso sivafuluche valonje hila fyotsili. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Lechelelo Pawulo akantsaje kulonga, “Heni singadisile lulongwa lubi loluve lo luli tebe na malajitso ga Musa, awu Nyumba ya Mulungu, awu kuva tebe na mutavala va inyi ya Lumi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Lechelelo Fesito aganaga kihegeletsa kwa Vayawudi, ihyo akamuputsaje Pawulo, “Mbe, un'gana kubita ku Yelusalemu na ukahijilwe kuko halutalo hangu kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsino ntsibi tso vangukuhiga?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pawulo akajibulaje, “Heni ntsimile halutalo ha balatsa ya kuhijila lya Kayisali, na iha ho ntsin'ganika kuhijilwa. Kota hila heve mwene fyo un'tsela finofu kuta sintsavaditye Vayawudi lulongwa lubi loluve. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Duve manyi ndisile lulongwa loluve lo nguganika kufwa, singusuka kuhulumilwa. Lechelelo manyi ntsanantsile lulongwa loluve na ntsin'ganika kufwa, singulema kufwa. Manyi vave van'nyiga kwa wudesi kuduhu munu yoyuve yo afuluche ang'abikitse kwa Vayawudi vano. Heni ntsinsuka muyisindiche nongwa yangu kwa muvina va inyi ya Lumi.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Hala Fesito hoavaga kulongana na vanu va libalatsa lyake, akamujibulaje Pawulo, “Kwasawuli heve ususile kubita kwa muvina va inyi ya Lumi, duve vakukusindika.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo ali halutalo ha Ajilipa na Beniche</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku nunga hambele, muntsajila Ajilipa na muhatsave yo achemwaga Beniche vakafikaje ku Kayisaliya kumulibulitsa Fesito mu wutavala. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Hovavaga kikala kuko siku ntsolofu, Fesito vakalonganaje na muntsajila nongwa ya Pawulo, “Hano hana munu yumwe yo akalesilwe na Felichi mu nyumba ya vawopwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Ihyo hontsavaga kubita Yelusalemu, vatawula nambiko vavina na vavina va Vayawudi vakandonjelaje ndongwa tsake na kusuka ntsimuhije kuta akosise. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Lechelelo heni ntsavapitwe kuta si ntsovelo ya Valumi kumuhiga munu yoyuve kuta akosise, manyi muhigwaji ang'acha ang'ali kitang'ana na vala wo vamuhitsile, mbaka avaje apelilwe nyafwasi ya kipamanila kwa nongwa yila yo vamuhije. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Hovavaga kufika hano hamwe na heni sintsahafile, hamilawu yiyage ngavikaje chikalo cha libalatsa lya wuhigo, ngalajitsaje kuta vamulete munu uyo. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Vanu vala wo vavaga vamuhijite Pawulo vakimaje, lechelelo vakalemwaje kulonga lulongwa lubi loluve kota fyo ntsahotsaga. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Lechelelo vavaga na sumwano nunga na munu uyo kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsawo tsa dini, na vagwadilaga ndongwa tsa munu yumwe yo afweye yo anchemwa Yesu, lechelelo mwene Pawulo ahahanitsaga kuta munu uyo ang'acha mumi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Heni ngalemwaje kutsela cho ngudita kwasawuli ya lulongwa ulo, ihyo ngamuputsaje Pawulo manyi akugana kubita ku Yelusalemu ili akajibule cho vangumuhijila. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Lechelelo Pawulo akasukaje lulongwa lwake lukahulikitswe na muntsajila muvina va inyi ya Lumi, ihyo ngalajitsaje avikwe mu nyumba ya vawopwa mbaka hala ho ngumusindika uko.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Ihyo Ajilipa akamulonjelaje Fesito, “Ntsin'gana ntsimuhulikitse tsimwene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Fesito akamupitulaje, “Ukumuhulikitsa munu uyo mitondo.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ajilipa anlonjelwa nongwa ya Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Hamilawu iyage, Ajilipa na Beniche vakinjilaje ha libalatsa lya kuhijila kwa wusangalo, kuno vilongwitse hamwe na vavina va vimilitsi na vanu vatambulwa va muji gula. Ihyo kwa malajitso ga Fesito vakamuletaje Pawulo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Ino lelo Felisito akalongaje, “Muntsajila Ajilipa na henye nyeka yo muli hono hano, mungumuwona munu yuno yo alihalutalo henyu! Aveye tebe na Vayawudi veka wo vangikala hono hano na va uko Yelusalemu, ihyo vakandetelaje nongwa kuta an'ganika kukopolwa. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Lechelelo heni singawene kuta adisile lulongwa lubi loluve mbaka aganiche kukopolwa, lelo kwasawuli mwene mwanga avaga aganite lulongwa lwake lusindikwe kwa muntsajila muvina va inyi ya Lumi, na heni ngalamulaje asindikwe kuko. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Lechelelo heni ntsilihela chinu cha kumwandichila munu va kuhesimilwa Kayisali yo muntsajila muvina va inyi ya Lumi, kwasawuli ya munu yuno. Ihyo ntsimuletite halutalo henyu henye nyeka, hasa heve muntsajila Ajilipa, kota fyo uhulikitse ulamule, ili ntsive na chinu cha kwandika. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Ihyo ntsin'wona kuta lukuva lulongwa lwa mbedatsi kumusindika muwopwa kwa munu va kuhesimilwa Kayisali yo muntsajila muvina va inyi ya Lumi, bila kulajila ndongwa tso vamuhije.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo angipamana halutalo ha Ajilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Muntsajila Ajilipa akamulonjelaje Pawulo, “Lelo ufuluche wantse kipamanila.” Ihyo Pawulo akagololaje liwoko lyake ili vantse kumuhulikitsa, nayo akalongaje.<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />Muntsajila Ajilipa! Ntsin'wona finofu munyiguno kwima halutalo hako kiyamila kwasawuli ya ndongwa tseka tso vanyijite Vayawudi, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />kwasawuli heve ungutsitsela ndalahela ntsovelo tseka na ndongwa tso tunsumanila na Vayawudi, kwasawuli iyo ntsingukusuka unyulikitse kwa wusichimafu. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Vayawudi veka van'tsela ndongwa tsangu kuhuma ha wana wangu kuhuma mwantso mwa wumi wangu na hila fyo ntsichite mu inyi yangu, kanji hila fyo ntsichite uko ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Nawo kwa luvala lutali vantsela na manyi vagane vafuluche valonje chila cho vachitsele, kuta luhuma hamutalo ntsavaga mufwasi munanahitsi va chikundi cha Mafwalisayo na ntsovelo tseka tsa malajitso geka ga Musa. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Ino lelo sambi ntsimile hano kwa kuhigwa kwasawuli ya kihuvila chila cho Mulungu avaga alontsile kuta akuvapela vadada vetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Chinu chino cho chila Mulungu avaga alontsile kuta akuvapela vadada vetu na cho vangihuvila vanu va kabila tsetu kumi na tsivili van'tsinda chikwile, nawo vangumutumichila Mulungu lwa hihyo hamunyi na hachilo. Enaa, muntsajila muvina! Heni ntsinhigwa na Vayawudi vano kwasawuli ya lihuvilo ilyo. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Kwasawuli yachi munu yoyuve hagati henyu an'wona wutalamu ndalahela kutumba kuta Mulungu avatsilipulaga vanu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Kaha na heni mwene iho hamutalo ntsitumbaga na kudita fyeka fyo fyaganikaga kwa kulemetsa ndongwa tsa Yesu va ku Natsaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ihyo fyo ntsadisile uko ku Yelusalemu. Vavina va vatawula nambiko vamelye mamulaka ga kuvahiga na kuvasindika vanya litumbilo wolofu mu nyumba tsa vawopwa. Nawo vamwe hovavaga vankopolwa heni ntsatofile kula kuludikitsaga lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mala tsolofu ntsabitaga mu nyumba tsa kitang'anila Vayawudi na kuvatova, kaha ntsavalatsimitsaga vamulije Mulungu, ntsavavipilaga kota ntsina lukwale na kuvafwata nambe ku miji ja kuwujentsi.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anlonga hila fyo amupituchilye Chilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Siku yimwe ho ntsavaga mu njendo itso ntsim'bita ku Damesichi kwa mamulaka na kuno ntsina malajitso kuhuma kwa vatawula nambiko vavina, <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />enaa, muntsajila. Hontsavaga mung'asi hamunyi, ntsaguwene mwangatsa kuhuma Kilanga go gwavaga gummelema kulutila litsuva, gukang'alichilaje heni na vala vanu wo vavaga hamwe na heni. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Tweka tukagwaje hasi, na heni ngahulikaje litsi lo lyalongaga na heni kwa Chiebulaniya kuta, Sawuli, Sawuli kwasawuli yachi ung'oda? Kwakudita ihyo ungigatsa hela, kwasawuli unkuva kota senga fyo yimpana lugoda lwa mudimi vake. <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Ngamuputsaje, Heve uli nani Mutwa? Nayo Mutwa akamitulaje kuta, Heni Yesu yo ung'oda. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Lelo winuche wime. Kwasawuli nguhumye ili nguhagule uve mutantsi vangu, na uve munu yo ukuvalonjela vanu ndongwa tso utsiwene munyi guno na tsila tso ngukulajila hambele. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Ngukukulusa kuhuma kwa Vayawudi vayago na kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi wo ntsingukutuma kwawo, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />ili uvadite vantsele heni na kuhuma mu jitsa na kutsa mu mwangatsa, vahume mu mamulaka ga Lihoka na kwinjila mu wuntsajila wa Mulungu, ili vahulumilwe ndongwa tsawo ntsibi, ili vave hamwe na vanu wo vangunumbila heni.<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anlonga hila fyowuli wutantsi wake kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Ihyo muntsajila Ajilipa, ngalemwaje kutsilema nduntsuchilo tsila tso tsihumye Kilanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Ihyo ngantsaje kuvikula kwa vanu va ku Damesichi na va ku Yelusalemu na ku Wuyawudi kweka na kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi, kuta veka van'ganika kihala ndongwa tsawo ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu, na kwa ng'olwa tsawo valajile kuta vamupituchilye mwene. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwasawuli iyo iwo Vayawudi ho vakimbataje ho ntsavaga mu Nyumba ya Mulungu na kugana kung'okopola. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Lechelelo Mulungu antsimilye mbaka munyiguno ntsili halutalo ha vatavala na wosi vatavala wo ntsinguvalonjela chila cho chanyumye. Singulonga chinu chochive kulutila fila fyo alontsile Musa na valoli va Mulungu kuta fikuhumila, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />kuta Chilisito akukodwa na akuva mulongola va kutsilipuka, akuvang'alichila vanu mwangatsa gwa wukuluso wake kwa vanu vake Vayawudi na wosi Vayawudi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Pawulo ho avaga anlonga ihyo, Fesito akalongaje fikami kuta, “Pawulo! Una lukwale! Kusoma kwako kolofu kukupelye lukwale!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Lechelelo Pawulo akamulonjelaje, Enaa muvina Fesito, heni ntsihela lukwale ila heni ntsina nyala na ntsinlonga ndongwa tsa wukweli ng'ani na tso tsin'tselanika.<verse eid="ACT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Nayo Muntsajila Ajilipa atsitsele finofu ndongwa tsino tseka tso ntsinlonga, na heni fuluche ndonje halutalo hake bila muloto. Ntsin'tsela kuta ndongwa tseka tso tsihumye mwene atsitsele, kwasawuli lulongwa ulo silukakoliche hono halufiho.<verse eid="ACT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ena muntsajila Ajilipa, mbe, unguvatumba valoli va Mulungu? Ntsin'tsela kuta unguvatumba.<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Ajilipa akamulonjelaje Pawulo kuta, “Untijila kuta kwa luvala ludodo ufuluche undite na heni ntsimutumbe Chilisito?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pawulo akamupitulaje kuta, “Ntsingumusuka Mulungu kuta luve luvala ludodo awu lutali siyo heve ng'ani uliyeka, ila hamwe na vala veka wova n'nyulikitsa munyiguno vave kota heni fyontsili, ila valeche kuwopwa kota heni.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Pawulo hoavaga kulonga ihyo muntsajila Ajilipa akinukaje hamwe na Fesito muvina va mukova na Beniche na vala wo vavaga vichite hamwe nawo. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Hovavaga van'huma hono iho vakalonganaje, Munu yuno sinambe adite lulongwa lo lufuluche lumudite awopwe awu kukopolwa. <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Nayo muntsajila Ajilipa akamulonjelaje Fesito kuta, “Munu yuno akakuwopolwa manyi aka ave si asusile asindikwe kwa Kayisali muntsajila muvina va inyi ya Lumi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo ansindikwa ku Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Hoyavaga kulamulwa kuta tukubita ku Italiya kwa kukolela mubahali, Pawulo na vawopwa vanji vakakabitswaje kwa muvina va vimilitsi yo achemwaga Juliyasi, yo avaga yumwe va chikundi cha Kayisali muntsajila muvina va Lumi. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tukantsaje lujendo lwetu kwa kukwina meli yo yahumaga ku Adulamitiyamu yo yavaga mulujendo kukolela miji ja mulubali lwa bahali ku Asiya. Twavaga hamwe na Alisitako munu va ku Machedoniya va kuhuma ku Tesaloniche. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Hamilawu iyage tukafikaje ku Sidoni. Juliyasi akamuditilaje wuwuya Pawulo kwa kumuleka itang'ane na vanu vake va habehi, ili vamupele chochive cho aganaga. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Tukawukaje kuhuma kuko na kwasawuli ya ng'ala ngomi yawugaga finji, tukakolaje lubali lwa kunena lwa hono hakafu ho hapilimwe na malenga ho hanchemwa Chipulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Hotwavaga kulowoka bahali yo yavaga lubali lwa Chilichiya na Pamufiliya, tukafikaje ku muji gwa Mila go gwavaga mu inyi ya Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Kuko yula muvina akayifikaje meli yimwe yo yahumaga ku Alechitsandeliya kubita ku Italiya, akatukwinitsaje mumo. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tukajendaje molemole kwa meli kwa luvala lwa siku ntsolofu, tukabitaje kwa kunana mbaka tukafikaje habehi na muji gwa Nido. Lechelelo ng'ala ngomi yendelelaga kuwuga tukalemwaje kubita kwa kusupanitsa, ihyo tukakolaje lubali lwa lihumilo lwa litsuva lwa muji gwa Chilete hono hakafu ho havaga hapilimwe na malenga na tukakolaje habehi na ku Salumone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tukakolaje mulubalilubali lwa bahali kwa kunana mbaka tukafikaje hono ho hanchemwa Bandali Nofu habehi na muji gwa Laseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Hotwavaga kuyatsa luvala lolofu mubahali, na lujendo lwetu lwavaga na hatali ntsolofu, kwasawuli siku tsa kuleka kulya tsavaga mwanga tsilutye, ihyo Pawulo akavafundaje vanu kwa kuvalonjela kuta, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Nyee vayangu, ntsin'wona kuta lujendo luno lukuva lutalamu na lwa kutupela hasala ngomi kwa meli na mitsigo na kwa wumi wetu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Lechelelo yula Juliyasi muvina va chikundi cha vimilitsi akabedalaje chila cho alontsile Pawulo, akavahulikitsaje mulongotsa meli na munya meli. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kwasawuli hono hotsimaga meli havaga habi kwa kikala ha luvala lwa chisisima, vanu wolofu vakalongaje kuta chiba twendelele na lujendo mbaka tufiche ku Foyiniche twikale kuko ha luvala luno lwa chisisima. Hono iho hotsimaga meli havaga lubali lwa kolinsotela linsuva lwa muji gwa Chilete.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ala ngomi mubahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Ng'ala yikantsaje kuwuga molemole kuhumila lubali lwa kusika, vakitumbaje kuta vakuvetsa kufika kovahotsije kuta vakufika, ihyo vakahetsaje nanga ya kwimitsila meli na kwantsa lujendo, mbaka habehi na hono hotsimaga meli ha mwani gwa Chilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Lechelelo holwavaga kulutila luvala ludodo hela yikangatsaje kuwuga ng'ala ngomi yo yinchemwa, “Ng'ala ya kunena,” yahumaga ku mwani gwa Chilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Meli yikatowaje na ng'ala yila ngomi mbaka tukalemwaje kusindika meli ku lubali lula lo yinhuma ng'ala yila, lelo tukayilekaje meli yibite kuyim'bita yila ng'ala. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Hotwavaga kukunujitswa kwa wangufitso na kufika hono hakafu ho hapilimwe na malenga ho hanchemwa Kawuda, iho tukavetsaje kwendesa kwa kunana mutumbwi mudodo gwa kuvakulusila vanu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Vala vatantsi va meli vakagukwegaje mutumbwi ugo mbaka mu meli na kuguwopa mulubali lwa meli kwa ndejesi ili guleche kubeneka. Vakogopaga kuta vaka kukwama muluhanga lo luli mulubali lwa bahali lwa mwani gwa Siliti, vakisaje nanga ili meli yileche kukunujitswa na ng'ala yila. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Ng'ala yikendelelaje kuwuga ndalahela, na siku ya kavili vakantsaje kutegula mitsigo na kujidibula mu bahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Siku ya kadatu vakadibulaje finu fya meli kwa mawoko gawo vene. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa luvala lwa siku ntsolofu si twaliwene litsuva awu nyenyetsi, nayo ng'ala ngomi yikendelelaje kuwuga. Mbaka tukagotsolaje kukuluka.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Hotwavaga kikala siku ntsolofu bila kulya, Pawulo akimaje hagati hawo akavalonjelaje, Nyee vayangu, yika kuva chiba mukamuve munyulikitse heni na kuleka kwendelela na lujendo kuhuma hala ha Chilete, ihyo mukakuva mwepite wananjifu wuno wa meli na kuyatsa mitsigo jino.<verse eid="ACT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Lechelelo sambi ntsinguvasuka mwikangatse! Kuduhu nambe munu yumwe yo akufwa, ila meli ng'ani yo yikwananjika. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Mulungu yo heni ntsi vake na yo ntsingumutumichila, higolo hachilo akamutumile mutantsi vake va kilanga akanyumilaje, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />nayo akandonjelaje kuta, Pawulo, uleche kuva na muloto! Kwasawuli un'ganika kwima halutalo ha muntsajila muvina va inyi ya Lumi, nayo Mulungu kwa wuwuya wake akukukulusa heve hamwe na vanu veka wo ujendite nawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ihyo nye vayangu musangalalaje, kwasawuli ntsingumutumba Mulungu kuta yikuva kota fyo andonje. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Lechelelo nambe yikuva ihyo ila meli yetu yikunanahila hono hanji hakafu ho hapilimwe na malenga. <verse eid="ACT 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Siku ya kumi na katayi hachilo, twavaga tung'acha tunkunugitswa na ng'ala mu bahali ya Adiliya. Hoyavaga kufika habehi na hachilo na gati, valongotsa meli vakatselaje kuta vavaga vali habehi na inyi ng'afu. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ihyo vakapimaje wutali wa malenga vakisaje chuma chisito cho chiwopelitswe mu lulejesi vakisaje mumalenga, vakapimaje gakavaje na wutali wa mita alubayini, vakahejelaje kutalo vakapimaje vakapataje wutali wa mita isilini na sita. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Vakavaje na muloto kuta meli yawo yifuluche yikunugitswe mbaka yikakune mu litalawe lya mu bahali, vakisaje nanga tsitayi tsa kwimitsila meli kwa kumbele, vakatsindaje kwele. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ihyo vala vatantsi va mu meli mwanga vavaga visise mutumbwi mubahali, vakavaje kota van'gana kubita kutalo vakise nanga tsa kwimitsila meli, kumbe vaganaga kunyelebuka. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Lechelelo Pawulo akamulonjelaje yula muvina va vimilitsi na vimilitsi vake kuta, “Manyi vatantsi vano va mu meli valeche kusigala mugati muno, simukuhogola mukuluche.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Ihyo vala vimilitsi vakadumulaje tsila ndejehe tso tsigubatilitse gula mutumbwi mudodo, vakagulekaje gwelele mu malenga. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Hokwavaga kuva habehi na kucha, Pawulo akavagongoletsaje vanu veka valye chilyo akatyaje, “Lelo kwa siku tsino kumi na tsitayi muveye na muloto na simulalya chinu chochive. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Ino lelo ntsinguvasuka mulye chilyo kwasawuli mun'ganika kuva wumi. Kwasawuli ntsinguvalonjela wukweli kuta veka mukukuluswa, na kuduhu nambe munu yumwe yo akutetseka.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Pawulo hoavaga kulonga ihyo, akategulaje mukate akamulumbaje Mulungu halutalo hawo na kugumega na kwantsa kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Ihyo vanu veka vakasangalalaje na kwantsa kulya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Vanu veka wo twavaga mugati mu meli, yo twakulwiche twavaga vanu mya mbili na sabinasita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Chila munu hoavaga kulya chilyo na kwiguta, vakapungutsaje wusito wa meli kwa kudibula mu bahali ngano na filyo fitunga.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'ala ngomi yim'bena Meli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Hokwavaga kucha vanu veka vakalemwaje kuhatsela kuta hala vavaga inyi yachi, ila vakahawonaje hono ho hana luhanga nawo vakalonganaje kuta manyi vakuvetsa vabite vakayegamiche meli hono iho haluhanga. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ihyo vakawopolaje nanga tsa kwimitsila meli na kutsileka mubahali, na luvala lulo vakawopolaje ndejehe tso vavaga vawopite sitelinji ya meli. Hambele vakategaje mwenda gwa kutalo gwa kuchijila ng'ala, ili guyichije ng'ala na kukunujitswa kubita kula koluli luhanga lula. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Lechelelo meli yikafikaje hono ho havaga na nang'ano tsa malenga mafupi go gam'bita fikami, meli iyo yikakwamaje na kutalo kwa meli kukayajililaje muluganga bila kutigasika. Kumbele kwa meli kukabenekaje vipande fivili kwasawuli ya kukunujitswa na mavimbi makomi.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Vala vimilitsi vakahotsaje kuvakopola vawopwa veka ili valeche kojelela mbaka kuluhanga na kunyelebuka. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Lechelelo kwasawuli yula muvina va vimilitsi aganaga kumukulusa Pawulo na lulongwa ulo, akavalemetsaje vala vimilitsi valeche kudita ihyo. Akavalajitsaje vala wo vafitsele kojelela vitotse mu bahali wojelele mbaka kula kuluhanga, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />na vamwinga vahume mumbele kuno vibatilitse mu mbawo awu mufipande fya meli fyo fibeniche, ihyo vanu veka tukakulukaje na kufika kuluhanga tuwumi.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Ndongwa tso adisile Pawulo ku Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Hotwavaga kukuluka na kufika hono hala tuwumi, tukatselaje kuta hono hala hakafu ho hapilimwe na malenga hachemwaga Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Vanyakaye va hono iho vavaga vana numbula nofu ndalahela. Vakatukotselaje moto gwa kotela kwasawuli ndonya yavaga yin'tonya na kwavaga na ng'ala. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pawulo hoavaga anholangitsa ngodi na kuhegeletsa mu moto, na kwasawuli ya wupyo wupyo wula wa moto, yikahumaje ntsoka yinya sumu ng'ali yikamupilingitsaje mu liwoko. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Vala vanu va hono hala hovavaga kuyiwona tsoka yin'ninyila mu liwoko lya Pawulo vakalonganaje kuta, “Munu yuno akuva muwumiyani, na avaje akuluche kuhuma mu bahali, kwasawuli ya uwumiyani wake mihoka sijikumuleka endelele kuva mumi.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Lechelelo Pawulo akayipamanilaje mumoto ntsoka yila nayo si yamulumile. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Vanu vala vahotsaga kuta akakutuna awu kugwa hasi na kufwa bahobaho. Lechelelo hovavaga kutsinda kwa luvala lutali na kuwona kuta kuduhu chinu chochive cho chimuhumye, vakalongaje kuta, “Mwene yuno akuva yumwe va mihoka!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Habehi na hono hala havaga na migunda ja muvina va hono hala hakafu ho hapiliwe na malenga ho hachemwaga Pubuliyo, munu yuno akatulibulitsaje kwa numbula ya wuwuya kwa siku tsidatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Dade va Pubuliyo avaga avasise mulusaga atamikaga kuhalisa danda. Pawulo akinjilaje munyumba na kumusuchila kwa kumuvichila mawoko, nayo akaponaje. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Vanu vala hovavaga kuhulika ndongwa tso tsihumye, vatamwa veka va hono hala vakatsaje na vakaponetswaje. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Vanu vala vakatuhesimilaje ndalahela na vakatulumbaje kwa kutupela finu fyolofu, na hotwavaga tun'gana kwantsa lujendo, vakatusindikitsaje mbaka mu meli.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anhuma ku Malita na kubita ku Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Hojavaga kulutila myetsi jidatu tukantsaje kaha lujendo lwetu kwa meli yimwe ya ku Alechitsandeliya yo yavaga yandikwe “Mihoka jinya mbili,” jo jinchemwa Kasita na Polisichi. Meli iyo yavaga yimile hono hala kwa luvala lwa chisisima hono hala ho hapilimwe na malenga. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tukafikaje ku muji gwa Silakusa, tukikalaje baho kwa siku tsidatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Tukawukaje kuhuma uko, tukapilimaje na kufika ku muji gwa Lejiyo. Hoyavaga kulutila siku yimwe ng'ala ya kuhuma lubali lwa kusika yikantsaje kuwuga na kutukunujitsa na siku ya kavili tukafikaje ku muji gwa Puteyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Kuko tukavafikaje kwa vayetu vatunga wo vamutumbye Chilisito wo vakatugongolaje twikale nawo kwa wichi yimwe. Ihyo ho twafisile inyi ya Lumi. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Vayetu wo vamutumbye Chilisito va uko ku Lumi ho vavaga kuhulika ndongwa tsetu, vakatsaje kututang'anitsa mbaka hono ha kugutsila finu hanchemwa Apiyo ha Mikahava Jidatu. Pawulo ho avaga kuvawona, akamulumbaje Mulungu akakangatswaje ndalahela.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo ku muji gwa Lumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Hotwavaga kufika ku Lumi, Pawulo akalekwaje aliyeka na mwimilitsi yumwe hela va kumwimilila.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Hotsavaga kulutila siku tsidatu, Pawulo akavachemaje hono hamwe vavina va Vayawudi. Hovavaga kukong'ana akavalonjelaje, “Nyee, vang'olotsangu, nambaje sindisile lulongwa lubi loluve kwa vanu vetu awu kwa ntsovelo tsa va dada vetu. Lechelelo vambite uko ku Yelusalemu na vakambikaje mu wimilitsi wa Valumi kuno mbopitwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Hovavaga kusinda kumbutsa vaganaga kundechela, kwasawuli sivaluwene lulongwa lo lukundita ng'opolwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Lechelelo vavina vamwe va Vayawudi vakalulemaje lulongwa ulo, ngasukaje kuta vasindiche lulongwa lwangu kwa Kayisali muntajila muvina va inyi ya Lumi, nambaje sintsavaga na nongwa yoyive ya kuvahiga vanu va inyi yangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ihyo susile twiwone na kulongana na henye, kwasawuli heni mbopitwe nyololo tsino kwasawuli ya lihuvilo lila lya vanu va Isilaheli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Vene vala vakamulonjelaje, “Hetwe sitwanuche baluva yoyive kuhuma ku Wuyawudi yo yandikwe ndongwa tsako, na kahi kuduhu Muyawudi yoyuve yo atsitse hano na kulonga lulongwa lubi loluve kwasawuli yako. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Lechelelo tun'wona kuta chiba tuhuliche kuhuma kwa heve, kwasawuli tun'tsela kuta chila hono vanu vanguchilonga fibi chikundi chino.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Vakapangaje siku ya kitang'ana, vanu wolofu vakafikaje kono uko ko avaga angikala Pawulo na luhuma hamilawu mbaka hamihe, nayo Pawulo avavikulilaga ndongwa tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu kuhuma mu malajitso ga Musa na valoli va Mulungu na kuvagongoletsa kuta vamutumbe Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Vanu vamwe vakatsidichilaje ndongwa tsake, lechelelo vamwe vakalemaje kumutumba. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ihyo vanu vakagavikaje kwasawuli ya ndongwa itso na kwantsa kuwuka, Pawulo akavalonjelaje, Muhe va Mulungu alontsile wukweli na vadada venyu kukolela kwa Yisaya muloli va Mulungu hoavaga kulonga ndongwa tsila kuta,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Ubite ukavalonjele vanu vano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">mukuva munhulika, lechelelo simukuva munkwelewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">mukuva munlola, lechelelo simukuva munguchitsela chila cho munguchiwona,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />kwasawuli vanu vano numbula tsawo tsiveye nalamu, na mapulichilo gawo gadibe, na miho gawe gabofwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Yikayive siyo ihyo vakakulola kwa miho gawo, na kuhulika kwa mapulichilo gawo, na kwa numbula tsawo vakakutsela na kumituchila heni Mulungu vawo, na heni ntsika kuvaponetsa.<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Kaha Pawulo akalongaje, “Duve ntsin'gana henye mutsele kuta ndongwa tsa Mulungu tsa wukuluso tsisindikwe kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi. Vene iwo vakutsihulikitsa!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Nayo Pawulo hoavaga kusinda kulonga ndongwa tsino, Vayawudi vakawukaje kuno vangiputsa vene kwa vene ndongwa ntsolofu.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa luvala lwa myaka jivili Pawulo akikalaje kuko ku nyumba yo avaga apantsile, kuno anguvalibulitsa vanu veka wo vabitaga kumulola. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Nayo avikulaga ndongwa tsa Wuntsajila wa Mulungu bila kuva na muloto, na kudahitsa ndongwa tsa Mutwa Yesu Chilisito, bila kulemetswa na munu yoyuve.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>